#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr ""
"\"Juste une égratignure\"? Pansez-la et n'oubliez pas de la désinfecter "
"comme même pour accélérer le processus de guérison."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr ""
"Une porte n'est pas la seule entrée ou sortie de la plupart des endroits."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr ""
"Un estomac plein ne vous évitera pas de mourir de faim. Donnez vous le temps "
"de digérer et mangez régulièrement."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A pillow or stuffed animal will make it easier to fall asleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr ""
"Un survivant qui vous doit la vie est un nouvel ami de gagné… La plupart du "
"temps..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Adhesive bandages are much quicker to use, but not as effective - perfect "
"for minor wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Peur des animaux sauvages ? Vous pouvez leur crier dessus jusqu'à ce qu'ils "
"décampent, mais faîtes attention à ce que vous pourriez attirer à leur place."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be "
"exploited."
msgstr ""
"Un ennemi blindé? N'abandonnez pas, il y a peut-être une faiblesse que vous "
"pourriez exploiter."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr ""
"Les animaux et les zombies ne sont pas des amis. Vous pouvez tirer avantage "
"de ceci."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr ""
"Une balle a touchée votre artère? Un tourniquet pourrait vous empêcher de "
"vous vider de tout votre sang."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Aspirin and ibuprofen don't stack with each other, but most other pain "
"medication does."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Athletics skill helps with swimming, climbing, and max stamina.  Don't "
"neglect it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully "
"customizable too."
msgstr ""
"Les paramètres de ramassage automatique peuvent vous aider à gagner du temps "
"dans de nombreuses situations et sont personnalisables. "

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Balance armor versus encumbrance, and try not to wear bags in combat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Bare ground is hard to sleep on and will make you much colder.  Try "
"gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial "
"in the long run."
msgstr ""
"Faites attention à votre alimentation, un régime adéquat est nécessaire pour "
"votre survie sur le long terme."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a "
"master in specific areas."
msgstr ""
"Être qualifié(e) ne signifie pas être apte. Améliorez vos aptitudes pour "
"devenir un maître dans des domaines spécifiques."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Being wet makes the cold far worse.  Find some rainproof gear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Binoculars make it easier to scout the terrain, gun scopes work too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Blinded creatures can still detect you in melee, and will remember where "
"they last saw you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to "
"utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr ""
"Les livres contiennent du savoir théorique et bien souvent des recettes. "
"Vous aurez besoin de pratique pour les utiliser. Entraînez-vous."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better "
"tech for it."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un bras ou une jambe brisé? Une attelle improvisée peut vous aider "
"à guérir plus vite, mais peut être qu'une visite à l’hôpital serait une "
"bonne idée pour trouver une meilleure alternative?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Cameras can blind enemies with their flash in melee.  Say cheese and die!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have "
"components right now."
msgstr ""
"Jetez un œil à votre menu de fabrication pour savoir ce que vous pouvez "
"fabriquer de temps en temps, même si vous n'avez pas les ingrédients "
"nécessaires entre vos mains."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr ""
"Garder votre nourriture froide permet de la garder comestible plus "
"longtemps. Trouvez un réfrigérateur, un congélateur, un sous-sol frais ou "
"construisez un cellier."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Construction can be a good way to gain your first rank of mechanics and "
"electronics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop "
"bench."
msgstr ""
"Fabriquer quelque chose est plus simple et ainsi plus rapide si vous avez un "
"espace dédié pour le faire, et préférablement un vrai établi."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crouching is quieter than walking and will let you hide behind some "
"furniture."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crouching or going prone make you harder to hit in ranged combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pris \"que\" tout ce que n'était pas cloué au sol? Faites une "
"deuxième passe pour récupérer tout les clous que vous avez laissés!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your "
"game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr ""
"Expérimenter avec des scénarios, professions, hobbies et personnages "
"différents peut vous aider à renouveler votre enthousiasme pour le jeu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different enemies require different weapons.  Diversify your loadout, and "
"always have a backup"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the "
"opponents."
msgstr ""
"Disséquer des corps vous aidera à améliorer vos connaissances sur les points "
"faibles de vos adversaires. "

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr ""
"Ne soyez pas trop téméraire, toute ces choses ne vous serviront pas à grand "
"chose si elles vous font passer l'arme à gauche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr ""
"Ne vous battez pas lorsque vous n'avez aucune chance. Il n'y a pas de honte "
"à fuir pour survivre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't get surrounded!  Always have an exit plan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't smoke in bed!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't wait until it's too late!  Run away and live to fight another day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction "
"and overdose."
msgstr ""
"Consommer des drogues peut être un bon moyen d'améliorer votre moral "
"rapidement, ainsi que dans certains cas, améliorer votre performance, mais "
"prenez gare au risque d'addiction et d'overdose."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr ""
"Mourir fait partie de l’expérience. Essayez de nouveau avec un autre "
"personnage et apprenez de vos erreurs."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Mangez bien ou votre santé pourrait en souffrir. La malbouffe n'est bonne "
"qu'à modération."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Enemies can see you peeking, but they won't get a chance to shoot you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Chaque sensei a d'abord été un élève. Les PNJs peuvent vous former et "
"inversement."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Excessive item counts in proximity to your character can cause slowdown.  "
"Don't be a hoarder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Exercising daily increases your cardio fitness and therefore your stamina "
"pool."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal pipe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling bad after waking up?  Exercise and clean living are key to a healthy "
"lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  "
"Heal now, explore later."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes pas au top de votre forme? Vous reposer pour quelques jours "
"serait probablement une bonne idée, le monde peut attendre un moment pendant "
"que vous vous rétablissez."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to "
"your advantage."
msgstr ""
"Imposez vos conditions partout où le pouvez. Utilisez le terrain, les pièges "
"et le feu à votre avantage."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight smarter, not harder.  Even simple traps can turn the tide in your "
"favor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with an abundance of fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr ""
"La nourriture d'avant le Cataclysme ne sera pas là éternellement. Gardez ça "
"en tête."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a "
"practice target."
msgstr ""
"Jetez un coup d'œil au menu de construction, parmi beaucoup d'autres projets "
"figurent: un emplacement de fabrication, un tas de bois, et une cible "
"d'entrainement."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Foraging isn't easy.  It takes survival skill, perception, and a lot of luck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr ""
"Les aliments gelés ne pourrissent pas, mais la plupart d'entre eux seront "
"difficiles, désagréables ou juste impossibles à consommer avant d'être "
"décongelés."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up by activating a pan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Going prone can make it harder for shrapnel to hit you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grabbed enemies can't dodge. If something won't sit still, try making it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grenades create very fine shrapnel which isn't great against armor.  "
"Pipebombs on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Handguns are powerful and easy to use even when you're badly wounded.  "
"Always keep one handy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Holsters, quivers, sheaths, and ammo pouches can be much faster than using a "
"backpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities "
"can save the day."
msgstr ""
"Espérez le mieux mais attendez-vous au pire. Toujours paqueter certains "
"objets essentiels peut vous sauver la mise."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If a wound gets dirty, find some antiseptic quick!  Infections can be deadly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If it's too dark to see, you'll suffer penalties to dodge, melee, and aiming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If the weather's too bad, you might just want to stay home."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you like archery but lack the strength, consider a crossbow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr ""
"Si vous entrez par effraction, soyez aussi sûr(e) de savoir comment "
"ressortir."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr ""
"Si vous êtes forcé(e) de rester à la maison le temps de ressouder une "
"fracture de jambe, vous pourriez utiliser le temps mort pour entamer la pile "
"de bouquins que vous avez collectée et peut être apprendre des choses utiles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Injuries take longer to heal the worse they are.  Don't overdo it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Insecticide is really good at killing bugs, even the big ones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It can take days or even weeks to put on weight after you've lost too much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to keep books around the house.  You never know when you'll "
"be laid up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr ""
"Juste parce qu'un endroit est dangereux ne veut pas dire qu'il vaut la peine "
"d'être pillé."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Just because they're all monsters doesn't mean they're friends.  Take "
"advantage of infighting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep a few spare weapons and pieces of armor around your base.  Switching is "
"easier than repairing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Gardez vos objets indispensables dans les poches de vos vêtements dans le "
"cas où vous avez besoin d'abandonner votre sac à dos pour sauver votre peau."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you "
"get them faster."
msgstr ""
"La théorie ne remplacera pas la pratique ni l'expérience, mais elle vous "
"permettra d'acquérir ceux-ci plus rapidement."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Large targets are easier to hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O "
"to sort items."
msgstr ""
"Apprenez à utiliser le gestionnaire de zones pour facilement ranger votre "
"butin. Appuyez sur Y pour définir vos zones et sur O pour ranger vos objets."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr ""
"Débutant(e)? Jetez un coup d'œil au menu de raccourcis clavier et "
"familiarisez-vous avec les fonctionnalités du jeu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr ""
"La longueur compte… au moins quand il s'agit de faire rentrer une pelle dans "
"son sac à dos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's the sight, noise, or smell of the "
"living."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez parier? Ingérez du mutagène au hazard! Soyez un gagnant "
"aujourd'hui!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr ""
"Vous prévoyez un long trajet? Utilisez la marche automatique ou la conduite "
"automatique pour arriver à votre destination avec moins d'effort."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez perdu(e) beaucoup de sang? Buvez beaucoup, trouvez des suppléments "
"de fer, et reposez-vous pour donner du temps à vos globules rouges de se "
"régénérer."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Les armes de fortune se cassent rapidement, mais peuvent dans la plupart des "
"cas facilement être réparées ou remplacées."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what "
"you can do with them."
msgstr ""
"Beaucoup d'objets peuvent avoir des fonctions assez niches. Ouvrer le menu "
"d'actions d'objet pour voir pour quoi cet objet peut vous être utile."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr ""
"Beaucoup d'objets ont des actions spéciales. Essayez de trouver ce qu'ils "
"font."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items "
"and drop them in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez labelliser les objets que vous voulez garder sur vous comme "
"favoris pour les distinguer des objets que vous n'allez porter que "
"temporairement."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "L'élan n'est pas forcément votre ami."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most adults are too heavy to climb drainpipes, so go find or make a "
"stepladder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des médicaments n'agissent pas instantanément, alors n'avalez pas "
"toutes les pilules du flacon d'un seul coup."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des zombies essaieront de vous poursuivre à travers un obstacle "
"comme, par example, une voiture, au lieu de le contourner. Souvenez-vous de "
"ceci pendant une poursuite."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Murky water is unsafe to drink, water might be safe, clean water is always "
"safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutagen can dramatically improve your stats.  Bionics can help a little, too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutant meat is toxic, but surely a little bit would be OK."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutant meat isn't good for you, but if you're hungry, surely you can eat "
"just a little…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master "
"the ins and outs."
msgstr ""
"Besoin de gagner en expérience en fabrication ou une autre compétence? "
"Utilisez les recettes d'entrainement pour maitriser le sujet sur le bout de "
"vos doigts."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply "
"pressure to the wound."
msgstr ""
"Pas de bandages à proximité? Gardez vos mains libres et restez en place pour "
"automatiquement faire pression sur la plaie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash "
"cards!"
msgstr ""
"Personne n'a dit distributeurs automatiques que l'apocalypse s'était "
"produite. Pensez-y la prochaine fois que vous mettez la main sur une carte "
"bancaire!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a hit from a very fast car."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes à court d'ingrédients? Briser ou désassembler des objets peut vous "
"aider à renouveler votre stock."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Over the counter pain medication is weak, but it's not habit forming. It may "
"keep you in the fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for "
"unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr ""
"L'excès de confiance tue. Gardez un peu plus d'endurance,  de points de vie "
"et d'équipement qu'il est strictement nécessaire en cas d'imprévus."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed "
"in the character menu."
msgstr ""
"La douleur peut vous ralentir dramatiquement et réduit aussi vos attributs. "
"Vous pouvez jeter un coup d'œil à votre vitesse actuelle dans le menu de "
"personnage."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain medication doesn't reduce pain, it is a buffer against it for the "
"entirety of its duration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't "
"chew."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez vos combats et ne les laissez pas vous choisir. N'ayez pas les "
"yeux plus gros que le ventre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Poison, radiation, and blood loss will negatively impact your lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez choisir de jouer un PNJ allié et ainsi le contrôler plus "
"directement, ou l'utiliser si votre personnage originel meurt."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Priorities for survival: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss "
"of productivity."
msgstr ""
"La fatigue physique prolongée provoque de la lassitude. Travailler trop "
"entraîne une perte de productivité."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr ""
"Placer en entonnoir sur une bouteille ou un baril peut vous permettre de "
"collecter de l'eau de pluie ou de rosée progressivement."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Rain ponchos are lightweight, easy to store, and can keep you dry in a storm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and "
"removed from it."
msgstr ""
"Rappelez-vous que la barre latérale est personnalisable et que ses widgets "
"peuvent être attachés et détachés à volonté."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr ""
"La routine tue. Restez sur vos gardes! Ne vous laissez pas bercer par "
"l'habitude."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire "
"to boil it."
msgstr ""
"Gagnez du temps. Au lieu d'utiliser une recette, mettez de l'eau dans un "
"conteneur non-inflammable sur un feu pour la faire bouillir."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr ""
"Peur du corps à corps? Jetez des objets sur vos ennemis ou utilisez une arme "
"avec de la portée comme une lance."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve "
"it when you can."
msgstr ""
"Garder un œil sur son endurance est crucial pour survivre plus longtemps. "
"Vous devriez toujours en garder en réserve en cas d'imprévu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some animals can be tamed, especially when young.  Try finding some pet food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some mutations allow you to leap.  This makes it easy to get out of melee, "
"or up onto a roof."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some negative traits have their upsides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes you just can't run.  Always try to keep a handgun on you for "
"emergencies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Spraypaint can be used to blind enemies, and is especially effective against "
"robots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Stun guns will cause even zombies to release their grabs, but effectiveness "
"falls off with size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Switching to a sidearm is often faster than reloading."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Tear gas stuns anything that breathes.  It blinds anything with eyes, except "
"robots and arthropods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr ""
"Toute case capable de ralentir votre mouvement ralenti aussi le mouvement de "
"vos ennemis."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The Archer's Form proficiency lowers the strength requirement on bows by up "
"to 6."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some "
"rare actions there."
msgstr ""
"Le menu d'actions peut vous aider à determiner ce que vous pouvez faire. Il "
"y a un nombre d'actions rares qui vont sont disponibles à l'intérieur."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr ""
"La meilleure arme à feu au monde n'est pas grand chose de plus qu'un gourdin "
"si vous n'êtes pas capable de la garder approvisionnée en balles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr ""
"Une ville entière contient beaucoup de zombies, mais pas un nombre infini. "
"Avec beaucoup de persévérance il vous sera possible (éventuellement) de "
"vider les environs de voisins à problèmes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The worse you're hurt, the slower you'll heal. Try not to push yourself too "
"far."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are a million ways to use a garbage bag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are billions of them and one of you, but only you have a working brain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know "
"the difference."
msgstr ""
"Il y a des champignons que vous voudrez manger, et des champignons que vous "
"voudrez brûler. Vous pourrez probablement faire la différence quand vous les "
"rencontrerez."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  "
"Check them out."
msgstr ""
"Certaines commandes n'ont pas de touches assignées par défaut, mais peuvent "
"se prouver utiles dans certaines situations. N'oubliez pas de jeter un coup "
"d'œil au menu de raccourcis clavier!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Il doit bien y avoir des trucs cool dans ces laboratoires souterrains top "
"secrets, non?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr ""
"Il y a souvent plus d'une manière de faire quelque chose. Sortez des "
"sentiers battus."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr ""
"Déshydraté(e) après un longue randonnée hivernale? Avoir une thermos sur soi "
"est une bonne idée."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr ""
"Il fait trop froid lors de votre sommeil? Enfiler plusieurs couches de "
"vêtements sera probablement suffisant pour garder les nuits d'hiver "
"tolérables."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Trouble with sticky or slippery floors?  Try using them against your enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr ""
"Les habits et pièces d'équipement de pompier (aussi parfois appelés "
"ignifugés) protègent du feu mais pas des effets de la chaleur excessive "
"l'accompagnant."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Twohanded weapons are hard to use when things are grabbing you.  Keep "
"something smaller on hand too!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr ""
"Les espaces souterrains comme les caves ou les grottes restent frais toute "
"l'année."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Use the fire, sludge, and acid some enemies spread to your advantage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez votre carte judicieusement. Privilégiez les lieux où vous pourrez "
"piller ce dont vous avez besoin."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your "
"life."
msgstr ""
"La verticalité est importante. Si vous pouvez atteindre un toit d'une "
"manière ou d'une autre, cela pourrait vous sauver la vie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want less micro-management?  The zone manager can change your game."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want to protect your gear from acid?  Try wearing a raincoat over it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Weariness can be debilitating.  Don't go into combat if you're tired!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr ""
"Mouillé et en colère? Une serviette sèche saura vous rendre votre sourire. "

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr ""
"Lors ce que vous jetez un coup d'œil autour de vous, il vous est possible "
"d'appuyer sur T pour voyager automatiquement jusqu'à cette destination."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your "
"best friend."
msgstr ""
"Quand des villes entières deviennent votre supermarché, un caddie devient "
"votre meilleur ami."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of a rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better "
"quality of life."
msgstr ""
"Pour améliorer votre expérience de jeu, n'oubliez pas que vous pouvez "
"établir des règles de blacklist, whitelist et des filtres à objets."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific "
"items in them."
msgstr ""
"Où est donc encore parti mon briquet? Organisez vos conteneurs pour y ranger "
"des objets spécifiques."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi marcher quand vous pouvez utiliser une voiture? Ou un vélo? Ou des "
"rollers?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more "
"bullets."
msgstr ""
"Les survivants malins ne consomment pas de drogues... par ce qu'elles sont "
"simplement trop précieuses. Ils les troquent plutôt pour plus de munitions."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speed that up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for "
"your convenience."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez automatiser les tâches répétitives telles que la recherche de "
"nourriture, l'exploitation minière ou le nettoyage à votre convenance."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you "
"make when you move."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez vous accroupir ou vous allonger pour vous cacher derrière des "
"objets, cela réduira aussi le bruit que vous faites quand vous bougez."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez fabriquer des choses inhabituelles avec des objets du quotidien. "
"Passez en mode MacGyver si besoin."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez changer les paramètres du mode prudence dans le menu de pause."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can throw things while peeking around corners."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can use markers to rename items, making it easier to stay organized."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez maintenant utiliser votre souris dans votre inventaire et "
"quelque autres menus."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez utiliser votre souris pour vous déplacer vers une destination en "
"double-cliquant dessus."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question "
"mark (?) key."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez vérifier vos raccourcis clavier dans la plupart des menus en "
"appuyant sur la touche (?)."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas à vous asseoir juste à coté d'un feu pour l'utiliser."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You don't need to grab every piece of loot you see.  There's always more to "
"find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't win, you just do a little better each time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You won't use mutated body parts like fangs and horns to attack if they're "
"covered up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out.  Better yet, go prone first."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only "
"when you must."
msgstr ""
