#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "electric"
msgstr "électrique"

#. ~ Name of the damage type as displayed in item info
#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "fire"
msgstr "feu"

#. ~ A verb describing how this damage typeis applied (ex: "bashing")
#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "freezing"
msgstr "congélation"

#. ~ Name of the damage type as displayed in item info
#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "pure"
msgstr "pur"

#. ~ A verb describing how this damage typeis applied (ex: "bashing")
#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "shocking"
msgstr "électrocution"

#. ~ A verb describing how this damage typeis applied (ex: "bashing")
#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "shooting"
msgstr "tir"

#. ~ Name of the damage type as displayed in item info
#: data/json/damage_types.json
msgid "stab"
msgstr ""

#. ~ A verb describing how this damage typeis applied (ex: "bashing")
#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/damage_types.json data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "stabbing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A fond memory of throating some prey animal bubbles up."
msgstr "Un bon souvenir bouillonne d'avoir avalé une proie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A terrifyingly real dream has you killing game with your bare teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un rêve effroyablement réel vous fait vivre une chasse au gibier, que vous "
"tuez avec vos dents."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"A warm, sunny spot high up where you can watch your prey.  What a great "
"dream!"
msgstr ""
"Un endroit chaud et ensoleillé en hauteur où vous pourrez observer vos "
"proies. Quel grand rêve!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"After an exciting and tasty hunt, you retire to your nest.  Mmm, yes, nest."
msgstr ""
"Après une chasse passionnante et savoureuse, vous vous retirez dans votre "
"nid. Mmm, oui, nid."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"After recruiting a new packmate, you expand your spacious den to accommodate "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Après avoir recruté un nouveau compagnon de meute, vous agrandissez votre "
"tanière spacieuse pour l'accueillir."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Ah, the wolf-slaying dream again.  That's a good one…"
msgstr "Ah, encore le rêve de tuer des loups. C'en est une bonne…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "An unstoppable hunger like a black hole devours you from within."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "As you dream, your reflection looks rather catlike."
msgstr "Pendant que vous rêvez, votre reflet a l'air félin."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Boing!  and you've pounced another yummy critter."
msgstr ""
"Boing ! Et vous avez attrapé une autre délicieuse créature. Bon appétit !"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "FIGHT.  FEED.  FORWARD."
msgstr "COMBATTRE. MANGER. AVANCER."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Fire rages around you, licking at your bark and engulfing the saplings and "
"bushes near your roots.  The once chatty forest is quiet in its wake."
msgstr ""
"Le feu fait rage autour de vous, léchant votre écorce et engloutissant les "
"jeunes arbres et les buissons près de vos racines. La forêt autrefois "
"bavarde devenait mortellement silencieuse dans son sillage."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"For some reason you dream of your shoes.  They don't fit, and nothing seems "
"to help…"
msgstr ""
"Pour une raison quelconque, vous rêvez de vos chaussures. Ils ne "
"correspondent pas, et rien ne semble aider…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Hoof.  Talon.  Tooth.  Fight.  Feed.  Forward."
msgstr "Sabot. Talon. Dent. Combattre. Nourrir. Avancer."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In a dream you catch a glimpse of a strangely cattle-like image of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Lors d'un rêve vous apercevez une étrange image de vous même ressemblant à "
"un chat."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In a dream, you see a curiously birdlike reflection of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dans un rêve vous voyez un curieux reflet de vous sous une forme d'oiseau."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In the dream, you fatten yourself up with all the food you can find to "
"prepare for your next winter hibernation."
msgstr ""
"Dans le rêve, vous vous engraissez avec toute la nourriture que vous pouvez "
"trouver pour vous préparer à votre prochaine hibernation hivernale."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a group of rats that look almost like yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dans votre rêve vous voyez un groupe de rats qui sont pratiquement à votre "
"image."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a very spiderlike version of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dans votre rêve vous voyez une version de vous même pratiquement à forme "
"arachnoïde."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see an odd, slimy reflection of yourself."
msgstr "Dans votre rêve vous voyez une forme bizarre, gluante, de vous même."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream, you see a strangely fishlike image of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dans un rêve vous voyez une image de vous même avec une étrange apparence de "
"poisson."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you stalk and kill a young wolf, using only your teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"Dans votre rêve, vous traquez et tuez un jeune loup en utilisant uniquement "
"vos dents et vos griffes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams, you blindly run through the pipes of the city, navigating "
"the familiar byways via smell alone."
msgstr ""
"Dans vos rêves, vous courez aveuglément dans les tuyaux de la ville, "
"naviguant dans les rues familières grâce à votre odorat."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams, your fangs slip through flesh like scalpels.  You quickly "
"crawl away to let your clumsy prey bleed out."
msgstr ""
"Dans vos rêvez, vos crocs crèvent à travers la chair comme des scalpels et "
"vous vous faufilez rapidement à distance pour laisser votre proie pataude se "
"vider de son sang."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your sleep you feel verdant energy growing within you."
msgstr ""
"Dans votre sommeil, vous sentez une énergie verdoyante grandir en vous."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Mmm.  The shellfish dream again.  Yum!"
msgstr "Mmm. De nouveau un rêve de fruits de mer. Miam!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "NO!  You will not allow this corruption to prevail!"
msgstr "NON! Vous ne permettrez pas à cette corruption de prévaloir!"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Non-Mycus sometimes reject the Marloss.  Our colonial efforts flourish with "
"broad-minded guidance."
msgstr ""
"Les non-Mycus rejettent parfois les Marloss. Nos efforts coloniaux "
"s'épanouissent avec un encadrement large d'esprit."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Oh boy!  This hidey hole sure is swell."
msgstr "Oh là là ! Ce trou caché est vraiment génial."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "On land and in the water, you control all that your tongue can reach."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Once we finish the burrow we'll settle down and start a little family.  "
"Maybe just a dozen boys and a dozen girls.  Nice and cosy."
msgstr ""
"Quand on aura fini le terrier, on s'installera et on fondera une petite "
"famille. Peut-être juste une douzaine de garçons et une douzaine de filles. "
"Sympa et chaleureux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Our colonists are limitless.  We shall adapt to this world, as we adapt to "
"all."
msgstr ""
"Nos colons sont illimités. Nous nous adapterons à ce monde, comme nous nous "
"adaptons à tous."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow add together, don't they?"
msgstr "Le rouge, le bleu et le jaune se mélangent, n'est-ce pas ?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow cancel each other out, don't they?"
msgstr "Le rouge, le bleu et le jaune s'annulent, n'est-ce pas?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Regret haunts your dreams, for your past wrongs real or imagined."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Sneaky sneak under the floorboards.  We will sneak all their crumbs for us.  "
"But later, back to sleep for now."
msgstr ""
"Se faufiler en douce sous les lattes du plancher. Nous ramasserons en douce "
"toutes leurs miettes pour nous. Mais plus tard, retour au sommeil pour le "
"moment."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Something chases you through a maze of unfamiliar tunnels.  At last, it has "
"you cornered, so you turn around and show it your teeth…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The herd moves along and you with them, finding greener pastures."
msgstr ""
"Le troupeau se déplace et vous avec eux, trouvant des pâturages plus verts"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The seething masses attempt to wall non-Mycus away from the Marloss.  We "
"will adapt and defeat them."
msgstr ""
"Les masses bouillonnantes tentent d'éloigner les non-Mycus des Marloss. Nous "
"nous adapterons et les vaincrons."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The thought of being out of water, forced to crawl unsupported, terrifies "
"you."
msgstr ""
"La pensée d'être hors de l'eau, obligé de ramper sans support, vous terrifie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The transition from your lifelike dreams of living as a plant to reality "
"shocks you."
msgstr ""
"La transition de vos rêves presque réels d'être une plante vous choque."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The walking plants seek to harness us as a food source.  We will not allow "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Les plantes ambulantes cherchent à nous exploiter comme source de "
"nourriture. Nous ne le permettrons pas."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The world can be whole again, and only you have the courage to make it so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The years seem to fly past as you dream of carving great underground "
"fastnesses."
msgstr ""
"Les années semblent s'envoler alors que vous rêvez de tailler de grands "
"dédales souterrains."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Tinnitus follows you into your dreams, where it becomes a chorus of crickets."
msgstr ""
"Un acouphène vous poursuit dans vos rêves, où celui-ci devient un chœur de "
"grillons."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We have been waiting a long time for a place such as this."
msgstr "Il y a longtemps que nous attendions un endroit comme celui-ci."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We will raise bountiful orchards and beautiful gardens."
msgstr "Nous allons cultiver des généreux vergers et des jardins magnifiques."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "When you wake up you panic about drowning from being out of water."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous vous réveillez vous paniquez à l'idée de vous oyez car vous "
"êtes hors de l'eau."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming you look into a mirror and see a frighteningly insectoid "
"reflection."
msgstr ""
"Lors de votre rêve vous regardez dans un miroir et constatez que votre "
"reflet a une terrifiante apparence insectoïde."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, a reflection of yourself appears almost like an octopus."
msgstr ""
"Lors de votre rêve, une image de vous même apparaît pratiquement comme une "
"pieuvre."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively lizard-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dans votre rêve vous voyez distinctement un reflet de vous même avec une "
"apparence de lézard."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively rabbit-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr ""
"En rêvant, vous voyez un reflet distinctif de vous-même, semblable à un "
"lapin."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself dressed in a hospital gown, receiving "
"treatment."
msgstr ""
"Lors de votre rêve vous vous voyez recevoir des traitements, habillé en "
"blouse de patient d'hôpital."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself in a pond, your face has widened and is "
"covered in mucus."
msgstr ""
"En rêvant, vous vous voyez dans un étang, votre visage s'est élargi et est "
"couvert de mucus."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself weighted down under massive backpack/tent "
"upon your back, as you pass by a mirrored surface."
msgstr ""
"Pendant que vous rêvez, vous vous voyez lesté sous un énorme sac à dos/tente "
"sur votre dos, alors que vous passez devant une surface en miroir."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Whilst dreaming, you see a disturbingly bestial version of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Lors de votre rêve vous voyez une version perturbante d'un vous bestial."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Will your burrow be warm enough for the family in winter?"
msgstr "Votre terrier sera-t-il assez chaud pour votre famille cet hiver ?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are acutely aware that most of you is sleeping, leaving you to "
"contemplate your situation as you rest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are confused by a plantlike image of yourself in a dream."
msgstr ""
"Dans un rêve vous êtes dérouté(e) par une image de vous même, semblable à "
"une plante."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are disturbed when your birdlike dreams are more lifelike than reality."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes perturbé que vos rêves d'oiseaux deviennent plus consistants que "
"la réalité."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are frightened of the outside after your vivid dream of cave life."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes effrayé par l'extérieur après un rêve criant de réalisme de vie en "
"caverne."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are many animals, and yet one."
msgstr "Vous êtes plusieurs animaux et pourtant vous êtes unique."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are perfect, and in your dreams, a million others just like you kneel "
"before your superiority."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming a lizard hybrid."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes terrifié par un rêve dans lequel vous devenez un lézard hybride."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of serving the hive queen mindlessly."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes terrifié par un rêve dans lequel vous servez la reine de la "
"fourmillière, sans réfléchir."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You blissfully recall days spent lounging in the sun."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous souvenez avec bonheur des jours passés à vous prélasser au soleil."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You can't quite work out what the dream is about… it just keeps changing."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez pas tout à fait comprendre de quoi parle le rêve… il ne cesse "
"de changer."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You creep along, your flexile body transforming shape and color to remain "
"hidden."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You crush those who would disagree with your leadership."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You curl up some more in your nest.  Geez, shredded paper really *is* comfy."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous enroulez un peu plus dans votre nid. Bon sang, le papier "
"déchiqueté est vraiment confortable."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the moon."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de la lune."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the zoo, for some reason."
msgstr "Pour une raison ou une autre votre rêve concerne un zoo."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream in smells more vivid than sight ever was."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream in sounds and smells, not images."
msgstr "Vous rêvez en bruit et odeurs et non pas en images."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a cold winter night.  Your jacket is too big to put on."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'une froide nuit d'hiver. Votre veste est trop grande pour être "
"portée."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a feast and excitedly chitter with your pincers… wait, what?"
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'un festin et gazouillez avec enthousiasme avec vos pinces… "
"hein, quoi?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a fortress, sheltering humanity from the zombies.  You're in "
"charge, of course."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'une forteresse, abritant l'humanité des zombies. Vous êtes "
"responsable, bien sûr."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a home in the forests."
msgstr "Vous rêvez d'une maison dans les bois."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a hospital where doctors try out experimental treatments."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'un hôpital où les médecins réalisent des traitements "
"expérimentaux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a massive block of cheese bigger than you."
msgstr "Vous rêvez d'un énorme bloc de fromage plus gros que vous."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a mate, and a dance, and a mother devoured by her own young."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange quest for a bush that grows gray apples."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'une quête étrange pour un buisson qui fait pousser des pommes "
"grises."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a vast dark ocean.  The thought of returning to it seems…"
"undesirable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a world one hundred million years gone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of an endless spiral you can't help but follow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being a primitive cave dweller."
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous êtes un troglodyte primitif."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being cozy in a dark place."
msgstr "Vous rêvez d'être confortable dans un endroit sombre."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of being in two places at once, and four, and yet you are all a "
"greater whole."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being swaddled safe in the embrace of the soil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of blood and guts.  For some reason, it makes you feel weirdly "
"excited."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de sang et de tripes. Pour une raison quelconque, cela vous fait "
"vous sentir étrangement excité."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of brushing the fur on your back against a tree."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de brosser la fourrure de votre dos contre un arbre."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of chasing a beautiful butterfly."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de poursuivre un papillon magnifique."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of communing with an ancient pine.  Trees are the true survivors "
"of this world, it tells you."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez que vous communier avec un vieux pin. Les arbres sont les vrais "
"survivants de ce monde et représente l'avenir, il vous l'assure."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of cracking seeds with your beak and swallowing them dry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of crawling along the world when you realize you can see three "
"hundred and sixty degrees around yourself."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de ramper à travers le monde quand vous réalisez que vous pouvez "
"voir à trois cent soixante degrés autour de vous."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of crushing zombies with your pincer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of curling up inside a shell to sleep."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de vous blottir dans une coquille pour dormir."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of cutting yourself with a knife and watch in fascination as it "
"heals in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de vous couper avec un couteau et de le regarder avec fascination "
"guérir en quelques secondes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of death, always at your heels, and your flesh changing to escape "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of defending the herd from a pack of predators."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of digging a hole under a hill to make your home."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de creuser un trou sous une colline pour en faire votre maison."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of finally finding the perfect place to make your den."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez qu'enfin vous trouvez l'endroit parfait pour construire votre "
"tanière. "

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of flying."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de voler."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of foraging in the woods… mouth-first?"
msgstr "Vous rêvez de butiner dans les bois… la bouche la première?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of friends and family crowded around, chattering noisily, grooming "
"one another, and sharing blood."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'être entouré(e) par une foule de vos amis et votre famille en "
"train de discuter joyeusement, de se s'entrenettoyer et de partager du sang."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grabbing something in an oversized claw."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de saisir quelque chose avec une pince surdimensionnée."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grazing in an open field."
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous pâturez dans un pré."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of having that success you knew you deserved, back before all this."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez que vous avez le succès que vous saviez mériter, avant tout ça."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of jumping the gate and leading your herd to freedom."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de sauter la porte et de mener votre troupeau vers la liberté."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of laying eggs in the soft soil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of leaping from the water to catch your prey."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de sauter hors de l'eau pour attraper votre proie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living as a terrifying octopus mutant."
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous êtes un effroyable poulpe mutant."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living deep inside a dark cave."
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous vivez au fond d'une caverne noire."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living on the ocean floor."
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous habitez au fond de l'océan."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of outrunning the apocalypse."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de distancer l'apocalypse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of pursuing and killing a rat, for some reason."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de poursuivre et de tuer un rat, pour une raison quelconque."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of ravens calling as you pad away from the remains of a kill."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of recruiting a cult of fishfolk to serve your needs."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de recruter un culte de gens de la mer pour répondre à vos "
"besoins."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of rotten food, decomposed until it's almost mush."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of running down familiar streets and rooftops, mentally mapping "
"out every escape route as you go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of sharing your roots with a vast forest, all plants provided for "
"as the canopy grows ever upwards."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de partager vos racines avec une vaste forêt, dans la quelle "
"toutes les plantes seraient prises en charge avec la canopée s'élèvant "
"toujours plus haut."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of sneaking into someone's home to listen to them sleep."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de vous infiltrer dans la maison de quelqu'un pour les écouter "
"dormir."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of something biting you but being stopped by your hard outer shell."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de quelque chose se brisant les dents en essayant de mordre votre "
"coquille extérieure."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of something flashing in the distant dark, and you understand "
"every word."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of stalking some sort of lizard… no, that can't be right, can it?"
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de traquer une sorte de lézard… non, ça ne peut pas être vrai, "
"n'est-ce pas?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of standing still in the rain, drinking in the falling drops… with "
"your feet?"
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de rester immobile sous la pluie, de boire les gouttes qui "
"tombent… avec vos pieds?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of still waters, rain, and a chorus of voices raised in song."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of swimming in the open ocean"
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous nagez au milieu de l'océan."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into a fresh kill."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de vous lancer dans une nouvelle tuerie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into your prey, and the sweet taste of raw flesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of the buzzing of a fly that you cannot see.  It makes you hungry."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez du bourdonnement d'une mouche que vous ne pouvez pas voir. Ça "
"donne faim."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the changeling.  Again."
msgstr "Vous rêvez du changelin. Encore."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the crack of bone and the taste of raw meat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt to end all hunts."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de la chasse pour mettre fin à toutes les chasses."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt, the feed, and your pack."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de la chasse, du fourrage et de votre meute."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the moon and feel a sudden urge to howl."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de la lune et ressentez une soudaine envie de hurler."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the sun shining down on your leaves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the tropics."
msgstr "Vous rêvez des tropiques."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of walking along the sea floor."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de marcher au fond de l'océan."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of warm breath and fresh blood."
msgstr "Vous rêvez d'haleines chaudes et de sang frais."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of washing your hands and face."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of your legions of undead admirers, their attentions, and the "
"wonderful pain."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de vos légions d'admirateurs morts-vivants, de leurs attentions "
"et de la douleur merveilleuse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of your wings carrying you through the night sky, and the "
"comforting presence of moon and stars above."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of… sneaking."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de… vous faufiler."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you are lithe in the sunlight and radiant with grace."
msgstr "Vous rêvez que vous êtes souple au soleil et rayonnant de grâce."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream you crawl out from under a rock.  And then immediately crawl back "
"in."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez que vous sortez de dessous un rocher. Et puis immédiatement "
"ramper en dessous."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you're safely at home with a bustling family."
msgstr "Vous rêvez d'être en sécurité chez vous avec votre large famille."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You easily bound from the street to a roof…oh, only a dream."
msgstr ""
"Vous bondissez aisément de la rue à un toit... oh, ce n'est qu'un rêve."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You excitedly web up an interloper and prepare to feast… nope, dream."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes tout excité à l'idée d'attraper un intrus et de vous préparer à "
"festoyer... nope, c'est un rêve."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel a yearning…"
msgstr "Vous ressentez une envie..."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel beautiful, and yet riven with worry…"
msgstr "Vous vous sentez belle, et pourtant déchirée par l'inquiétude…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel like you're cracking a combination lock."
msgstr "Vous avez l'impression de forcer une serrure à combinaison."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel nothing but disgust as you dream of strangling your old self."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel warm."
msgstr "Vous avez chaud."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel… OK."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez… OK."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You find it hard to control your limbs after dreaming of amorphous blob life."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez des difficultés à contrôler vos membres après avoir rêvé être une "
"forme de vie amorphe."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You find it hard to wake from a vivid dream of grazing on a farm."
msgstr ""
"Vous éprouvez des difficultés à vous réveiller d'un rêve dans lequel vous "
"étiez en train de paître dans une ferme."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You flutter through the air, listening for echoes to guide you through your "
"dream."
msgstr ""
"Vous virevoltez dans l'air, écoutant des échos vous guidant à travers votre "
"rêve. "

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting and warm dream of living as a rabbit."
msgstr "Vous avez un rêve réconfortant et chaleureux de vivre comme un lapin."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "Vous faites le rêve réconfortant de nager avec un banc de poissons."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing and scary dream of becoming a plant."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve dérangeant et effrayant dans lequel vous devenez une "
"plante."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing dream of growing in a garden."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites le rêve déroutant d'être une plante poussant dans un jardin."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream about running from dogs."
msgstr "Vous faites un rêve troublant où vous fuyez des chiens."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of bathing in the sun on a rock."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve dérangeant à propos de rester au soleil sur un rocher."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of eating insects."
msgstr "Vous faites un rêve troublant de manger des insectes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of living in a supermarket lobster tank."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve dérangeant où vous passez votre vie dans un vivier de "
"supermarché."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of someone invading your territory."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve troublant de quelqu'un envahissant votre territoire."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve dérangeant dans lequel vous nagez parmi un banc de "
"poissons."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of undergoing strange medical procedures."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve dérangeant dans lequel vous subissez d'étranges "
"procédures médicales."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a lizard."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve qui ressemble de manière dérangeante à la vie réelle "
"sauf que vous y êtes un lézard."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a dream of doctors and nurses doing unnatural things to your body, "
"which brings you perverse pleasure."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez que des docteurs et des infirmières font des choses contre nature "
"à votre corps, et vous en éprouvez un plaisir pervers."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a dream of working in a hive."
msgstr "Vous rêvez travailler dans une ruche."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a horrible nightmare of being caught out in the sunlight."
msgstr "Vous faites un horrible cauchemar d'être en plein soleil."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare of being all alone, but then your family flies home to "
"comfort you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un cauchemar où vous êtes seul(e), mais votre famille rentre "
"promptement à la maison pour vous réconforter."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a puckish dream."
msgstr "Vous avez un rêve elfique."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a realistic dream of flying south with your flock for the winter."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de manière très réaliste que vous migrez dans le sud avec votre "
"volée."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about animals."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos d'animaux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about bears."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos d'ours."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about being a patient in a frightening hospital."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve étrange dans lequel vous êtes un patient dans un hôpital "
"effrayant."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about being the Easter Bunny."
msgstr "Vous rêvez étrangement d'être le Lapin de Pâques."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about birds."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos d'oiseaux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about cats."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de chats."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about cattle."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de bétail."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about crabs."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de crabes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about fish."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de poissons."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about frogs in a pond near your childhood home."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve étrange à propos de grenouilles dans un étang près de la "
"maison de votre enfance."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about insects."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos d'insectes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about living in a cave."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de la vie en caverne."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about lizards."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de lézards."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about plants."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de plantes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rabbits."
msgstr "Vous faites un rêve étrange à propos de lapins."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rats."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de rats."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about sea creatures."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de créatures marines."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about slime."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos d'une substance gluante."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about snails and slugs in your garden."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve étrange d'escargots et de limaces dans votre jardin."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about spiders."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos d'araignées."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about wolves."
msgstr "Vous faites un étrange rêve à propos de loups."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of carrying a house on your back."
msgstr "Vous rêvez étrangement de porter une maison sur votre dos."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of living in sludge."
msgstr "Vous faites un rêve étrange dans lequel vous vivez dans la boue."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of spinning webs."
msgstr "Vous avez un rêve étrange où vous tissez des toiles."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream."
msgstr "Vous faites un rêve étrange."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a vivid dream of being a medical anomaly, as your heartbeat syncs "
"with the steady drip of an IV line."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve saisissant de réalisme, dans lequel vous êtes une "
"anomalie médical; votre coeur est synchronisé avec le battement de votre "
"perfusion intra-veineuse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of hunting in the woods."
msgstr "Vous faites un rêve très clair de vous chassant dans les bois."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of shedding your carapace.  It feels good."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un rêve vivide de muer votre carapace. Vous vous sentez bien."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have an upsetting dream about falling and being unable to get back up."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un rêve frustrant où vous tombez et n'êtes pas capable de remonter "
"là où vous étiez."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have strange dreams of soaring through the sky."
msgstr "Vous avez des rêves étranges de vous élancer vers le ciel."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You hear the sirens again, but this time you stay in your hole in the wall.  "
"Nobody will think to look there!"
msgstr ""
"Vous entendez à nouveau les sirènes, mais cette fois vous restez dans votre "
"trou dans le mur. Personne ne pensera à regarder là !"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You howl loud and long, ecstatic after securing a whole cache of supplies."
msgstr ""
"Vous hurlez fort et longtemps, extatique après avoir sécurisé toute une "
"cache de fournitures."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You leap from rooftop to rooftop, effortlessly avoiding your pursuers while "
"making your way to safety."
msgstr ""
"Vous sautez de toit en toit, évitant sans effort vos poursuivants tout en "
"vous mettant en sécurité."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You lie in a pile with your brothers and sisters.  Someone keeps moving "
"around, nearly waking you up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You pant, terrified at the thought of that FUNGUS destroying your home!"
msgstr ""
"Vous haletez, terrifié à l'idée que ce CHAMPIGNON détruise votre maison !"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You relax in your web; it's not vibrating, so dinner hasn't arrived yet."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous détendez dans votre toile ; elle ne vibre pas, le dîner n'est donc "
"pas encore arrivé."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You scream in fear while you dream of being chased by a cat"
msgstr "Vous hurlez de peur alors que vous rêvez être pourchassé par un chat."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You see yourself reflected in the beauty of the forest."
msgstr "Vous vous voyez reflété dans la beauté de la forêt."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You see yourself, five years from now, as the leader of a successful city."
msgstr "Vous vous voyez, dans cinq ans, être le chef d'une ville prospère."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sit at the bottom of the sea, staring without thought at all the world "
"passing by overhead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sneak into a house, only to discover a full, intact cupboard of cat food!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You startle as the shadow of a bird passes over your web, but it's only a "
"dream."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You stir, saddened that your beautiful hatchlings were only a dream."
msgstr ""
"Vous remuez, attristé que vos magnifiques éclosions ne soient qu'un rêve."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You swim with fish.  You fly with birds.  You run with the beasts of the "
"land.  You change with the changing of seasons.  You are everything."
msgstr ""
"Vous nagez avec des poissons. Vous volez avec des oiseaux. Vous courez avec "
"les bêtes de la terre. Vous changez avec le changement des saisons. Vous "
"êtes tout."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste iron all night long, like you've bitten your tongue."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un goût métallique dans la bouche pendant toute la nuit, comme si "
"vous aviez mordu votre langue."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste the blood of another, and know that it will be yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a slaughterhouse by a farmer."
msgstr "Vous cauchemardez être emmené par un fermier vers un abattoir."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in a web and consuming insects."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez, de façon réaliste, de vivre dans des toiles et de consommer des "
"insectes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in the sewers."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de manière saisissante que vous vivez dans les égouts."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of running with your pack, hunting a wild animal."
msgstr ""
"Votre rêve dépeint de manière saisissante une course poursuite que vous "
"faites, votre sac à dos sur vos épaules, après un animal sauvage."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of sharing a kill with your pack."
msgstr "Vous rêvez vivement de partager une mise à mort avec votre meute."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wake up with your legs pumping as you hop along in your sleep."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous réveillez avec vos jambes qui pompent après avoir sautillé pendant "
"que vous dormiez."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You weave between the zombies' legs, too small for them to catch.  The gas "
"station isn't far now, with all its soda and chips and- UGH, dream…"
msgstr ""
"Tu te faufiles entre les jambes des zombies, trop petit pour qu'ils puissent "
"t'attraper. La station service n'est plus très loin, avec ses sodas, ses "
"chips et... Ouch, le rêve..."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You were once many cells living as one, now you are one living as many."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wish others could understand, and join your struggle…"
msgstr ""
"Vous souhaitez que d'autres puissent comprendre, et se joindre à votre "
"combat..."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You wonder if you could find one of those 'salmon runs', or if they were "
"just a legend…"
msgstr ""
"Vous vous demandez si vous pourriez trouver l'une de ces \"courses de "
"saumons\", ou s'il ne s'agissait que d'une légende…"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wonder if your nest will be good enough."
msgstr "Vous vous inquiétez si votre nid sera assez bon."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You've never felt so lithe and powerful."
msgstr "Vous ne vous êtes jamais senti aussi souple et puissant."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your body flows slightly faster than you expected… oh, just a dream."
msgstr ""
"Votre corps coule légèrement plus vite que prévu... oh, c'est juste un rêve."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your disturbingly lifelike dream has you pollinating plants."
msgstr ""
"Votre rêve, bouleversant car saisissant de réalité, vous plaçait dans la "
"peau d'un pollinisateur de plantes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream is filled with creatures, and yet all seem like you."
msgstr "Votre rêve est rempli de créatures mais elles vous ressemblent toutes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream of living in the dark for years is almost real."
msgstr ""
"Votre rêve de vivre dans le noir pendant des années semble être la réalité."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your… muzzle in "
"anticipation."
msgstr ""
"Votre rêve de piller une ruche géante vous fait lécher votre… museau par "
"anticipation."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-reflection is rather bearish."
msgstr "Votre reflet de rêve ressemble à un ours."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self looks competent and in control."
msgstr "Votre avatar onirique a l'air compétent et d'avoir le contrôle."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self's muzzle looks… wait, muzzle?"
msgstr "Le museau de votre moi de rêve a l'air… excusez-moi, museau?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dreams are simple.  Movement among the leaves, your heart pounding as "
"you leap through the air, satisfaction when your claws find purchase."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams contain a croaking concerto."
msgstr "Vos rêves contiennent un concerto coassant."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a rough furry feeling."
msgstr "Dans vos rêves vous avez"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a sleek furry feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous donnent une sensation de fourrure lisse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange chitinous feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation chitineuse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange content, furry feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves on un contenu étrange, sensation duveteuse"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange feathered feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation de plumes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange furry feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation duveuteuse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange fuzzy feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation de confusion."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange plantlike feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation végétale."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange reclusive feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous donnent un étrange sentiment de reclus."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange scaly feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent un étrange sentiment écailleux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange shelled feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sentiment de carcinisation."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange slimy feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation visqueuse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange webbed feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation soyeuse."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent une étrange sensation humide."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet, scaly feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous laissent un étrange et humide sentiment écailleux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a thick furry feeling."
msgstr "Vos rêves vous donnent une sensation de fourrure épaisse"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you an oddly medicated feeling."
msgstr ""
"Vos rêves vous donnent une sensation bizarre d'être sous traitement "
"médicamenteux."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams leave you feeling like something is stuck to you."
msgstr ""
"Vos rêves vous donnent l'impression que quelque chose est collé à vous."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams of fully turning into a spider frighten you."
msgstr "Vos rêves de transformations totale en araignée vous effrayent."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dreams of living on the ocean floor seem more lifelike than reality."
msgstr ""
"Vos rêves de vivre dans les océans vous semblent plus tangibles que la "
"réalité."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams… are complex and multifaceted."
msgstr "Vos rêves… sont complexes et multiformes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your fangs sink into your prey, which struggles as your many legs embrace it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your heart is moved to breaking at the thought of all the lives lost, and "
"the struggle yet to come."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your lifelike dreams have you scavenging food with a pack of rats."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez des rêves terriblement vivants de recherche de nourriture avec une "
"horde de rats."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your mouth grows wider and wider, there's nothing you can't devour…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your mouth waters as you dream of eating dog food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your prey stares you down, unaware that your mate has already flanked it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your skin tastes the slime of another, and you follow the trail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your sleep is utterly dreamless for a time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your success in restoring civilization was only a dream.  For now."
msgstr ""
"Votre réussite à restaurer la civilisation n'était qu'un rêve. Pour "
"l'instant."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your vivid dream of living as a crustacean frightens you."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites un rêve vivide où vous vivez comme un crustacé et cela vous "
"effraie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your vivid dream of living as a slime blob frightens you."
msgstr "Votre rêve vif de vivre comme une goutte de boue vous effraie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your vivid dream of your pseudopods calcifying into rigid structures "
"terrifies you."
msgstr ""
"Votre rêve saisissant de vos pseudopodes se calcifiant en structures rigides "
"vous terrifie."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your warren is wiped out, your family lost.  It'll be OK, as long as you "
"survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Minor Bleeding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "'Tis but a scratch."
msgstr "Juste une égratignure!"

