#. ~ Description of furniture "indoor flagpole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A 2.5-meter tall flagpole on a weighted stand.  You could hoist up a flag "
"here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "rotary clothes dryer line"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A central metal pole holding up a wide rotating frame, this would be used to "
"hang up clothes to dry in the sunlight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "decorative tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "A decorative pine tree littered with ornaments for the winter holidays."
msgstr "Un pin décoratif parsemé d’ornements pour les vacances d’hiver."

#. ~ Description of furniture "pine wreath"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "A decorative wreath for the winter holidays."
msgstr ""
"Une couronne décorative utilisée comme décoration pour les fêtes d'hiver."

#. ~ Description of furniture "standing mirror"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminum frame."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "sand castle"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A glorious castle made of sand.  This mighty fortress will stand tall for "
"the ages to come, a true testament to the skills of its builder."
msgstr ""
"Une glorieuse forteresse de sable. Ce château imposant endurera les siècles "
"à venir, un témoignage véritable du talent de son architecte."

#. ~ Description of furniture "mannequin"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A life-size wooden figure of a person, most commonly used to display "
"clothing in stores, or for tailors to design outfits on.  Considering all "
"that's happened, something about it is somewhat unnerving."
msgstr ""
"Une figurine en bois grandeur nature représentant une personne, le plus "
"souvent utilisée pour exposer des vêtements dans les magasins ou pour que "
"les tailleurs puissent concevoir des tenues. Compte tenu de tout ce qui "
"s’est passé, il y a quelque chose de quelque peu déconcertant à propos de ça."

#. ~ Description of furniture "standing lamp"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A light mounted on the top of a metal pole, this would be plugged into a "
"wall socket to illuminate a room."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "statue"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A massive block of stone that has been carefully carved into a work of "
"timeless art."
msgstr ""
"Un bloc de pierre massif soigneusement sculpté pour en faire une œuvre d’art "
"intemporelle."

#. ~ Description of furniture "gazing ball"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A mirrored glass globe mounted on a cement pedestal.  It warps your "
"reflection when you look into it."
msgstr ""
"Un globe en verre miroir monté sur un socle en ciment. Cela déforme votre "
"reflet lorsque vous y regardez."

#. ~ Description of furniture "manacles"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "A pair of metal shackles with heavy chains mounted to a wall or floor."
msgstr ""
"Une paires de menottes reliées à des chaines extrêmement lourdes attachées à "
"un mur ou une section du sol."

#. ~ Description of furniture "bitts"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A pair of vertical iron posts mounted on a wharf, pier, or other form of "
"dock.  They are used to secure mooring lines, ropes, and similar."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de poteaux verticaux en fer montés sur un quai, une jetée ou toute "
"autre forme de quai. Ils sont utilisés pour sécuriser les amarres, les "
"cordages et autres."

#. ~ Description of furniture "cleat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A small horn cleat with two \"horns\" extending parallel to the deck or the "
"axis of the spar, and resembling a small anvil.  They are used to secure "
"mooring lines, ropes, and similar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "styling station"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A styling station, is a countertop with a mirror mounted above it and just "
"enough room and cubbies to store a stylist's equipment on it."
msgstr ""
"Un comptoir avec un miroir monté au-dessus et juste assez d'espace et de "
"casiers pour y ranger l'équipement d'un·e styliste."

#. ~ Description of furniture "birdbath"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A wide stone bowl mounted to a pedestal, usually filled with rainwater, "
"meant for birds to play or bathe in."
msgstr ""
"Un large bol en pierre monté sur un piédestal, généralement rempli d'eau de "
"pluie, destiné aux oiseaux pour jouer ou se baigner."

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken standing mirror"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"An aluminum frame for a full-length mirror, with most of the mirror "
"missing.  What remains in the frame are large, dangerous-looking shards of "
"fractured glass."
msgstr ""
"Un cadre en aluminium pour un miroir pleine longueur, avec la majeure partie "
"du miroir manquante. Ce qui reste dans le cadre sont de gros éclats de verre "
"fracturés d’apparence dangereuse."

#. ~ Description of furniture "lighthouse light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"Very high power, modern lighthouse LED light source with attached heatsinks."
msgstr ""

