#. ~ Description of furniture "fireplace"
#. ~ Description of furniture "stone fireplace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A common fixture for safely hosting a fire indoors, with a chimney to vent "
"the smoke to the outside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "portable stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A foldable metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or "
"heating food, and safe to use indoors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire barrel (200 L)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A huge metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes "
"punched in the sides for air supply."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire barrel (100 L)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A large metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes "
"punched in the sides for air supply."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "makeshift brazier"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A metal bucket with holes, in which you can safely start a fire.  It's too "
"small to fit any fuel item larger than some splintered wood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "brazier"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things."
msgstr ""
"Un plat métallique surélevé pour y brûler des objets en toute sécurité."

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire ring"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A ring of stones to safely contain a fire."
msgstr "Un cercle de pierres pour contenir un feu en toute sécurité."

#. ~ Description of furniture "clay oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A simple clay oven with a chimney, with a firebrick alcove in the middle "
"that can be used to cook food or just to contain a fire."
msgstr ""
"Un simple four en terre cuite doté d'une cheminée, avec une alcôve en "
"briques réfractaires au milieu qui peut être utilisée pour cuire des "
"aliments ou simplement pour contenir un feu."

#. ~ Description of furniture "wood stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A simple metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or "
"heating food, and safe to use indoors."
msgstr ""
"Un simple poêle en métal pour des feux de bois. Idéal pour cuisiner ou "
"réchauffer des aliments et sûr à utiliser à l'intérieur."

#. ~ Description of furniture "hobo stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A small improvised wood stove, made from a metal can.  It's too small to fit "
"any fuel much larger than splintered wood."
msgstr ""
"Un petit poêle à bois improvisé, fabriqué à partir d'une boîte de conserve "
"en métal. Il est trop petit pour contenir un combustible beaucoup plus gros "
"que des éclats de bois."

