#. ~ Description of furniture "centrifuge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyzer unit.  "
"For some reason, this one has an attached battery pack.  It could be used to "
"analyze a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if a test tube was placed in "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Une centrifugeuse, un dispositif de séparation de liquide avec une unité "
"d'analyse automatisée. Pour une raison quelconque, celle-ci est équipée "
"d’une batterie. Elle pourrait être utilisée pour analyser un échantillon de "
"liquide médical, tel que du sang, si un tube à essai y était placé."

#. ~ Description of furniture "autoclave"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled autoclave"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A device that can steam its contents at high enough temperatures to "
"completely sterilize them, killing any possible contaminants."
msgstr ""
"Un appareil capable de vaporiser son contenu à des températures suffisamment "
"élevées pour le stériliser complètement, éliminant ainsi tout contaminant "
"possible."

#. ~ Description of furniture "nuclear magnetic resonance spectrometer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A giant electromagnet with carefully tuned measurement equipment used to "
"observe how magnetic fields affect nuclear spins.  It is a common workhorse "
"for the discovery and study of chemical structures."
msgstr ""
"Un électro-aimant géant doté d'un équipement de mesure soigneusement réglé "
"utilisé pour observer la manière dont les champs magnétiques affectent les "
"spins nucléaires. C’est un outil commun pour la découverte et l’étude des "
"structures chimiques."

#. ~ Description of furniture "dialysis machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A large machine for pumping and filtering the blood of somebody without the "
"function of their kidneys.  Largely obsolete for those with access to "
"bionics, but a lifeline to those that need it."
msgstr ""
"Une grande machine pour pomper et filtrer le sang d’une personne sans que "
"ses reins fonctionnent. Largement obsolète pour ceux qui ont accès à la "
"bionique, mais une bouée de sauvetage pour ceux qui en ont besoin."

#. ~ Description of furniture "anesthetic machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A large machine with various tanks, tubes, and monitoring devices used to "
"maintain precise levels of anesthesia in a patient to ensure they, at least "
"ideally, remain asleep, unfeeling, but alive."
msgstr ""
"Une grande machine avec divers réservoirs, tubes et dispositifs de "
"surveillance utilisée pour maintenir des niveaux précis d'anesthésie chez un "
"patient afin de garantir qu'il reste, au moins idéalement, endormi et "
"insensible, mais vivant."

#. ~ Description of furniture "CT scanner"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A massive piece of machinery used to take hundreds of X-ray images from 360 "
"degrees, often used for medical examinations."
msgstr ""
"Une machine massive utilisée pour prendre des centaines d'images "
"radiologiques à 360 degrés, utilisé souvent pour les tests médicaux "
"approfondis."

#. ~ Description of furniture "MRI machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A massive tool used to take NMR images of a patient placed inside, providing "
"invaluable medical insight."
msgstr ""
"Un outil massif utilisé pour prendre des images RMN d’un patient placé à "
"l’intérieur, fournissant ainsi des informations médicales inestimables."

#. ~ Description of furniture "fume hood"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A metal hood atop a lab workspace, with durable glass shutters.  A fan in "
"the hood draws fumes and smoke from dangerous chemicals up into a "
"ventilation duct."
msgstr ""
"Une hotte en métal au-dessus d'un espace de travail de laboratoire, avec des "
"volets en verre durables. Un ventilateur dans la hotte aspire les vapeurs et "
"la fumée des produits chimiques dangereux vers un conduit de ventilation."

#. ~ Description of furniture "lab workbench"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A metal storage cabinet topped with a durable resin countertop resistant to "
"most chemical spills and burns.  It has wired-in electrical and gas fittings."
msgstr ""
"Une armoire de rangement en métal surmontée d'un comptoir en résine durable "
"résistant à la plupart des déversements de produits chimiques et des "
"brûlures. Elle dispose de raccords électriques et de gaz câblés."

#. ~ Description of furniture "scanner bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A narrow, flat, and frankly uncomfortable bed for putting someone into an "
"imaging machine for medical observations."
msgstr ""
"Un lit étroit, plat et assez inconfortable utilisé pour insérer quelqu'un "
"dans une machine d'imagerie pour des tests médicaux."

#. ~ Description of furniture "Autodoc operation couch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A plush red sofa made less comfortable by the medical machinery directly "
"above it.  It has a single leather strap on the right armrest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "medical ventilator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A sizable box on a set of wheels that will pump air in and out of a "
"patient's lungs when they are incapable of breathing, though often only "
"needed temporarily."
msgstr ""
"Une boîte de grande taille sur un jeu de roues qui pompera l'air dans et "
"hors des poumons d'un patient lorsqu'il est incapable de respirer, bien que "
"cela ne soit souvent nécessaire que temporairement."

#. ~ Description of furniture "sample freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A specialized freezer capable of maintaining temperatures of -80 Celsius, "
"best used for the preservation of delicate scientific samples."
msgstr ""
"Un congélateur spécialisé capable de maintenir des températures de -80 °C, "
"idéal pour la conservation d'échantillons scientifiques délicats."

#. ~ Description of furniture "emergency wash station"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A standing sink with a pair of nozzles, along with a large, brightly-colored "
"handle.  It is specially designed to quickly remove contaminants from the "
"eyes, and is easily usable without being able to see very well.  A sizable "
"notice warns against drinking the water it uses."
msgstr ""
"Un évier sur pied avec une paire de buses et une grande poignée aux couleurs "
"vives. Il est spécialement conçu pour éliminer rapidement les contaminants "
"des yeux et est facilement utilisable sans pouvoir très bien voir. Un avis "
"important met en garde contre la consommation de l'eau qu'il utilise."

#. ~ Description of furniture "Autodoc Mk. XI"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A surgical apparatus used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The "
"term name 'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as it can only operate if "
"programmed beforehand, something that a plethora of labels warn against "
"doing without expertise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "X-ray scanner"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid "A table with a movable head, often used for medical examinations."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "IV pole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A tall wire frame on a set of small wheels used for holding an IV bag, "
"useful for unattended administration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "shaker incubator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"A tool for keeping chemical broth nicely mixed and at just the right "
"temperature to grow bacteria.  Although more bacteria is probably the last "
"thing you need, considering the circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Un outil pour garder le bouillon chimique bien mélangé et à la bonne "
"température pour développer des bactéries. Bien que davantage de bactéries "
"soient probablement la dernière chose dont vous avez besoin, compte tenu des "
"circonstances."

#. ~ Description of furniture "electron microscope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid ""
"An enormous observational tool for studying the details of samples on an "
"immensely small scale."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme outil d’observation pour étudier les détails d’échantillons à une "
"échelle extrêmement petite."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid "Autodoc Mk. XI"
msgstr "Autodoc Mk. XI"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid "Autodoc operation couch"
msgstr "bloc opératoire d'Autodoc"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
msgid "CT scanner"
msgstr "scanner de tomodensitométrie"

