#. ~ Description of terrain "simple concrete wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"A durable and uniform concrete wall.  This one has an embrasure, so you can "
"shoot or use reach weapons through it while staying safe."
msgstr ""
"Un mur en béton solide et uniforme possédant une embrasure vous permettant "
"de tirer des armes à feu ou utiliser des armes longues comme des lances à "
"travers en restant bien à l'abri."

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"A section of wall with a nice small hole, letting you shoot your machine gun "
"from the safety of your reinforced bunker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "palisade wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"An age-old type of fortification consisting of hefty lumber staked into the "
"ground and cabled together.  This section in particular has an embrasure, so "
"you can shoot or use reach weapons through it while staying safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "stone wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"The small opening on this stone wall allows you to shoot and use reach "
"weapons against enemies on the other side, while also providing cover for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Ce mur en pierre possède une embrasure vous permettant de tirer ou utiliser "
"des armes contre des ennemis à l'extérieur en offrant une couverture "
"significative."

#. ~ Description of terrain "adobe wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"This adobe brick wall has an embrasure that lets you shoot and use reach "
"weapons against enemies on the outside, while also protecting you."
msgstr ""
"Ce mur en briques d'adobe possède une embrasure vous permettant de tirer ou "
"utiliser des armes contre des ennemis à l'extérieur en offrant une "
"couverture significative."

#. ~ Description of terrain "brick wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"This brick wall has an embrasure that lets you shoot and use reach weapons "
"against enemies on the outside, while also protecting you."
msgstr ""
"Ce mur en briques possède une embrasure vous permettant de tirer ou utiliser "
"des armes contre des ennemis à l'extérieur en offrant une couverture "
"significative."

#. ~ Description of terrain "log wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"This timber wall has a hole that lets you shoot through and use reach "
"weapons against enemies on the other side, while also protecting you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "log wall with a wide opening"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"This timber wall previously had an embrasure, but now the hole is so big "
"that you can climb through it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden wall with embrasure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"This wooden wall has a hole that lets you shoot and use reach weapons "
"against enemies on the other side."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden wall with a wide opening"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-embrasures.json
msgid ""
"This wooden wall previously had an embrasure, but the hole has been smashed "
"wide enough that you can climb through it."
msgstr ""

