#. ~ Description of ".300 AAC Blackout"
#: data/json/items/ammo/300blk.json
msgid ""
"A .300 AAC Blackout round with a 125gr open tip match bullet.  .300 BLK is "
"an intermediate cartridge necked up from 5.56x45mm, designed to achieve "
"similar ballistics to 7.62x39mm.  It is compatible with standard AR-15 lower "
"receivers and will feed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de calibre .300 AAC Blackout équipée d'une balle de 125gr à "
"tête ouverte. La 300BLK est une cartouche de taille intermédiaire, "
"essentiellement une version rétrécie du calibre 5,56x45mm, conçue pour "
"obtenir des performances balistiques similaires au calibre 7,62x39mm. "
"Compatible avec le mécanisme de recharge standard de l'AR-15 et peut être "
"insérée dans un chargeur STANAG."

#. ~ Description of ".300 AAC Blackout subsonic"
#: data/json/items/ammo/300blk.json
msgid ""
"A subsonic .300 AAC Blackout round with a 220gr open tip match bullet.  When "
"fired with a suppressor, it only emits low noise, making it ideal for "
"silently eliminating your enemies.  It is compatible with standard AR-15 "
"lower receivers and will feed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""

