#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M576 buckshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid ""
"A 40x46mm buckshot load, designed for use in thick vegetation or room "
"clearing.  Due to the limitations of weapons built to fire 40x46mm grenades, "
"it's much less powerful than you'd expect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M433 HEDP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid ""
"A low velocity 40x46mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can "
"penetrate 2 inches of steel armor, and the fragmentation of the projectile "
"body also makes it suitable for use against infantry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M651 tear gas"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid ""
