"and driving infantry from entrenched positions, and is able to penetrate "
"thin wood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M1006 sponge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid ""
"A low velocity less-lethal 40x46mm round with a foam and plastic projectile "
"intended to cause pain and disorientation to the target.  May still injure "
"or kill."
msgstr ""
"Une balle non létale 40x46mm avec de la mousse et un projectile en plastique "
"conçue pour faire mal et désorienter la cible. Peut gravement blesser voire "
"tuer."

