msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  "
"It has low recoil, but lacks its usual armor penetration due to using a "
"simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "4.6x30mm"
#: data/json/items/ammo/46.json
