"the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the "
"5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be "
"reliable.  It has very low recoil but lacks its usual armor penetration due "
"to using a simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator "
"projectile."
