#. ~ Description of "9x19mm JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds "
"have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly "
"increases stopping power against unarmored targets and reduces "
"overpenetration."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de calibre 9x19mm possédant une balle de 116gr chemisée à "
"pointe creuse. Les cartouches JHP ont moins de capacité de pénétration que "
"les cartouches FMJ, mais leur expansion améliore leur capacité à stopper les "
"cibles sans armure et réduit la sur-pénétration."

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a brass jacketed 115gr bullet.  It has been a popular "
"round for military, law enforcement, and civilian use for over a century."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de calibre 9x19mm possédant une balle chemisée laiton de "
"115gr. Populaire parmi les forces militaires, de l'ordre et les civils "
"depuis plus d'un siècle."

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm +P+"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"A step beyond the high-pressure 9x19mm +P round, the +P+ has even higher "
"internal pressure offering superior damage, accuracy, and penetration."
msgstr ""
"Un pas plus loin que la balle haute pression 9x19mm +P, la +P+ à une "
"pression interne encore plus grande offrant des dégâts, précisions et "
"pénétrations supérieurs."

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm +P"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"Overpressure 9x19mm ammunition.  The round's increased velocity results in "
"superior accuracy and stopping power at the cost of higher recoil."
msgstr ""
"Munition de 9x19mm sur-pressurisée. La vitesse accrue de la cartouche "
"résulte en une précision et force de frappe supérieures en contrepartie d'un "
"recul plus élevè."

#. ~ Description of "9x18mm +P+, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
msgid ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the "
"Makarov PM.  This one has been hand-reloaded to generate higher internal "
"pressure, boosting flight stability and damage."
msgstr ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, une vieille cartouche pour pistolets russes "
"utilisées principalement par les Makarov PM. Celle-ci a été rechargée main "
"pour générer une plus haute pression interne, augmentant la stabilité de vol "
"et les dégâts. "

