msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching large tools and weapons to a load-"
"bearing vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching small tools to a load-bearing vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "medium belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching tools and some weapons to a load-"
"bearing vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "triple stacker ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A collection of 6 pockets, 3 wide and 2 deep, designed to hold rifle "
"magazines and keep them accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for "
"attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your chest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single "
"large magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leg ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg and hold two magazines "
"close at hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large leather quiver trimmed with metal, worn on the back, that can hold a "
"large amount of arrows or crossbow bolts.  It's even long enough for atlatl "
"or fishing spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large pipe quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large makeshift quiver fashioned from 3 pipes, worn on the back.  Heavier "
"and thinner than a typical large quiver, it can't hold as many arrows, "
"though it's still long enough for fishing or atlatl spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large pouch capable of holding a gas mask and an additional filter, "
"keeping both accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a "
"belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large birchbark quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large quiver woven from strips of birchbark, worn on the back, that can "
"hold a large number of arrows or crossbow bolts.  It's long enough to also "
"store atlatl and fishing spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A leather ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A leather quiver worn at the waist that can hold twelve arrows or fifteen "
"bolts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nylon quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A lighter and more durable quiver made of nylon, with straps to attach to a "
"MOLLE system."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical tool pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A low profile pouch designed to keep your tools accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your "
"chest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "simple cloth quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift back-worn quiver jury-rigged out of fabric too soft to really do "
"the job well.  It can't hold as many arrows as a proper large quiver, but "
"it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pipe quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift quiver fashioned from sections of pipe strapped together and "
"worn at the waist.  Heavier and thinner than a typical quiver, it can only "
"hold six arrows or eight bolts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "H2O pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold a water bottle with an additional front tactical "
"pocket.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical grenade pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold one hand grenade, keeping it both accessible and "
"secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical shotshell pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold shotgun shells or .308 rounds, keeping them "
"accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gadget pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep gadgets and small items accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canteen pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep your canteen accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE "
"straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical radio pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep your radio accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps "
"for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "birchbark quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A quiver woven from strips of birch bark, worn at the waist."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ankle ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your ankle and hold a "
"single small magazine.  It's a bit awkward to use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; "
"rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "multi-function quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A specialized quiver with a bag and straps to store a takedown bow as well "
"as a small pouch for archery accessories, perfect for a bowhunter on the go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy holster designed to be worn vertically, to keep a small profile on "
"a tactical vest.  This makes it a little more awkward to draw from than a "
"normal holster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy leather ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a "
"single large magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flashlight pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pouch designed to keep your flashlight accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "javelin bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"An deep leather bag with a wide mouth, designed to store javelins within "
"easy reach."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "denim quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"An improvised back-worn quiver that can hold a small number of arrows.  The "
"material isn't ideal for the job, but it's better than plain cotton."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Breaching shotgun magnets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "H2O pouch"
msgid_plural "H2O pouches"
msgstr[0] "poche à bouteille"
msgstr[1] "poches à bouteille"
msgstr[2] "poches à bouteille"

#. ~ Description of "chest rig"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"Popularized during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically "
"plain, barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with "
"straps to secure them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in "
"its pouches."
msgstr ""

