#. ~ Description of "survivor's map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A hand-drawn map of the local area.  Whoever created it has marked down the "
"locations of nearby supply sources including gun stores and gas stations.  "
"Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une carte dessinée à la main des environs. La personne à qui cette carte "
"appartenait originalement a indiquée des points d'approvisionnement locaux "
"importants, parmi ceci des armureries et des stations essence. Utilisez cet "
"objet pour ajouter ces points d'intérêts à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "drainage system map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A map of sewers formerly used by public maintenance workers.  Using it will "
"add sewer systems and facilities to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "subway maintenance map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A map of subway tunnels formerly used by public maintenance workers.  Using "
"it will add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une carte des tunnels de métro locaux ayant été auparavant utilisé par le "
"personnel de maintenance pour naviguer les environs. Utiliser cet objet "
"ajoutera les lignes et stations de métro locales à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "trail guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed guide to the best local trails.  It has general details about the "
"trails, trailhead amenities, suggestions for the best thru-hikes, and advice "
"on interacting with local wildlife in a responsible and respectful manner."
msgstr ""
"Un guide imprimé des meilleures randonnées locales contenant des "
"informations générales sur les chemins forestiers, les aménagements de début "
"ou fin de sentier, différentes suggestions de parcours et des astuces sur "
"les comportements responsables et respectueux à adopter en cas de rencontre "
"avec la faune locale."

#. ~ Description of "satellite map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed satellite map of the local area.  Due to it's low quality and lack "
"of map legend, you are unable to recognize most buildings.  Using it will "
"add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "military operations map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed topographical map of the local area.  Originally of military "
"origin, it details the locations of evacuation centers and military "
"facilities.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une carte topographique imprimée de la région. D'origine militaire, elle "
"détaille la position de centres d'évacuation et d'installations militaires. "
"Vous pouvez utiliser cet objet pour ajouter ces points d'intérêts à votre "
"carte."

#. ~ Description of "urban explorer's map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printout of a local road map, with several buildings circled in red.  "
"Using it will add roads and abandoned buildings to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une carte imprimée des environs avec certains bâtiments entourés en rouge. "
"Utiliser cet objet ajoutera les routes et bâtiments abandonnés locaux à "
"votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "road map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A road map for the local area.  Listing information on civic sites like "
"hospitals and police stations, it can be used to add points of interest to "
"your map."
msgstr ""
"Une carte routière des environs listant des points d'intérêts comme des "
"hôpitaux ou des stations de police. Vous pouvez utiliser cet objet pour "
"ajouter ces informations à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "subway map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A schematic diagram of local subway networks, too stylized to garter much "
"useful information.  Using it will add subway stations to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "technology advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local electronic and hardware stores as "
"well as arcades and internet cafes with an address below each entry.  Using "
"it will add roads and local electronic and hardware stores as well as "
"arcades and internet cafes to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "food shopping advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local food shopping possibilities with an "
"address below each entry.  Using it will add roads, local grocery, "
"convenience stores and bakeries to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "furniture advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local home improvement stores and with an "
"address below each entry.  Using it will add roads an local furniture, home "
"improvement and gardening stores to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mall advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local malls with an address below each "
"entry.  Using it will add roads an local malls and strip malls to your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "history advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local museums, libraries and antique stores "
"with an address below each entry.  Using it will add roads an local museums, "
"libraries and antique stores to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une petite brochure remplie de publicités pour les musées, bibliothèques et "
"antiquaires locaux avec des adresses en dessous de chacune. L'utiliser "
"ajoutera les route ainsi que les musées, bibliothèques et antiquaires des "
"environs à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "restaurant advertising brochure"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small brochure advertising for local restaurants with an address below "
"each entry.  Using it will add roads an local restaurants, diners and bars "
"to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une petite brochure remplie de publicités pour des restaurants locaux avec "
"des adresses sur chacune. Utiliser cet objet ajoutera les routes ainsi que "
"les restaurants, diners et bars locaux à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "gun nut pamphlet"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small pamphlet advertising current shooting related events and giving "
"directions to local shooting facilities and gun stores funded by Remington.  "
"Using it will add roads, gun stores, shooting ranges, outdoorsman stores and "
"any shows to your map."
msgstr ""
"Un brochure remplie de publicités pour les événénements et locations reliés "
"au tir et aux armes à feu des environs. L'utiliser ajoutera les positions de "
"routes, armureries, stands de tir, magasins de chasse et expositions d'armes "
"des environs à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "buy local pamphlet"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small pamphlet advertising local goods and produce and places to purchase "
"them.  Using it will add roads, markets, butchers, bakers and craft shops to "
"your map."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nightlife pamphlet"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small pamphlet advertising local nightlife options.  Using it will add "
"roads, bars, music venues, movie theaters and gambling halls to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une petite brochure remplie de publicités pour les options de "
"divertissements nocturnes des environs. L'utiliser ajoutera les positions "
"des routes, bars, salles de concert, cinémas et salles de jeu des environs à "
"votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "pet pamphlet"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small pamphlet advertising the benefits of different pets and local pet "
"related facilities and shops.  Using it will add roads, pet shops, animal "
"shelters, parks, trailheads and vets to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une petite brochure remplie de publicités pour les magasins, commerces et "
"aménagements locaux concernant les animaux de compagnie. L'utiliser ajoutera "
"les positions des routes, animaleries, refuges animaliers, parcs, sentiers "
"et cabinets de vétérinaire locaux à votre carte."

#. ~ Description of "get active pamphlet"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small pamphlet advertising various local businesses encouraging you to get "
"fit.  Using it will add roads, gyms and pools along with shops where you can "
"buy sporting gear to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une petite brochure remplie de publicités pour des entreprises de sport "
"locales vous encourageant à vous mettre en forme. L'utiliser ajoutera les "
"positions des routes, piscines, salles et magasins de sport locaux à votre "
"carte."

#. ~ Description of "handwritten note"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small, meticulously folded piece of paper, filled with tiny handwriting "
"and some surprisingly precise diagrams of subway tunnels, ventilation "
"shafts, and… guard shifts?  You have the feeling they weren't supposed to "
"write any of this stuff down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tourist guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet for tourists that details local hotels and "
"attractions."
msgstr ""
"Un dépliant pour les touristes, indiquant les hôtels locaux et les "
"attractions."

#. ~ Description of "restaurant guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet that details dining establishments in the "
"local area.  Printed by the Chamber of Commerce, it lists the addresses of "
"all the best diners and bars.  Using it will add points of interest to your "
"map."
msgstr ""
"Un dépliant qui indique les établissements culinaires de la région. Imprimé "
"par la chambre du commerce, il liste les adresses des meilleurs restaurants "
"et bars. L'utiliser vous révèlera ces points d'intérêts sur votre carte."

