msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish History, Religion, and Culture" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of fifteen essays by Jonathan Sarna on Jews' attempt to be both "
"distinctively Jewish but also definitely American, covering the American "
"Revolution through to contemporary times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Ranch Prospectus"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A short paper of the economic viability of constructing an agricultural "
"outpost."
msgstr ""
"Un court papier sur la viabilité économique de la construction d'un avant "
"poste agricole."

#. ~ Description of "Visions in Solitude"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A small book detailing 'visions' a prisoner had on death row."
msgstr ""
"Un petit livre détaillant les \"visions\" qu'un prisonnier a eu dans le "
"couloir de la mort."

#. ~ Description of "priest's diary"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A small book filled with journal entries in Latin.  You can read Latin, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "war novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A story about a Bosnian citizen who goes through many hardships and near "
"death during the breakup of Yugoslavia."
msgstr ""
"Une histoire a propos d'un citoyen bosniaque passant a travers de nombreuses "
"épreuves et prêt de la mort pendant la rupture de la Yougoslavie."

#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A story about three people in the fictional city of Los Santos: a gangster, "
"an upper-class man, and a psychopath.  They eventually band together to pull "
"off the biggest heist in the city's history"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "comic book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A super-hero comic."
msgstr "Une bande dessinée de super-héros."

#. ~ Description of variant "A Short History of the Jewish People: From Legendary Times to to Modern Statehood" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A survey-level study of Jewish history, from Biblical times through to the "
"1990s.  At only 250 pages long, it is by necessity very brief on any "
"individual topic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thriller novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A suspenseful tale of betrayal and revenge."
msgstr "Une histoire à suspense qui parle de trahison et de vengeance."

#. ~ Description of "road novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A tale about a group of friends who wander the USA in the 1960s against a "
"backdrop of jazz, poetry and drug use."
msgstr ""
"L'histoire d'un groupe d'amis qui errent sur les routes des États-Unis dans "
"les années 60, avec pour toile de fond le jazz, la poésie et la drogue."

#. ~ Description of "spy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A tale of intrigue and espionage among Nazis, no, Commies, no, Iraqis!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "war novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A thrilling narrative of survival in a prisoner of war camp during the "
"Second World War, filled with riveting subplots about rat farming and "
"dysentery."
msgstr ""
"Une histoire sur la survie d'un prisonnier dans un camp durant la Seconde "
"Guerre Mondiale."

#. ~ Description of "collector's edition book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A unique, valuable book that has been kept as a collector's item."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "The Vendetta Riders"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A wild young man, fast on the draw, who thinks he has nothing to lose, falls "
"in with a group of gun runners."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"After their diamond heist goes wrong, the surviving criminals begin to "
"suspect that one of them is a police informant."
msgstr ""
"Après que leur cambriolage de diamants ait échoué, les criminels ayant "
"survécu commencent à penser que l'un d'eux est un informateur de la police."

