#. ~ Description of variant "I and Thou" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"An English translation of Martin Buber's philosophical work on the "
"relationships of human beings to each other and to God."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "The Way of Humanity: According to Chasidic Teachings" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
