msgid ""
"The overpowering smell of the fermenting fish liquid makes it clear that it "
"is not ready for use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "quicklime"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"The product of burning limestone, this white powder is a crucial ingredient "
"in making cement.  That said, it is also extremely caustic and will cause "
"severe burns to any tissue it comes in contact with.  This property could "
"probably be exploited."
msgstr ""
"Le résultat de la calcination du calcaire, cette poudre blanche est un "
"ingrédient indispensable pour le ciment. La chaux vive est aussi extrêmement "
"corrosive et brûle les tissus qui entrent en contact avec. Cette propriété "
"pourrait être exploitée..."

#. ~ Description of "salt water"
