#. ~ Description of "mascarpone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"A portion of mascarpone, a dairy product obtained from the processing of "
"cream and citric acid, a typical Italian spreadable cheese."
msgstr ""
"Une portion de mascarpone, une sorte de fromage italien typique à étaler, "
"issue d'un mélange de crème et d'acide citrique."

#. ~ Description of "pecorino"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"A slice of pecorino, famous Italian hard cheese used in pasta carbonara."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "quesadilla"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
