#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid "V8"
msgid_plural "V8"
msgstr[0] "jus de légumes"
msgstr[1] "jus de légumes"
msgstr[2] "jus de légumes"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid "Virgin Mary cocktail"
msgid_plural "Virgin Mary cocktail"
msgstr[0] "cocktail Vierge Marie"
msgstr[1] "cocktails Vierge Marie"
msgstr[2] "cocktails Vierge Marie"

#. ~ Description of "almond milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"Wait, you can milk almonds?  Not quite, but you can blend them with water!  "
"A dairy-free alternative high in calcium, and rival to soy milk."
msgstr ""
"Attendez, c'est possible de traire des amandes? Pas vraiment, mais vous "
"pouvez les mixer et ajouter un peu d'eau! Une alternative au lait sans "
"lactose mais comparablement riche en calcium, et en compétition avec le lait "
"de soja pour ce titre."

#. ~ Description of "hazelnut milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"Wait, you can milk hazelnuts?  Not quite, but you can blend them with "
"water!  A dairy-free alternative high in calcium, and rival to soy milk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "soy milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"Wait, you can milk soybeans?  Not quite, but you can blend them with water!  "
"A dairy-free alternative high in protein, and rival to almond milk."
msgstr ""
"Attendez, c'est possible de traire des fèves de soja? Pas vraiment, mais "
"vous pouvez les mixer et ajouter un peu d'eau! Une alternative au lait sans "
"lactose mais comparablement riche en calcium, et en compétition avec le lait "
"d'amande pour ce titre."

#. ~ Description of "walnut milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"Wait, you can milk walnuts?  Not quite, but you can blend them with water!  "
"A dairy-free alternative high in calcium, and rival to soy milk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sweet water"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid "Water with sugar or honey added.  Tastes okay."
msgstr "De l'eau avec du sucre et du miel. Le goût est correct."

#. ~ Description of "water"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"Water, the stuff of life, necessary for all kinds of crafting, cleaning, and "
"avoiding an agonizing death by dehydration.  You should boil or purify it "
"before using it as drinking water."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "murky water"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"Water, the stuff of life.  This water looks like it has quite a bit of life "
"in it in fact, and not the good kind.  You should filter and sterilize it if "
"you want to drink it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "spurge tea"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid "You no longer need to worry about asthma attacks, at least for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "water (purifying)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
msgid ""
"You've dissolved tablets of disinfecting chemicals in this water to purify "
"it.  Soon it'll be ready to drink."
msgstr ""

