#. ~ Description of "pumpkin yeast bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A festive autumnal bread with a golden color in either rolls or sliced "
"loaves of bread."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hardtack pudding"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more "
"palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water and flour to "
"make dough, followed by kneading in pieces of fruit.  The dough is then "
"boiled into bread pudding chunks and topped with sweeteners.  Soldiers would "
"call this a dessert."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canned pineapple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Canned pineapple rings in water.  Quite tasty."
msgstr "Des tranches d'ananas au jus. Plutôt bon."

#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Chopped Jerusalem artichoke combined with any fruit that is in season or at "
"hand.  Surprisingly tasty."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated fruit flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain "
"edible for an incredibly long time.  They are useful for several cooking "
"recipes."
msgstr ""
"Pétales de fruits déshydratés. Bien conservé, cette nourriture séchée peut "
"rester comestible pendant un temps incroyable. Elles sont utiles pour "
"plusieurs recettes de cuisine."

#. ~ Description of "fruit leather"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Dried strips of sugary fruit paste."
msgstr "Des morceaux séchés de pâte de fruit sucrée."

#. ~ Description of "fruit jam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Fresh fruit cooked with sugar to make it last longer."
msgstr ""
"Des fruits frais cuits avec du sucre pour les conserver plus longtemps."

#. ~ Description of "fruit in syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Fruit slices soaked in a sugar syrup to preserve freshness and appearance."
msgstr ""
"Des tranches de fruit trempées dans un sirop sucré pour conserver leur "
"fraîcheur et apparence."

#. ~ Description of "cooked blueberry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "It's like blueberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "C'est comme de la confiture de myrtille, le sucre en moins."

#. ~ Description of "cooked fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
