#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A Lachesis mutus pill, prepared through the dilution of the venom of the "
"bushmaster snake with 10^1000 parts water.  These pills are claimed to be an "
"effective treatment for sore throat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broad-spectrum antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the "
"spread of infection.  It contains nearly toxic levels of antibiotics, but "
"can treat any bacterial infections you may encounter.  One dose lasts twelve "
"hours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "antiparasitic drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum chemical tablet designed to eliminate parasitic "
"infestations in living creatures.  Though designed for use on pets and "
"livestock, it will likely work on humans as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A combination of hydrogen peroxide, baking soda, and dish soap that works "
"together to transform skunk spray thiocetates into odorless acids."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fluoxetine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A common and popular antidepressant.  It will elevate mood, and can "
"profoundly alter the effects of other drugs.  It is only rarely habit-"
"forming, though adverse reactions are not uncommon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "antacid tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A common stomach soother in flavored tablet form.  Makes you less likely to "
"vomit."
msgstr ""
"Un médicament conçu pour apaiser l'estomac sous forme de tablettes "
"aromatisées. Calme la nausée et les brûlures d'estomac."

#. ~ Description of "debug chloroform soaked rag"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A debug item that lets you put NPCs (or yourself) to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Un objet de debuguage qui vous permet de faire dormir les PNJ (ou vous)."

#. ~ Description of "alprazolam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A fast-acting benzodiazepine with a powerful sedative effect.  It is "
"dangerously addictive, and withdrawal from regular use should be gradual."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flavored bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweeteners "
"mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's almost "
"as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr ""
"Une tablette blanche faite-maison à partir de poudre d'os. Les agents "
"sucrants y ayant été ajoutés pour lutter contre la texture poudreuse et le "
"goût de cendre la rende presque aussi supportable que ses contreparties "
"d'avant le Cataclysme."

#. ~ Description of "bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is "
"hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr ""
"Un supplément de calcium fait maison à partir de farine d'os. Le goût est "
"horrible et les pilules difficiles à avaler, mais ceci peut vous aider à "
"lutter contre une carence."

#. ~ Description of "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homeopathic pill, prepared through the repeated dilution of an active "
"ingredient with water.  The label purports that these pills are able to "
"maintain general wellness."
msgstr ""
"Une pilule homéopathique, préparée en diluant à répétition un ingrédient "
"actif dans de l'eau. L'emballage insiste que celle-ci aide à maintenir un "
"bon niveau de bien-être."

#. ~ Description of "Dakin's solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift antiseptic made from bleach and water.  The volatile chlorine "
"compounds break down quickly, so it won't stay good for long."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cocaine topical cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A medical cream that provides both vascular restriction and anesthetic "
"properties.  It won't get you high, but if used too frequently it may still "
"be habit-forming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled "
"into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Highly addictive and hazardous to health, but lung cancer is kind of the "
"least of your concerns at this point."
msgstr ""
"Un mélange de feuilles de tabacs séchées, de pesticides et d'additifs "
"chimiques roulés dans un tube de papier et équipés d'un filtre. Elles "
"stimulent l'acuité mentale et réduisent l'appétit. Addictives, elles sont un "
"danger pour votre santé, mais un cancer du poumon dans 20 ans est maintenant "
"le moindre de vos soucis."

#. ~ Description of "narrow-spectrum antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A narrow-spectrum antibiotic used to suppress infections and prevent them "
"from spreading.  It isn't broad enough to purge most infections outright, "
"but it boosts the body's resistance against them.  One dose lasts twelve "
"hours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its "
"packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season "
"for which it was developed."
msgstr ""
"Un vaccin pharmaceutique contre la grippe, conçu pour des campagnes de "
"vaccination de masse; il est encore dans son emballage et est censé fournir "
"une immunité aux souches de grippe prédominantes pour la saison à laquelle "
"il était destiné, espérons qu'il soit toujours efficace."

#. ~ Description of "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potassium iodide tablet.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to "
"mitigate injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr ""
"Des tablettes d'iodure de potassium. Prises avant exposition, elles aident à "
"limiter les dégâts causés par l'exposition aux rayonnements."

#. ~ Description of "oxycodone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent opioid pain relief medication in an immediate release tablet.  "
"Oxycodone is highly addictive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hemostatic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered antihemorrhagic compound that reacts with blood to immediately "
"form a gel-like substance that stops bleeding."
msgstr "Une poudre qui réagit avec le sang pour stopper les hémorragies."

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered form of chemical antiseptic, this bismuth formic iodide cleans "
"wounds quickly and painlessly."
msgstr ""
"Une poudre chimique d'antiseptique. Ce iodure de bismuth formique nettoie "
"les plaies rapidement sans douleur."

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powerful antiseptic commonly used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "antifungal drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powerful chemical tablet designed to eliminate fungal infections in living "
"creatures.  One dose lasts four hours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lithium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription mood stabilizer in the form of lithium carbonate.  This drug "
"has long been used to treat bipolar disorder, and if taken once daily, helps "
"to dampen the severity of mood swings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dextroamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription stimulant commonly prescribed for attention deficit disorder, "
"often with levoamphetamine included.  It can be addictive if abused."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "zolpidem"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription-strength sedative with a variety of psychoactive side "
"effects.  Used in the treatment of insomnia."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to "
"health."
msgstr ""
"Un cigarette roulée à la main avec du tabac et une feuille de papier. "
"Stimule l'acuité mentale et réduit l'appétit. Malgré le fait qu'elle soit "
"fabriquée à la main, elle reste hautement addictive et dangereuse pour la "
"santé."

#. ~ Description of "naloxone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A small plastic device with a nozzle on one end and a plunger on the other.  "
"The drug inside can be administered nasally to rapidly reverse and block the "
"effect of opioids, which could save someone's life during an overdose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "injectable iron"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A small vial of dark yellow liquid containing soluble iron for injection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vitamin C supplement"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A small white tablet promising more vitamin C than a human can conceivably "
"absorb."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "saline solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A solution of sterilized water and salt for intravenous infusion or washing "
"contaminants from one's eyes."
msgstr ""
"Une solution d'eau stérilisée salée, pour des infusions intraveineuses ou "
"pour nettoyer les yeux."

#. ~ Description of "opium tar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A sticky blob of painkiller derived from the poppy plant.  It lacks the "
"potency of a modern pharmaceutical formulation, but is every bit as "
"addictive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diazepam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong benzodiazepine drug used to treat muscle spasms, anxiety, seizures, "
"and panic attacks."
msgstr ""
"Un médicament puissant a base de benzodiazépine utilisé pour traiter les "
"spasmes musculaires, l'anxiété, les convulsions et les crises de panique."

#. ~ Description of "epinephrine autoinjector"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A syringe filled with a shot of epinephrine, also called adrenaline.  It "
"serves as a powerful stimulant when you inject yourself with it.  Asthmatics "
"can use it in an emergency to clear an asthma attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tramadol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tablet containing 50mg of a slow-acting opioid.  It is slow-acting and "
"relatively mild, but will last much longer than other opioids."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Prussian blue tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tablet containing oxidized ferrous ferrocyanide salts.  Capable of purging "
"nuclear contaminants from the body if taken after radiation exposure."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pink tabs resembling a postage stamp, dosed with some sort of drug.  "
"Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr ""
"Une petite tablette rose ressemblant à une timbre-poste dosée avec une sorte "
"de drogue et utile uniquement si vous voulez vous amuser et causera des "
"hallucinations sévères."

#. ~ Description of "calcium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A white calcium tablet.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as "
"a method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Une tablette blanche de calcium. Principalement utilisée avant l'apocalypse "
"par des personnes âgées souffrant d'ostéoporose pour supplémenter leur "
"apport en calcium."

#. ~ Description of "acetaminophen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetaminophen, a mild painkiller that works well in conjunction with NSAID-"
"based painkillers like aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and swelling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetaminophen, dextromethorphan HBr, and diphenhydramine served in the form "
"of a foul-tasting syrup.  It promises to fight flu symptoms like coughs, "
"fever, and body aches, and thanks to the inclusion of a potent "
"antihistamine, it should fight allergies and put you to sleep as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "aspirin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetylsalicylic acid, an NSAID that can treat pain and fever.  It is a blood "
"thinner, and may exacerbate bleeding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Aesculus hippocastanum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of "
"horse chestnut with 10^30 parts water.  These pills are meant to treat "
"dysentery and hemorrhoids."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Allium cepa homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one part "
"onion with 10^30 parts water.  The label states that these pills can "
"ameliorate symptoms of asthma, gastrointestinal disorders, and bronchitis.  "
"You briefly wonder if it can cure fungal infections."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Arsenicum album homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one "
"part arsenic trioxide with 10^24 parts water.  Purported to treat anxiety, "
"various digestive disorders, and arsenic poisoning."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Arum tryphillum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of the "
"jack-in-the-pulpit plant with 10^30 parts water.  The label claims that the "
"pills are able to treat voice loss."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Oscillococcinum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one "
"part duck offal with 10^400 parts water.  The label purports that these "
"pills are able to treat flu-like symptoms and maintain general wellness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "morphine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An addictive narcotic used to treat intense pain in hospital settings.  "
"You'll need a syringe to inject it, but it will take effect almost "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nicotine patch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An adhesive patch that promises to fight cravings and help smokers quit by "
"slowly delivering nicotine into the body over the course of 16 hours as a "
"replacement for smoking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Panaceus"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An apple-red gel capsule the size of your thumbnail, filled with a thick, "
"oily liquid that shifts from black to purple at unpredictable intervals, "
"flecked with tiny gray dots.  Given the place you got it from, it's either "
"very potent, or highly experimental.  Holding it, all the little aches and "
"pains seem to fade, just for a moment…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An experimental, cutting-edge antivenom in the form of a small amber vial, "
"designed to be injected a few hours before venom exposure.  It was developed "
"in top secret by the military in response to increasing biological/chemical "
"warfare."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "heroin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  It is incredibly "
"addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated "
"for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wintergreen oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An ointment infused with wintergreen oil.  Has mild antiseptic properties, "
"and can ease the pain caused by wounds."
msgstr ""
"Un onguent infusé d'huile de gaulthérie possédant des propriétés "
"antiseptiques et capable de soulager la douleur causée par une blessure."

#. ~ Description of "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An opioid in tablet form, used in the suppression of pain, cough, and other "
"ailments.  While relatively weak for a narcotic, it is still addictive, with "
"a potential for overdose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diphenhydramine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An over-the-counter allergy medication.  These tablets are meant to be taken "
"once per day and can cause drowsiness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "melatonin tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An over-the-counter melatonin supplement.  One tablet before bed is commonly "
"recommended to improve sleep quality, especially for those suffering from "
"sleep deprivation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chlorpromazine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Anti-psychotic medication.  Used to stabilize brain chemistry, it can arrest "
"hallucinations and other symptoms of psychosis.  Carries a sedative effect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of "
"infection.  It's the safest way to cure any infections you might have.  One "
"dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr ""
"Un médicament antibactérien conçu pour empêcher ou arrêter les infections "
"bactérienne. La façon la plus sûre et moins extrême contre toute infection "
"que vous pourriez avoir. Une dose dure douze heures."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia transition contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia transition contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "hyperopia contact lenses (weekly)"
