#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Jupiter" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"The largest edition of Terraforming, this epic board game is set in the "
"5000s, where players (or just the player) take on the role of corporations "
"competing to terraform and colonize the gas giant Jupiter and its moons (the "
"Jovian System).  This game combines elements of strategy, resource "
"management, and exploration as players work to transform the hostile "
"environment of the Jovian System into a habitable zone for human "
"civilization."
msgstr ""
"La plus large édition du jeu de société Terraformation, ce jeu de taille "
"impressionnante se déroule au tournant du cinquième millénaire où le joueur  "
"ou les joueurs prennent le rôle de compagnies en compétition pour "
"terraformer et coloniser la géante gazeuse Jupiter et ses lunes (le système "
"Jovien). Ce jeu combine des éléments de stratégie, de gestion de ressources "
"et d'exploration durant les efforts des joueurs tentant de transformer "
"l'environnement hostile en un milieu habitable pour la civilization humaine."

#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Pluto" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"The smallest set of the Terraforming series, this board game is set in the "
"2700s in the outer reaches of our solar system.  In this game, players take "
"on the roles of corporations competing to terraform and colonize the dwarf "
"planet Pluto, utilizing resources, technology, and strategic decision-making "
"to transform the icy world into a habitable environment."
msgstr ""
"Le plus petit jeu de société de la série Terraformation, ceci se déroule "
"durant les années 2700 au milieu des confins de notre système solaire. "
"Durant le cours d'une partie, les joueurs prennent le role de compagnies en "
"compétition pour terraformer et coloniser la planète naine Pluton, utilisant "
"les ressources locales, différentes technologies et des décisions "
"stratégiques pour transformer cette boule de glace en un monde habitable."

#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Mars" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"This board game is set in the 2400s, where corporations are working together "
"to terraform the planet Mars and make it habitable for human life.  Players "
"(or just a single player) take on the roles of these corporations and "
"compete to contribute to the terraforming process by raising temperature, "
"creating oceans, and cultivating greenery on the Martian surface."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Neptune" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"This board game is set in the 2800s, and just like it's prequels, either a "
"single player or players take on the roles of terraforming corporations, "
"competing to transform the planet Neptune into a habitable environment for "
"human life."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu de société se déroulant durant les années 2800, juste comme les "
"éditions précédentes de la série, le joueur ou les joueurs prennent le rôle "
"de compagnies de terraformation en compétition pour transformer la planète "
"Neptune en un environnement capable d'être colonisé par l'homme."

#. ~ Description of "Terraforming - Mercury"
#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Mercury" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"This board game is set in the 4300s, where corporations are working together "
"to terraform the planet Mercury, the smallest and innermost planet in our "
"solar system.  Each player (or just the player) will have unique abilities "
"and resources at their disposal, and they will need to strategize and "
"cooperate with one another to achieve their goals."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Saturn" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"This board game is set in the 4600s, and there, the player or the players "
"take on the role of corporations competing to terraform and/or colonize "
"Saturn's moons, rings and Saturn itself, to make them habitable for human "
"life.  The game combines elements of strategy, resource management, and area "
"control, offering an immersive experience for players."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu de société se déroulant durant les années 4600, le joueur ou les "
"joueurs prenant le rôle de compagnies en compétition pour terraformer et/ou "
"coloniser les Saturne ainsi que ses anneaux et ses lunes, les rendant "
"habitables pour l'homme de différentes façons. Ce jeu combine des éléments "
"de stratégie, de gestion de ressources, de contrôle de territoire et essaie "
"de son mieux d'immerger les joueur durant leur partie."

#. ~ Description of variant "Terraforming - Pluto" of item "Terraforming - Mercury"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"This board game is set in the 5000s, a distant future where Earth has become "
"uninhabitable due to climate change, resource depletion, and "
"overpopulation.  The player or players must work together to restore the "
"planet's ecosystems, atmosphere, and climate while also competing for "
"resources and prestige."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu de société prenant se déroulant au tournant du cinquième millénaire, "
"un futur distant où la terre est devenue inhabitable due au changement "
"climatique, à l'épuisement de ses ressources et à la surpopulation. Le "
"joueur ou les joueurs doivent tenter ensemble de restorer les écosystèmes, "
"l'atmosphère et le climat de la planète tout en étant en compétition afin de "
"recevoir le plus de ressources et prestige."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift dominoes set"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"Twenty eight rectangular pieces of cardboard, with dots on them so you can "
"use it to play dominoes.  It has also a proper container for storing them "
"all in place."
msgstr ""

