"The Smith and Wesson 610 is a classic six-shooter revolver chambered for "
"10mm rounds, or for S&W's own .40 round."
msgstr ""
"Le Smith and Wesson 610 est un revolver classique et chambré pour acceuillir "
"6 cartouches de calibre 10mm ou le calibre .40 de S&W."

