msgid ""
"A German battle rifle with a 13\" barrel and telescopic stock.  It is a gas-"
"operated, rotating bolt rifle with a short-stroke piston design similar to "
"that of the G36."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "7.62x51mm AK rifle" of gun "PAP M77 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "PAP M77 rifle" of item "7.62x51mm AK rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"A Serbian-made AK pattern rifle made by Zastava in 7.62x51mm NATO.  To avoid "
"import restrictions, Zastava USA has added a number of American-made parts."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de modèle AK conçu par Zastava en Serbie et chambré pour accueillir "
"des cartouches de calibre 7.62x51mm. Pour éviter les restrictions à "
"l'import, Zastava USA a modifié plusieurs composants manufacturé aux États-"
"Unis."

#. ~ Description of gun "7.62x51mm AK rifle"
#. ~ Description of "7.62x51mm AK rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid "A civilian AK pattern rifle, chambered in 7.62x51mm NATO."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de modèle AK conçu pour les civils et chambré pour accueillir des "
"cartouches de calibre 7.62x51mm NATO."

#. ~ Description of gun "M110A1 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M110A1 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"A derivative of H&K's G28 with an aluminum upper receiver to meet US Army "
"weight requirements.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to "
"1.5 MOA with standard ammunition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "FN SCAR-H rifle"
#. ~ Description of "FN SCAR-H rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular battle rifle specially designed for the United "
"States Special Operations Command.  The 'H' in its name stands for heavy, as "
"it uses the powerful .308 round."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "M14 EBR-RI rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M14 EBR-RI rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"A highly modified version of the M14 rifle designed to cover both CQB and "
"designated marksman roles.  A very powerful and versatile rifle, if somewhat "
"heavy."
msgstr ""
"Un version hautement modifié du fusil M14 conçue pour servir à la fois dans "
"le rôle de combat rapproché et de tireur d'élite désigné. Un fusil très "
"puissant et versatile mais un peu lourd."

#. ~ Description of gun "M60 semi auto machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M60 semi auto machine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic civilian variant of the M60 machine gun, retaining the "
"ability to be belt fed, an uncommon feature in civilian firearms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "German battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "German battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic, domestically produce clone of an early battle rifle "
"developed after the end of WWII.  The PTR 91 is a fantastically reliable, "
"cheap to produce rifle that continues to serve in conflict regions.  Though "
"the action is legendary, its handling characteristics and harsher recoil "
"leave something to be desired."
