msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Pressin pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Pressin pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/artisan_guns.json
msgid ""
"A compact short-range pistol without a pistol grip.  When in use, the entire "
"gun body is pointed at targets and squeezed.  The body also conceals a "
"switchblade for close quarters use."
