#. ~ Description of gun "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This bulky anti-drone gun molded from black polymer was once beloved on all "
"sides of the Eastern European theater.  It disrupts navigation and "
"communcation systems by firing a brief but powerful burst of microwave "
"energy.  A direct hit may cause robots, drones, and even cyborgs to "
"malfunction for a short time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#. ~ Description of "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This gatling-laser has been stripped from its CMES mech-suit and is far too "
"heavy to use on its own.  You will need to deploy it or mount it to a "
"vehicle, but it could be devastating if you have deep battery reserves."
msgstr ""

