#. ~ Description of gun mod "belt clip"
#. ~ Description of "belt clip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A belt clip that attaches to the grip or slide of a pistol to facilitate "
"'Mexican carry', the practice of carrying without a holster.  It does not "
"offer any protection for the trigger, so users are strongly advised to carry "
"with the chamber empty or select a firearm with a very heavy trigger pull."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer"
#. ~ Description of "bow stabilizer"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A counterweight placed forward of the bow's grip allows for greater "
"accuracy.  Aside from increased weight and size, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Un contre poid placé en avant de la poignée pour une meilleur précision. En "
"dehors du poids accru et de sa taille, il n'a pas d'inconvénients."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow dampening kit"
#. ~ Description of "bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and rubber with adhesive backing, designed to stick on "
"the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This substantially "
"reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "primitive bow dampening kit"
#. ~ Description of "primitive bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and strips of fur with adhesive backing, designed to "
"stick on the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This "
"substantially reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer system"
#. ~ Description of "bow stabilizer system"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of stabilizing rods with dampeners and an adjustable mount.  This "
"system will significantly reduce shaking at full draw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "wooden arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of "wooden arrow rest"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A small extension above the grip which an arrow rests upon while being "
"aimed.  Improves accuracy with no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Une petite extension au dessus de la poignée pour y poser la flèche. "
"Améliore la précision sans inconvénients."

