#. ~ Description of "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The LeMat revolver is unique in that its cylinder axis pin is also a fully "
"functional 20 gauge percussion-primed smoothbore barrel.  It's irremovable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "M203A1"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M203A1"
#. ~ Description of "M203A1"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The M203 was originally designed for use with M16 variants but today can be "
"attached to almost any rifle.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded "
"and fired."
msgstr ""
"Le M203 était originalement conçu pour être utilisé avec des variantes du "
"M16 mais peut de nos jours être attaché à n'importe quel fusil. Il permet de "
"charger et tirer une grenade de 40mm à la fois."

#. ~ Description of gun "modified M203"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified M203"
#. ~ Description of "modified M203"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The M203 was originally designed for use with M16 variants but today can be "
"attached to almost any rifle.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded "
"and fired.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any "
"weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Le M203 était conçu à l'origine pour être monté sur les variantes du M16, "
"mais de nos jours est compatible avec la majorité des fusils. Il peut "
"accueillir une unique grenade de calibre 40mm. Celui-ci été modifié et peut "
"maintenant être attaché à pratiquement toute arme à feu à l'exception des "
"armes à action manuelle et des pistolets."

#. ~ Description of gun "M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of "M320 GLM"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The M320 Grenade Launcher Module offers the functionality of larger "
"launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  It can "
"be either attached to a rifle or combined with a buttstock for standalone "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Le Module Lance-Grenades M320 est une lance-grenades de taille réduite "
"pouvant être attaché sur un fusil ou sur une crosse amovible pour être "
"utilisé seul. Sa taille réduite a l'inconvénient de le rendre moins précis "
"qu'un lance-grenades normal."

#. ~ Description of gun "modified M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified M320 GLM"
#. ~ Description of "modified M320 GLM"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The M320 Grenade Launcher Module offers the functionality of larger "
"launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  It can "
"be either attached to a rifle or combined with a buttstock for standalone "
"use.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any "
"weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Le Module Lance-Grenades M320 est une lance-grenades de taille réduite "
"pouvant être attaché sur un fusil ou sur une crosse amovible pour être "
"utilisé seul. Sa taille réduite a l'inconvénient de le rendre moins précis "
"qu'un lance-grenades normal. Ce lance-grenade en particulier à été modifié "
"et peut maintenant être équipé à pratiquement toute arme à feu à l'exception "
"des armes à action manuelle et des pistolets."

#. ~ Description of gun "M26-MASS shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M26-MASS shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "M26-MASS shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun "
"that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and fixed most of its predecessor's "
"problems.  It can be mounted under the barrel of a rifle, or used as a "
"standalone weapon by attaching a pistol grip or collapsible buttstock "
"module.  It feeds from three- or five-shot detachable magazines."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "modified M26-MASS"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified M26-MASS"
#. ~ Description of "modified M26-MASS"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun "
"that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and fixed most of its predecessor's "
"problems.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any "
"weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integral polymer bipod"
#. ~ Description of "integral polymer bipod"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The Steyr Scout's integral bipod is effectively part of the rifle's housing, "
"causing its added weight to practically be zero.  However, the polymer "
"construction and awkward design prevent it from being as useful as a normal "
"bipod."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "KSG-25 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "KSG-25 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of "KSG-25 second magazine"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The integrated second tube magazine of the Kel-Tec KSG-25, which holds 12 "
"shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"Le deuxième chargeur intégré de fusil à pompe du Kel-Tec KSG-25 capable de "
"contenir 12 cartouches. Vous ne pouvez pas le retirer de l'arme."

#. ~ Description of gun "TS12 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "TS12 second magazine"
#. ~ Description of "TS12 second magazine"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The integrated second tube magazine of the Tavor TS12, which holds 5 shots.  "
"It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"Le deuxième chargeur intégré de fusil à pompe du Tavor TS12 capable de "
"contenir 5 cartouches. Vous ne pouvez pas le retirer de l'arme."

#. ~ Description of gun "TS12 third magazine"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "TS12 third magazine"
#. ~ Description of "TS12 third magazine"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The integrated third tube magazine of the Tavor TS12, which holds 5 shots.  "
"It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"Le troisième chargeur intégré de fusil à pompe du Tavor TS12 capable de "
"contenir 5 cartouches. Vous ne pouvez pas le retirer de l'arme."

#. ~ Description of gun "combination gun shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "combination gun shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "combination gun shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The integrated underbarrel shotgun of a combination gun which holds two "
"shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"Le fusil à pompe intégré d'un fusil mixte, capable d'acceuillir 2 "
"cartouches. Vous ne pouvez pas le retirer de l'arme à feu."

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "weapon light"
