#. ~ Description of gun "light crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "light crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A crossbow made entirely of wood, save for the bowstring.  It simple design "
"makes it easy to operate, but it's lacking in power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "latchet crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "latchet crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A lever lies in a recess carved into this crossbow's wooden stock, allowing "
"it to be mechanically reloaded simply by lifting it out to catch the string "
"and pressing it back into place.  This allows for rapid reloading despite "
"the relatively heavy steel limbs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "repeating crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "repeating crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight wooden crossbow which can mount a magazine atop it, allowing "
"for automatic fire via the operation of a lever which in a single motion "
"spans the bow, nocks the bolt, and releases the string."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "heavy crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "heavy crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A medieval heavy crossbow designed to penetrate armor.  Its steel limbs can "
"store a tremendous amount of energy, but it takes a lot of time and effort "
"to load."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "compound crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "compound crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A modern hunting crossbow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-power "
"shots.  An integrated cocking rope assists the user with string pulling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "repeating compound crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "repeating compound crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A modern hunting crossbow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-powered "
"shots.  It is mounted with a ten-bolt magazine and a pump-action lever for "
"rapid reloads."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "pistol crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "pistol crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A modern reverse-draw crossbow engineered to be compact and quiet without "
"sacrificing firepower.  Despite its diminutive size, this weapon ought to be "
"sufficient for taking deer, or perhaps even larger targets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "double-string crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "double-string crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A slender medieval crossbow with four steel limbs and two bowstrings.  With "
"the aid of a foot stirrup, it may be loaded with two bolts and fired twice "
"in succession."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "hand crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "hand crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A small crossbow designed for use with one hand.  Due to its small size and "
"simple construction, it is quite weak."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "bullet crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "bullet crossbow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"Also called a stonebow, this light crossbow fires pebbles or other small "
"projectiles rather than bolts with surprising accuracy, if not a lot of "
"power."
msgstr ""

