#. ~ Description of gun "Boeing XM-P plasma rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Boeing XM-P plasma rifle"
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
msgid ""
"Boeing developed this focused plasma weaponry together with DARPA.  It heats "
"solid hydrogen to create plasma, and envelops it with polymers to reduce "
"blooming.  While powerful, it suffers from short range.  Powered by UPS."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
msgid "PPA-5"
msgid_plural "PPA-5s"
msgstr[0] "APP-5"
msgstr[1] "APP-5s"
msgstr[2] "APP-5s"

#. ~ Description of gun "PPA-5"
#. ~ Description of "PPA-5"
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
msgid ""
"The Portable Plasma Accelerator Model Five, developed by Lockheed Martin "
"Corporation.  This device uses highly advanced capacitor banks to create a "
"torus of superheated hydrogen plasma and accelerate it to incredible speed.  "
"It was designed to take down heavy vehicles, and was expected to fully enter "
"US Army service not long before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "M72 LAW"
#. ~ Description of "M72 LAW"
#: data/json/items/ranged/launchers.json
msgid ""
"A disposable light anti-tank rocket launcher.  Once fired, it cannot be "
"reloaded and must be disposed of."
msgstr ""
