msgstr "Le crâne d'une chèvre aux cornes toujours attachées."

#. ~ Description of "horse skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a horse.  Given the circumstances you can be pretty sure it was "
"a domestic horse."
msgstr ""
"Le crâne d'un cheval. Vu les circonstances, vous êtes plus ou moins sûre "
"qu'il appartenait à un cheval domestique."

#. ~ Description of "human skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a human being.  Carrying this around probably isn't going to "
"win you any friends."
msgstr ""
"Le crâne d'un être humain. Posséder ceci et le trimbaler durant vos voyages "
