#. ~ Description of "tonewood"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A block of tonally appropriate wood that has been air dried for a year in "
"preparation for being turned into a musical instrument."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden door"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A door complete with hinges and handle, ready to be installed in a frame."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A flat, thick plank of wood.  It's very awkward as a melee weapon, but "
"perhaps it could be carved into something better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "giant wooden screw"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A giant screw carved out of solid wood, a simple component used to convert "
"rotational energy into a downward movement of greater force."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "log"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A large section of tree trunk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "soaking spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A long stick carved and sanded into a smooth staff with a slight taper, for "
"use in making spears. It's currently being soaked with oil and quite "
"slippery.  Once it's finished it will be ready for use in other projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "long plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A long, thick plank of wood commonly known as a two by four, one of the most "
"common pieces of lumber.  In wood frame construction, these are the studs "
"that support drywall and give a building its structure."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stick"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A respectable length of wood.  It could serve as a weapon as-is, but it "
"might be better to carve it into something."
