#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A badge that detects radiation dosage, sealed in a radiation-blocking bag.  "
"Use it to remove it from the bag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "huge saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A huge, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with "
"rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds two "
"liters of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside "
"your veins, if you know how."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "blood draw kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A kit for drawing blood, including a test tube for holding the sample.  Use "
"this tool to draw blood, either from yourself or from a corpse you are "
"standing on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "anesthesia kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A kit for inducing anesthesia for surgery, containing specialized canisters "
"with a variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's "
"intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Un kit pour anesthésier les patients durant des operations chirurgiques "
"contenant des capsules spécialisées pour injecter et inhaler une variété de "
"substances puissamment hypnotiques, analgésiques et stimulantes. Conçu pour "
"être utilisé par de l'équipement médical spécialisé et non pour être "
"administré manuellement"

#. ~ Description of "large saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A large, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with "
"rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds a "
"liter of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside "
"your veins, if you know how."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "syringe"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A medical syringe.  Used for administering intravenous drugs."
msgstr ""
"Une seringue médicale. Utile pour l'injection d'héroïne et autres drogues."

#. ~ Description of "medical scissors"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A pair of medical scissors, typically used by nurses or paramedics to cut "
"bandages or fabric."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de ciseaux médicaux typiquement utilisé par des infirmiers ou "
"infermières pour couper à travers des bandages, vêtements ou fils de suture."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift gauze patch"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A palm-sized square of absorbent material with adhesive tape along the "
"edges, designed for easy application.  It's neither professional nor "
"sterile, but maybe this isn't the time to be choosy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "adhesive gauze patch"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A palm-sized square of sterile fabric with adhesive tape along the edges, "
"designed for easy application."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermometer"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A plastic thermometer that can read the air temperature."
msgstr "Un thermomètre en plastique qui vous indique la température de l'air."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift bandage"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A reasonably clean strip of cloth ready for use as a simple bandage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with rubber "
"tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds 500 mL of "
"completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your veins, "
"if you know how."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small oxygen delivery kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A small tank of compressed medical oxygen with a folding regulator and "
"mask.  Commonly used in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief "
"for asthma attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of "
"energy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small saline infusion kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A small, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with "
"rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds 250 mL "
"of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your "
"veins, if you know how."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bandage"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A sterile roll of cloth.  Used for stopping blood loss and protecting wounds "
"from aggravation to help them heal faster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sanitized makeshift bandage"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A strip of cloth that has been thoroughly decontaminated to improve its "
"effectiveness as a bandage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "oxygen delivery kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A tank of compressed medical oxygen with a regulator and mask.  Commonly "
"used in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief for asthma "
"attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of energy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "band-aid"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A tiny square of gauze stuck to a strip of sticky tape, usually used for "
"quickly covering superficial wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scalpel"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A very sharp knife designed for surgical cutting.  Its small, sharp blade "
"allows for precision strikes in the hands of the skilled."
msgstr ""
"Un couteau très aiguisé utilisé en chirurgie. Permet des coupures précises "
"dans les mains des plus agiles, mais sa petite taille le rends peu utile "
"comme arme de mêlée."

#. ~ Description of "alcohol wipe"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A wet wipe saturated with alcohol and stored in a sterile package."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "inhaler"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"An albuterol inhaler.  Used in the treatment of bronchospasm, it is a "
"lifeline for people with asthma.  A mild stimulant, it may cause anxiety or "
"tremors."
msgstr ""
"Un inhalateur de salbutamol. Utilisé pour traiter les spasmes bronchiaux, "
"ceci est une planche de salut pour les asmathiques. Ceci est cependant un "
"stimulant doux qui peut causer de la nervosité ou des frissons lorsqu'il est "
"utilisé."

#. ~ Description of "cotton balls"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy balls of clean, white cotton.  They can serve as makeshift bandages "
"in an emergency."
msgstr ""
"Des boules de laine de coton blanc hygiéniques. Utile pour nettoyer les "
"blessures ou pour servir de bandage en cas d'urgence."

