#. ~ Description of "electric hair trimmer"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"A pocket-sized electric trimmer made for cutting hair.  You can use it to "
"cut your hair if it's supplied with batteries.  It requires 1 unit of charge "
"per use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bathroom scale"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "A small bathroom scale, meant to weigh a person while naked."
msgstr ""
"Un petit pèse-personne de salle de bain, conçu pour mesurer le poids d'une "
"personne nue."

#. ~ Description of "washboard"
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"A wooden washboard.  It will make washing clothing and other soft items much "
