#. ~ Description of "circular saw (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, handheld cordless circular saw.  It is currently on and the "
"blade is spinning; use this item to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Une scie circulaire légère, portable et sans fil. Elle est actuellement "
"allumée et la scie est en train de tourner. Utilisez l'objet pour l'éteindre."

#. ~ Description of "circular saw (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, handheld cordless circular saw.  Spins a circular blade fast "
"enough to cut wood, zombies, or in an emergency, pizza.  The blade, while "
"effective in combat, is hard to hit with due to its small size."
msgstr ""
"Une scie circulaire légère, portable et sans fil capable de faire tourner sa "
"scie assez vite pour couper à travers du bois, des zombies ou, en cas "
"d'urgence, une pizza. La lame, assez efficace en combat, et tout de même "
"assez difficile à utiliser dû à sa petite taille. Utilisez l'objet pour "
"l'allumer."

#. ~ Description of "pole saw (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lumbering tool intended for trimming hedges and tree branches at a "
"distance.  If loaded with gas, using this item will cause it to turn on, "
"making it into an unwieldy polearm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bow saw"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A saw that is more at home outdoors than inside.  It's used for trimming "
"trees, pruning, and cutting firewood, but may be used for other rough cuts "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"Une scie plus à sa place en pleine nature qu'à l'intérieur d'un atelier. "
"Utilisée pour tailler et élaguer des arbres ainsi que produire du feu de "
"bois, mais pourrait aussi être utilisée pour couper un arbre."

#. ~ Description of "luthier toolset"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A set of luthier tools in several sizes and types.  Guaranteed to have the "
"right tools for creating musical instruments from wood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stone chisel"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A short, primitive chisel made from hard stone, usually used for primitive "
"woodworking."
msgstr ""
"Un ciseau en pierre rudimentaire apte à être utilisé pour travailler le bois "
"de façon primitive."

#. ~ Description of "wood saw"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A thin saw, useful for cutting through wood objects.  Activate it to turn "
"pre-cut logs into planks."
msgstr ""
"Une scie fine, utile pour couper à travers des objets en bois. Activez-la "
"pour transformer des bûches en planches."

#. ~ Description of "electric chainsaw (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A treecutting tool moonlighting as a weapon of opportunity.  If loaded with "
"batteries, using this item will turn it on, turning it into a very powerful "
"but unwieldy melee weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainsaw (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
