#. ~ Description of "wearable professional camera"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A 35 mm digital SLR (single-lens reflex) camera with optical and digital "
"viewfinders, a zoom lens with auto-focus and stabilizer, and flash.  You can "
"look at your photos on the digital screen or transfer them with any standard "
"electronic device.  Before the Cataclysm, you could have taken professional-"
"grade photos using this. This one can be worn over your neck"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "RX11 stimulant delivery system"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A Rivtech RX11 stimulant delivery system, a jet autoinjector system worn on "
"the user's leg.  A simple press of its activator injects powerful chemical "
"stimulants into the bloodstream without using a needle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "malfunctioning five-point anchor"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A battered disc-shaped device mounted on a harness.  The words \"5-point "
"anchor\" are inscribed on its front and back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift blindfold (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A crude eye covering woven from blades of grass with string attached to "
"fasten it.  It's currently raised, letting you see.  Use to lower it."
msgstr ""
"Un masque pour yeux rudimentaire tissé à partir de brindilles d'herbes et de "
"ficelle pour bien l'enfiler. Utile pour dormir même lorsque vous êtes dans "
"un endroit illuminé. Utilisez-le pour couvrir vos yeux avec."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift blindfold"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A crude eye covering woven from blades of grass with string attached to "
"fasten it.  Useful for sleeping in bright areas.  Use to raise it."
msgstr ""
"Un masque pour yeux rudimentaire tissé à partir de brindilles d'herbes et de "
"ficelle pour bien l'enfiler. Utile pour dormir même lorsque vous êtes dans "
"un endroit illuminé. Utilisez-le pour le lever de vos yeux."

#. ~ Description of "crude welding mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A crude welding mask made from shaped steel.  It will keep your face safe "
"while welding, but it's a bit less comfortable than the real deal.  Activate "
"it to push it up your head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crude welding mask (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A crude welding mask made from shaped steel.  It's less dark than a proper "
"welding mask, and therefore less difficult to see in, but also less "
"protective when welding.  Activate it to lower it over your face."
msgstr ""
"Un masque de soudure rudimentaire fabriqué à partir d'acier martelé. La "
"visière est moins sombre, ce qui améliore votre visibilité lorsque vous le "
"portez comparé à un masque de soudure normal, mais cela veut aussi dire "
"qu'il protègent vos yeux moins efficacement lorsque vous soudez. Activez "
"l'objet pour l'abaisser sur votre visage."

#. ~ Description of "survivor divemask (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built, armored rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes "
"regardless of your state of mutation.  Provides excellent protection from "
"harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  It is turned on, and "
"continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor divemask (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built, armored rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes.  "
"Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas "
"while underwater.  It is turned on, and continually consuming its filter.  "
"Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor divemask"
#. ~ Description of "survivor divemask (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built, armored rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes.  "
"Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas "
"while underwater.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor firemask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-made leather gasmask faced with Nomex.  It must be prepared before "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "five-point anchor"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A featureless, disc-shaped device mounted on a harness.  The words \"5-point "
"anchor\" are inscribed on its front and back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tourniquet (arm)"
#. ~ Description of "tourniquet (leg)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A first aid device used to apply pressure to a limb or extremity in order to "
"limit blood flow.  Should be employed only to manage heavy bleeding, because "
"prolonged use will harm the limb.  It can be adjusted in size to fit "
"different limbs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fitness band"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A fitness band that can track your heartbeat, exercise level, and calories, "
"and also has a clock.  Activate to see your metrics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gas mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full gas mask that covers the face and eyes.  Provides excellent "
"protection from smoke, tear gas, and other contaminants.  It must be "
"prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric suit (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full-body suit of thin thermal underwear equipped with internal battery-"
"powered heating elements.  It is currently on, and continually draining "
"batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric suit"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full-body suit of thin thermal underwear equipped with internal battery-"
"powered heating elements.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "firefighter PBA mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full-face mask commonly used by firefighters.  The protective breathing "
"apparatus provides excellent protection from smoke, flame, and other "
"dangers.  It must be prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "heavy survivor mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A gas mask handcrafted from treated leather with a steel faceplate overtop.  "
"It must be prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A gas mask handcrafted from treated leather.  It must be prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor half mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A half-face gasmask handcrafted from treated leather.  It provides no "
"protection for the eyes, and must be activated before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "electric blanket"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heated blanket made of polyester.  Its power drain is usually negligible, "
"but without being able to plug it into a wall, it chews through batteries "
"insanely quickly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fedora"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A high-crowned, wide-brimmed, sable-colored fedora.  Its brim helps keep the "
"sun out of your eyes.  The perfect hat for treasure hunting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diving cylinder"
#. ~ Description of "diving cylinder (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A high-pressure 232 bar diving tank that can contain up to 12 L of a "
"compressed mixture of oxygen and nitrogen.  It is equipped with an on-demand "
"regulator and a mouthpiece designed mostly for underwater use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "go bag"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A huge duffel bag with a backpack attached, both packed to the gills.  "
"Judging by the feel, a National Guardsman could have packed this to be ready "
"for deployment.  Activate to unpack and enjoy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "personal go bag"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A huge duffel bag with a backpack attached, both packed to the gills.  You "
"packed this to be ready for deployment.  Activate to unpack and enjoy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "towel"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A large, fluffy towel.  It could be used to dry yourself.  Any person that "
"can travel the length and breadth of the apocalypse, rough it, slum it, "
"struggle against terrible odds, win through, and still know where their "
"towel is, is clearly a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "towel"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A large, sopping wet towel.  If you wait a little bit, it should dry out.  "
"Don't panic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "half-face gas mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, form-fitting mask that straps over your mouth and nose, "
"providing full protection from the inhalation of smoke, tear gas, and "
"chemical contaminants - though safety goggles are advised!  It must be "
"prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "filter mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask that straps over your mouth and nose and filters air.  Protects from "
"smoke, dust, and other contaminants quite well.  It must be prepared before "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rebreather mask (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask worn over your mouth which, when loaded with the proper filters, "
"recycles your exhaled breath for rebreathing while underwater.  It is turned "
"on, and continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Un masque porté sur la bouche que l'on charge avec des filtres qui recyclent "
"l'air expiré pour pouvoir le respirer à nouveau quand vous êtes sous l'eau. "
"Il est actif et consomme son filtre. Utilisez le pour l'éteindre."

#. ~ Description of "rebreather mask (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask worn over your mouth which, when loaded with the proper filters, "
"recycles your exhaled breath for rebreathing while underwater.  This model "
"has been expanded substantially and can accommodate exotic anatomy.  It is "
"turned on, and continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Un masque porté sur la bouche que l'on charge avec des filtres qui recyclent "
"l'air expiré pour pouvoir le respirer à nouveau quand vous êtes sous l'eau. "
"Ce modèle est suffisamment grand pour les morphologies mutés. Il est actif "
"et consomme son filtre. Utilisez le pour l'éteindre."

#. ~ Description of "rebreather mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask worn over your mouth which, when loaded with the proper filters, "
"recycles your exhaled breath for rebreathing while underwater.  This model "
"has been expanded substantially and can accommodate exotic anatomy.  Use it "
"to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Un masque porté sur la bouche que l'on charge avec des filtres qui recyclent "
"l'air expiré pour pouvoir le respirer à nouveau quand vous êtes sous l'eau. "
"Ce modèle est suffisamment grand pour les morphologies mutés. Utilisez le "
"pour l'activer."

#. ~ Description of "rebreather mask (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask worn over your mouth which, when loaded with the proper filters, "
"recycles your exhaled breath for rebreathing while underwater.  This model "
"has been shrunk dramatically to fit a smaller face.  It is turned on, and "
"continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rebreather mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask worn over your mouth which, when loaded with the proper filters, "
"recycles your exhaled breath for rebreathing while underwater.  This model "
"has been shrunk dramatically to fit a smaller face.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rebreather mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A mask worn over your mouth which, when loaded with the proper filters, "
"recycles your exhaled breath for rebreathing while underwater.  Use it to "
"turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Un masque porté sur la bouche que l'on charge avec des filtres qui recyclent "
"l'air expiré pour pouvoir le respirer à nouveau quand vous êtes sous l'eau. "
"Utilisez le pour l'activer."

#. ~ Description of "stethoscope"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A medical listening tool.  Use it to listen to things.  Closely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "military flight helmet (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A military flight helmet with various LED devices blinking periodically.  "
"Equipped with a visor, microphone, and noise dampening system.  The helmet "
"is also fitted with plastic rails to allow for different load-outs."
msgstr ""
"Un casque de pilote militaire équipé d'une visière, d'un microphone et d'un "
"système d'isolation sonore ainsi que de rails en plastique à l'extérieur "
"pour attacher des accessoires. Celui-ci est pour l'instant allumés et des "
"diodes LED variées clignotent occasionnellement."

#. ~ Description of "military flight helmet"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A military flight helmet.  Equipped with a visor, microphone, and an active "
"noise dampening system.  The helmet is also fitted with plastic rails to "
"allow for different loadouts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "combo cover"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A military officer's combo cover, or peaked cap.  It conveys an air of "
"authority, while keeping the sun out of your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wearable RX12 jet injector"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A modified RX12 jet injector which can be worn on the user's leg.  A label "
"on the side warns against using more than two doses per hour."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "infrared goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of battery-powered goggles that grant infrared vision, allowing you "
"to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "infrared goggles"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of battery-powered goggles that grant infrared vision, allowing you "
"to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark.  Use it to turn them on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "light amp goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of battery-powered goggles that use a infrared LED in conjunction "
"with a IR camera, allowing you to see in the dark.  It is turned on, and "
"continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "light amp goggles"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of battery-powered goggles that use a infrared LED in conjunction "
"with a IR camera, allowing you to see in the dark.  Use it to turn them on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "basic AR glasses"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of compact augmented reality glasses with some basic functionality.  "
"There is a camera on the rim, and it has an alarm clock feature."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "shooter's earmuffs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned on, and "
"will block sounds over a certain decibel amount while otherwise allowing you "
"to hear normally."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "shooter's earmuffs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  Without batteries or when turned "
"off, they function like normal earmuffs and block all sound.  They will only "
"block sounds over a certain decibel amount when turned on, to protect your "
"ears from injury while otherwise allowing you to hear normally.  The "
"earmuffs are currently off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric gloves (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves with internal battery-powered heating elements.  They are "
"currently on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric gloves"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use it to "
"turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "shooter's ear plugs (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of in-ear drivers designed to dampen loud sounds and amplify quiet "
"sounds.  The earplugs are turned on, and will block sounds over a certain "
"decibel amount while otherwise allowing you to hear normally."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "shooter's ear plugs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of in-ear drivers designed to dampen loud sounds and amplify quiet "
"sounds.  Without batteries or when turned off, they function like normal "
"earplugs and block most sound.  They will only block sounds over a certain "
"decibel amount when turned on, to protect your ears from injury while "
"otherwise allowing you to hear normally.  The earplugs are currently off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "attached ear plugs (in)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of industrial-grade ear plugs attached together by some string.  They "
"are inside your ears, activate them to take them out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "attached ear plugs (out)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of industrial-grade ear plugs, they are attached together by some "
"string.  They hang around your neck, use them to plug them in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift ear plugs (in)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of makeshift ear plugs made from lumps of wax on the ends of a piece "
"of string.  They are inside your ears, activate them to take them out."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de bouchons d'oreilles de fortune fabriqués à partir de deux "
"morceaux de cire à travers lesquels une ficelle a été insérée. Ils sont pour "
"le moment dans vos oreilles, activez-les pour déboucher vos oreilles."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift ear plugs (out)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of makeshift ear plugs made from lumps of wax on the ends of a piece "
"of string.  They hang around your neck, use them to plug them in."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de bouchons d'oreilles de fortune fabriqués à partir de deux "
"morceaux de cire à travers lesquels une ficelle a été insérée. Ils sont pour "
"le moment autour de votre cou, activez-les pour boucher vos oreilles."

#. ~ Description of "binoculars"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of optics with a neck strap attached.  Useful for seeing long "
"distances.  Wearing this item or carrying it in your inventory will double "
"the distance around you that is mapped during your travels.  You could also "
"use them to focus the sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de jumelles avec une courroie de cou attachée. Utile pour voir sur "
"de longues distances. En portant cet objet ou en le gardant dans votre "
"inventaire, vous doublerez la distance autour de vous qui est cartographiée "
"pendant vos déplacements. Vous pouvez également les utiliser pour focaliser "
"la lumière du soleil."

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric socks (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of socks with internal battery-powered heating elements.  They are "
"currently on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric socks"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of socks with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use it to "
"turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Un paire de chaussettes équipées d'une résistance chauffante alimentée par "
"des piles. Utilisez l'objet pour les allumer."

#. ~ Description of "flower hairpin"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A pink hairpin with cute flower textures."
msgstr "Une épingle à cheveux rose décorée de motifs floraux mignons."

#. ~ Description of "hairpin"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A plain hairpin to keep your hair in place."
msgstr "Une épingle à cheveux banale pour maintenir vos cheveux en place."

#. ~ Description of "welding mask (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A plastic mask with a very dark visor, meant to protect the entire face "
"while welding.  It also serves as somewhat good armor, but makes it hard to "
"see.  Activate it to lower it over your face."
msgstr ""
"Un masque en plastique avec un visière très sombre conçu pour protéger tout "
"votre visage durant une soudure et pouvant servir comme assez bonne armure "
"pour votre tête, mais la visière réduit votre visibilité effroyablement. "
"Activez l'objet pour l'abaisser sur votre visage."

#. ~ Description of "welding mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A plastic mask with a very dark visor, meant to protect the entire face "
"while welding.  It also serves as somewhat good armor, but makes it hard to "
"see.  Activate it to push it up your head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wearable camera"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A point-and-shoot digital camera with a digital viewfinder, a backup 'iron-"
"sight', and flash.  You can look at your photos on the digital screen, or "
"transfer them with any standard electronic device. This one can be worn over "
"your neck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "electric blanket (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A polyester blanket with an electric heating unit inside.  It's turned on, "
"making it nice and toasty while it lasts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sallet helm"
#. ~ Description of "sallet helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A popular German helmet of the late medieval era, the sallet covers the head "
"and eyes.  Activate it to toggle the visor."
msgstr ""
"Un heaume allemand populaire de la fin du Moyen Âge, le sallet couvre la "
"tête et les yeux, laissant la bouche et la mâchoire à découvert."

#. ~ Description of "gas mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A rather roomy mask with filters attached, designed to accommodate exotic "
"anatomy.  Provides excellent protection from smoke, tear gas, and other "
"contaminants.  It must be prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gas mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A rather small gas mask that covers the face and eyes.  Provides excellent "
"protection from smoke, tear gas, and other contaminants.  It must be "
"prepared before use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift stethoscope"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A relatively cumbersome DIY child's medical listening toy.  Use it to listen "
"to things.  Closely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "riot helmet"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A riot helmet with a plastic face shield that covers your entire face.  "
"Activate to raise the face shield."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "riot helmet (raised visor)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A riot helmet with a plastic face shield, which is raised up.  Activate to "
"lower the shield."
msgstr ""
"Un casque de police anti-émeutes avec une visière en plastique, pour "
"l'instant relevée. Activez-le pour abaisser la visière."

#. ~ Description of "duct tape blindfold (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple covering tied over the eyes to block sight, made out of duct tape.  "
"It's currently raised, letting you see.  Use to lower it."
msgstr ""
"Un assemblage de ruban adhésif utilisé pour couvrir les yeux afin de pouvoir "
"bien dormir dans des endroits illuminés. Utilisez-le pour couvrir vos yeux "
"avec."

#. ~ Description of "duct tape blindfold"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple covering tied over the eyes to block sight, made out of duct tape.  "
"Useful for sleeping in bright areas.  Use to raise it."
msgstr ""
"Un assemblage de ruban adhésif utilisé pour couvrir les yeux afin de pouvoir "
"bien dormir dans des endroits illuminés. Utilisez-le pour le lever de vos "
"yeux."

#. ~ Description of "blindfold (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple fabric covering tied over the eyes to block sight.  It's currently "
"raised, letting you see.  Use to lower it."
msgstr ""
"Un simple morceau de tissu utilisé pour couvrir les yeux afin de pouvoir "
"bien dormir dans des endroits illuminés. Utilisez-le pour couvrir vos yeux "
"avec."

#. ~ Description of "blindfold"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple fabric covering tied over the eyes to block sight.  Useful for "
"sleeping in bright areas.  Use to raise it."
msgstr ""
"Un simple morceau de tissu utilisé pour couvrir les yeux afin de pouvoir "
"bien dormir dans des endroits illuminés. Utilisez-le pour le lever de vos "
"yeux."

#. ~ Description of "whistle"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A simple metal whistle, with a cord to wear it around your neck."
msgstr ""
"Un simple sifflet en métal, avec une cordelette pour le porter autour du cou."

#. ~ Description of "small diving cylinder"
#. ~ Description of "small diving cylinder (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A small, high-pressure 200 bar backup diving tank that can contain 4 L of a "
"compressed mixture of oxygen and nitrogen.  It is equipped with an on-demand "
"regulator and a mouthpiece designed mostly for underwater use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "atomic headlamp (covered)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A small, very dim lamp powered by the magic of nuclear decay.  The "
"adjustable strap allows it to be comfortably worn on your head or attached "
"to your helmet.  Use it to open the cover and shed some light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric balaclava (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A snug cloth mask with internal battery-powered heating elements.  It is are "
"currently on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thermal electric balaclava"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A snug cloth mask with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use it to "
"turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "straw fedora"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A straw fedora hat, comfortable and stylish.  Its brim helps keep the sun "
"out of your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "arm splint"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A tool to help set arm bones and hold them in place."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "arm splint"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A tool to help set arm bones and hold them in place.  It is specifically "
"designed to fit huge survivors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "arm splint"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A tool to help set arm bones and hold them in place.  It is specifically "
"designed to fit tiny survivors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leg splint"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A tool to help set leg bones and hold them in place."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourriez garder une jambe en place et permettre à une fracture de bien "
"se resouder avec ceci."

#. ~ Description of "leg splint"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A tool to help set leg bones and hold them in place.  It is specifically "
"designed to fit Huge people."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourriez garder une jambe énorme en place et permettre à une fracture "
"de bien se resouder avec ceci."

#. ~ Description of "leg splint"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A tool to help set leg bones and hold them in place.  It is specifically "
"designed to fit Tiny people."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourriez garder une petite jambe en place et permettre à une fracture "
"de bien se resouder avec ceci."

#. ~ Description of "smart watch"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A touchscreen watch that comes with many uses, such as a calendar, alarm, "
"and even a fitness app, for when you want to check your health on the go!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "atomic headlamp"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A very dim lamp powered by the magic of nuclear decay.  It's a bit bulkier "
"than your average headlamp, but can be worn like one just the same.  Use it "
"to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ski mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A warm wool mask that protects the head and face from the cold.  It covers "
"most of your head and mouth, and can be adjusted to hang around your throat "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ski mask (collar)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A warm wool mask that protects the head and face from the cold.  It is "
"wrapped around your throat, and can be adjusted to cover your mouth and more "
"of your head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "game watch"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A waterproof digital watch with a built-in electronic game system, powered "
"by standard batteries.  Activate to play."
msgstr ""
"Une montre digitale étanche équipée d'un système de jeu intégré et alimentée "
"avec des batteries standard. Activez l'objet pour jouer avec."

#. ~ Description of "headlamp (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"An LED headlamp with an adjustable strap so as to be comfortably worn on "
"your head or attached to your helmet.  It is turned on, and continually "
"draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "headlamp"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"An LED headlamp with an adjustable strap so as to be comfortably worn on "
"your head or attached to your helmet.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "five-point anchor"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#, c-format
msgid "An LED light in the %s flickers on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "EOD helmet"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"An armored, electronically-shielded helmet containing a camera, a two-way "
"radio, and a headlamp, all of which can be voice-activated for redundancy.  "
"It is designed to protect against overpressure, fragmentation, impact, and "
"heat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "advanced AR glasses"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"An expensive model of augmented reality glasses designed with adaptive light "
"correction and some gadgets.  An augmented reality overlay allows the user "
"to zoom their view and display handy information about local topology."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armet helm"
#. ~ Description of "armet helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"An iconic knightly helm of the late Middle Ages.  When you think of a "
"knight's helmet, it looks something like this.  Activate it to toggle the "
"visor."
msgstr ""
"Un heaume de chevalier médiéval iconique, lorsque vous vous imaginez un "
"heaume de chevalier, ceci est probablement le style de casque qui vous vient "
"à l'esprit en premier. Activez-le pour abaisser ou lever la visière."

#. ~ Description of "phase immersion suit"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"Covered in interlocking plates of reflective metal, this advanced suit "
"resembles an astronaut's space suit.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "phase immersion suit (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"Covered in interlocking plates of reflective metal, this advanced suit "
"resembles both plate armor and an astronaut's spacesuit.  It is turned on, "
"and continually draining power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Couverte de plaques emboitées de métal brillant, cette combinaison high tech "
"à un air de famille à la fois avec une armure de plaques médiévale et une "
"combinaison d'astronaute. Elle est pour l'instant allumée et en train de "
"consommer de l'électricité. Utilisez-la pour l'éteindre."

