#. ~ Description of "drive by wire controls"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"A fully electronic vehicle control system.  You could control it remotely if "
"you had the proper tools."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "reinforced security camera"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"A security camera with a cage built around it to protect it from damage "
"without reducing its effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Une caméra de sécurité à laquelle une cage a été ajoutée pour la protéger "
"sans la rendre moins utile."

#. ~ Description of "security camera"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"A security camera you could connect to a display.  Image quality is quite "
"low, but the field of vision is great."
msgstr ""
"Une caméra de sécurité que vous pourriez connecter à un écran. La résolution "
"est plutôt mauvaise mais le champ de vision est grand."

#. ~ Description of "rein and tackle"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid "A set of leather bindings to control a mountable creature."
msgstr ""
"Un assemblage de lanières et sangles utilisées pour contrôler une créature "
"que vous chevauchez."

#. ~ Description of "turret control unit"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"A set of motors, cameras, and various electronic modules banded together to "
"allow for tracking targets, friend-or-foe identification, and firing the "
"connected turret in full automatic mode."
msgstr ""
"Un assemblage de moteurs, caméras et une variété d'autres modules "
"électroniques capables ensemble lorsque installés sur une tourelle "
"d'acquisition de cible, d'identification ami/ennemi et de tir complétement "
"autonome."

#. ~ Description of "robot driving unit"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"A set of servos, microcontrollers, and other devices, together capable of "
"driving an unmanned vehicle.  Its AI is not functional, but it should still "
"have some sort of maintenance mode."
msgstr ""
"Un assemblage de servomoteurs, microcontrôleurs et autres composants "
"électroniques capable de conduire un véhicule autonome. Son IA ne fonctionne "
"pas, mais il devrait être possible d'accéder à un mode de maintenance et "
"l'utiliser pour radio-télécommander un véhicule."

#. ~ Description of "camera display"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid "A set of small monitors.  Required to view cameras' output."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble de petits écrans. Nécessaire pour visualiser l'image des caméras."

#. ~ Description of "vehicle controls"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid "A set of various vehicle controls.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble de plusieurs commandes pour véhicule. Utile pour l'artisanat."

#. ~ Description of "dashboard"
#. ~ Description of "electronics control unit"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"A vehicle instrument panel with various gauges and switches.  Useful for "
"crafting."
msgstr ""
"Un tableau de bord de véhicule avec de nombreux cadrans et boutons. Utile "
"pour l'artisanat."

#. ~ Description of "hand controls"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"An accessibility tool for the paraplegic or very short, this is a simple "
"pair of metal tubes that clamp to a vehicle's gas and brake pedals, allowing "
"them to be operated by hand with the help of a trigger."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pedal extenders"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"It is probably not a great idea, but if you wanted to, you could tape these "
"blocks to a vehicle's gas and brake pedals so that a kid or very short adult "
"could drive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pedal extenders"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/controls.json
msgid ""
"These thick rubber pads can clamp securely onto a vehicle's gas and brake "
"pedals, allowing even very short people to drive a car."
msgstr ""

