#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan is a style of kung fu that mimics the "
"unpredictable movements of a drunk.  You gain a passive Dodging skill bonus "
"based on Intelligence and dodge attempts.  Dodging increases your damage and "
"accuracy based on Intelligence for a short time.  Moving gives you an "
"additional dodging bonus."
msgstr ""

