msgstr[1] "Cerbères"
msgstr[2] "Cerbères"

#. ~ Description of monster "destrier"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"From a distance, this freak of nature could almost be taken for a draft "
"horse but for its tufted ears and the set of its eyes, mounted at the front "
"of its face beneath the cunning brow of a predator.  Its hooves are splayed "
"out to form three-toed claws that grip rock and soil alike as it prowls the "
"fields, and from time to time an overlong forked tongue slips out of its "
"fanged maw to taste the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "dextrous raccoon"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"Its paws have grown to be longer, and it seems capable of briefly standing "
"on its hindlimbs.  You wonder if this sleazy beast is able to open doors yet."
msgstr ""

