#. ~ Description of monster "firefighter zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A decaying human body clad in tattered firefighting gear.  It staggers "
"aimlessly, reeking of smoke and decay.  Its protective mask prevents it from "
"attempting to bite you."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain en décomposition vêtu d’un équipement de lutte contre les "
"incendies en lambeaux. Il titube sans but, empestant la fumée et la "
"pourriture. Son masque de protection l'empêche de tenter de vous mordre."

#. ~ Description of monster "scarred zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, its skin transformed into one thick, calloused "
"envelope of scar tissue."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain déformé, possédant une peau couverte d'un ensemble de tissu "
"cicatrisé épais."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cop"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A human body covered by a weather-beaten and badly damaged set of police "
"gear."
msgstr ""
"Un mort-vivant portant toujours un uniforme de police gravement abîmé ayant "
"vu des meilleures années."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain traînant des pieds et oscillant au rythme de ses pas, habité "
"par une rage implacable visible derrière ses yeux noirs huileux."

#. ~ Description of monster "decayed zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A once-dead human corpse in a particularly advanced state of decay.  Its "
"flesh sloughs away in patches and the swarm of insects crawling in and out "
"of it are nearly as revolting as the smell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "SWAT zombie"
msgid_plural "SWAT zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie SWAT"
msgstr[1] "zombies SWAT"
msgstr[2] "zombies SWAT"

#. ~ Description of monster "fat zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"Stumbling as it moves, this corpse of an overweight human regards its "
"surroundings with an empty black gaze."
msgstr ""
"Trébuchant quand il marche, ce corps d'un humain en surpoids regarde ce qui "
"l'entoure avec un regard fixe, noir et vide."

#. ~ Description of monster "crawling zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This human corpse drags itself along slowly with its arms.  Its lower half "
"is damaged beyond repair."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bouncer zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This muscular zombie is dressed in the tattered remnants of a security "
"uniform."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie musclé est vêtu des restes en lambeaux d'un uniforme de sécurité."

#. ~ Description of monster "tough zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This was once an athletic human, now a brutal monster.  Its facial features "
"are twisted into an expression of pure rage."
msgstr ""
"C'était autrefois un humain athlétique, maintenant un monstre brutal. Ses "
"traits du visage sont déformés en une expression de pure rage."

#. ~ Description of monster "hazmat zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This zombie is completely encased in a protective suit that apparently "
"failed to protect it from whatever this infection is.  At least it can't "
"bite you from inside that suit."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie est complètement enveloppé dans une combinaison de protection qui "
"n'a apparemment pas réussi à le protéger de cette infection, quelle qu'elle "
"soit. Au moins, il ne peut pas te mordre depuis l'intérieur de cette "
"combinaison."

#. ~ Description of monster "sleek zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "This zombie is rather sleek and scantily clothed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "SWAT zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This zombie was part of a specialized unit of law enforcement.  It still "
"wears a battered armor with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front.  The "
"protective mask makes its head a difficult target, but also prevents it from "
"biting you."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie faisait partie d'une unité spécialisée des forces de l'ordre. Il "
"porte toujours une armure battue avec le logo SWAT imprimé sur le devant. Le "
"masque de protection fait de sa tête une cible difficile, mais l'empêche "
"également de vous mordre."

#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "hazmat zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "a tear in its hazmat suit"
msgstr "une brèche dans la combinaison"

