#. ~ Description of monster "rust urchin"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"A spiked horror of a zombie covered in long, rusty spikes.  A walking "
"tetanus infection waiting to happen."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre hérissé de longues pointes de ferraille rouillés. Une infection "
"de tétanos sur deux pieds."

#. ~ Description of monster "rust zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"A zombie impaled with a multitude of metal fragments, each covered with a "
"thick layer of rust that seems to propagate to other parts of its body.  You "
"can't remember the last time you got a tetanus shot, so it would be best not "
"to let this thing touch you."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie empalé d'une multitude de fragments de métal couverts d'une couche "
"épaisse de rouille ayant l'air de se propager à sa chair. Vous ne vous "
"rappelez pas exactement de la dernière fois que vous avez été vacciné contre "
"le tétanos, donc il serait probablement une bonne idée de ne pas laisser "
"cette chose vous toucher."

#. ~ Description of monster "magnetic zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"A zombie like any other, but there's a strange feeling in the air around "
"it.  Bits of black dust and small metal objects stick to it like magnets on "
"a fridge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "magnetokinetic zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"A zombie surrounded by a whorl of black dust - iron filings, held in a "
"magnetic storm that surrounds it like a hurricane.  It drags bits of metal "
"along with it as it goes, and periodically, the area around it shimmers and "
"warps as if seen through a distorted lens."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "rust shell zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"Jagged fragments of rust-bitten metal have fused into this zombie's flesh "
"and displaced parts of its spine."
msgstr ""
"Des morceaux de métal incrustés de rouille ont fusionnés avec la chair de ce "
"zombie, déformant partiellement sa colonne vertébrale."

#. ~ Description of monster "rust plated zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armor "
"underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."
msgstr ""
"Les fissures et plaies de la peau de ce zombie révèlent des fragments de "
"métal rouillés arrangés comme une armure en dessous. Un liquide noir aillant "
"l'air de remplacer la rouille s'incruste sur certaines portions de ceux-ci."

#. ~ Description of monster "Slag Hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid ""
"Several workers died beneath a cascade of molten slag, their bodies "
"shriveling and contorting together under the unimaginable heat.  The metal "
"cracked and cooled, but they did not stay dead.  Still largely encased in "
"their mineral prison, revivified muscle and bone now drag the lumpen mass "
"along on four ungainly limbs that must have once been human beings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
msgid "Slag Hulk"
msgid_plural "Slag Hulks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

