msgstr[1] "agents de sécurité zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "agents de sécurité zombifiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "grabber zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A badly deformed zombie.  Its arms dangle from its sides like the limbs of "
"some skinless ape, mindlessly groping at their surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain aux bras déformés pendants sur ses flancs comme un orang-"
"outan nu. Ses bras grotesques tâtonnent les environs de façon mal coordonnée."

#. ~ Description of monster "smoker zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A blackened and twisted naked human body.  Strips of flesh hang from its "
"frame, and it emits a constant haze of thick, stinking smoke."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "slavering biter"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A distorted and swollen human body.  Its jaws have elongated into a "
"crocodile-like snout, dripping with foul-smelling saliva."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre humain déformé et bouffi, sa mâchoire ayant été allongée en une "
"gueule rappelant celle d'un crocodile de laquelle de la salive infâme goutte."

#. ~ Description of monster "ashen brawler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic, twisted human frame with a menacing stance and rapid movements.  "
"Thick clouds of smoke pour from violent-looking eviscerations spread across "
"its muscular body, and its arms appear to have elongated massively."
msgstr ""
"Une silhouette humaine gigantesque et tordue avec une position menaçante et "
"des mouvements rapides. D'épais nuages de fumée s'échappent des "
"éviscérations d'apparence violente réparties sur son corps musclé, et ses "
"bras semblent s'être allongés massivement."

#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A hairless zombie.  Its pale, pinkish flesh appears to be squirming and "
"moving across its body, quickly covering and fixing any wounds that it "
"receives.  Its clothing is riddled with holes, suggesting someone else "
"tried, and failed, to take it down."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie glabre. Sa chair pâle et rosâtre semble se tortiller et se "
"déplacer sur son corps, couvrant et réparant rapidement toutes les blessures "
"qu'il reçoit. Ses vêtements sont criblés de trous, ce qui suggère que "
"quelqu'un d'autre a essayé, sans succès, de l'abattre."

#. ~ Description of monster "relentless hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A hulking zombie swollen to the size of six men.  Its dead-white eyes are "
"locked on you.  No matter how far you run, it always seems to find you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hulk"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A human corpse swollen to the size of six men, with arms as wide as trash "
"cans."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre humain gonflé à la taille de six hommes, avec des bras aussi "
"larges que des poubelles."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie frog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A hypothetical frog of the zombie variety.  You should not be seeing it "
"without debug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "frog mother"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A large, bulbous creature with an extremely large mouth and small, stubby "
"legs with no feet.  Its flesh seems to rapidly decompose and reconstitute "
"itself, and it is covered in large, white pustules that seem ready to pop."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "thorny shambler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A shambling undead humanoid, its body overgrown with a tangled mass of "
"otherworldly vegetation.  Hunched over and dragging its feet as it moves, "
"the bramble utterly enveloping its upper half twitches and moves with a life "
"of its own, tendrils tipped with a paralytic sting."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoïde mort-vivant traînant, son corps recouvert d'une masse "
"enchevêtrée de végétation d'un autre monde. Courbée et traînant les pieds "
"lorsqu'elle se déplace, la ronce enveloppant complètement sa moitié "
"supérieure se contracte et se déplace avec sa propre vie, ses vrilles "
"terminées par un dard paralysant."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie wrestler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A slab of festering muscle the size of a well-toned bodybuilder.  With "
"popping and cracking sounds its arm muscles constantly lengthen and contract "
"as it reaches out with deformed muscular hands the size of dinner plates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "swimmer zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A slick and glistening human body, face and belly bloated from what must "
"have been a watery death.  Its hands and feet are elongated and webbed, "
"suggesting some kind of rapid aquatic evolution."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "screecher zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A thin corpse, its chest swollen in what appears to be preparation.  Its "
"filmy eyes bulge, seeking threats with a nervous energy not commonly seen in "
"the undead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie necromancer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A twisted mockery of the human form, emaciated, with jet-black skin and "
"glowing red eyes.  It is somehow painful to look at, awakening fears deep "
"within your psyche, and even the surrounding air seems more sinister, "
"somehow darker and more dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Une parodie de la forme humaine émaciée à la peau noire sur noir et aux yeux "
"rouges maléfiques. Regarder ce zombie trop longtemps vous fait mal aux yeux "
"et révèle des peurs tapies dans votre psyché et rends l'air autour de cette "
"abomination encore plus sinistre, sombre et dangereux."

#. ~ Description of monster "headless zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A zombie like any other, except that at some point it suffered a "
"catastrophic head injury.  Blind and deaf, it still gropes mindlessly for "
"something to attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "drowned zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A zombie that must have died in or near water judging by its pallor and "
"swollen, waterlogged state."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "shrieker zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"An elongated human body with a swollen chest and a gaping hole where its jaw "
"used to be."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain allongé, au buste enflé et avec un trou béant là ou se "
"trouvait sa mâchoire."

#. ~ Description of monster "shady zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is its shambling, human-shaped "
"outline."
msgstr ""
"Un ombre étrange enveloppe cette créature, donnant l'impression que la "
"lumière elle-même est trop repoussée par cette abomination pour la toucher. "
"Tout ce que vous pouvez distinguer à travers est une silhouette humanoïde "
"titubante."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie necro-boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"At first this creature looks like nothing more than a grotesque and "
"oleaginous husk, bloated and punctured by jet-black pustules.  When "
"approached, its glowing red eyes and an aching grin take form; its skin "
"tears and its guts teem with unmatched fecundity, as its gaze inspires fear "
"of nothing less than cosmic, inhuman ecstasy."
msgstr ""
"À première vue, cette créature ne ressemble à rien d’autre qu’une enveloppe "
"grotesque et oléagineuse, gonflée et percée de pustules noir de jais. "
"Lorsqu'on l'approche, ses yeux rouges brillants et son sourire douloureux "
"prennent forme ; sa peau se déchire et ses tripes regorgent d'une fécondité "
"inégalée, tandis que son regard inspire la peur de rien de moins qu'une "
"extase cosmique et inhumaine."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie prowler"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Enveloped in darkness is the outline of what used to be a person, quick and "
"spindly - and nigh invisible in the shadows.  Even with the unnatural "
"camouflage hiding its features you can make out large teeth and even larger "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"Enveloppé dans l'obscurité se trouve le contour de ce qui était autrefois "
"une personne, rapide et grêle - et presque invisible dans l'ombre. Même avec "
"le camouflage artificiel qui cache ses caractéristiques, vous pouvez "
"distinguer de grandes dents et des griffes encore plus grandes."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "frog mother"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Some of the pustules pop, and the frog mother opens her mouth and vomits "
"tadpoles!"
msgstr "Des pustules éclatent et le crapaud nourrice vomit des têtards!"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie nightstalker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Somehow, this brute hides in the dark like some kind of boogeyman.  It is "
"very agile for such a large zombie."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie technician"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Still wearing its work clothes and hardhat, this zombie likely used to work "
"on power lines or other electrical equipment."
msgstr ""
"Il porte toujours ses vêtements de travail et son casque de chantier. Ce "
"zombie travaillait sur les lignes hautes tension et les équipements "
"électriques."

#. ~ Death message of monster "zombie necro-boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lets out an unholy screech, and the corpses around it stir."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole constrictor"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"The only resemblance this creature bears to a tadpole is its slick black-"
"green skin and slender body.  Its three appendages, resembling long "
"tentacles or pseudopods, propel it across the ground at maddening speed.  It "
"has no outward sensory organs or a mouth, and steam rises from its skin as "
"if it is burning away its own lifeforce to catch you."
msgstr ""
"La seul vague ressemblance entre cette créature et un têtard sont sa peau "
"luisante noir verdâtre et son corps épuré. Capable de propulsion à une "
"vitesse terrifiante en utilisant ses trois longs membres ressemblant à des "
"tentacules ou des pseudopodes, cette abomination dépourvue de bouche ou "
"d'yeux, vous observez clairement de la vapeur s'en échapper et réalisez "
"qu'elle est vraisemblablement en train de brûler son espérance de vie en "
"chargeant vers vous."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombullfrog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"The wound covered skin of this large bullfrog appears to be peeling in "
"places.  Its vacant stare passes by anything that isn't food, and it will "
"leap to devour anything it can."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal zombullfrog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This gigantic zombified frog lets out an ear splitting unholy wail as it "
"slowly takes notice of you.  Its mostly lethargic movements are offset by "
"its ability to leap great distances using its gargantuan stout legs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "headless horror"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This headless zombie has stretched out to frightening proportions, towering "
"almost nine feet tall.  Feelers which may have once been severed arteries "
"and ligaments sprout from its neck, extending the length of a man's body "
"like horrible antennae, quivering in response to the slightest sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie runner"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body moves quickly, darting its head back and forth and "
"gnawing at its hands."
msgstr ""
"Ce corps récemment transformé se déplace rapidement, balançant sa tête "
"d'avant en arrière tout en mastiquant ses mains."

#. ~ Description of monster "ravenous reenactor"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed in the tatters of an antiquated soldier's "
"uniform.  Either it was a historical reenactor, or zombies have also started "
"to time travel."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre traînant est vêtu des lambeaux d’un uniforme de soldat désuet. "
"Soit il s’agissait d’une reconstitution historique, soit les zombies ont "
"également commencé à voyager dans le temps."

#. ~ Description of monster "grappler zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's elongated arms drag along the ground as it moves.  It looks to "
"almost have a hunchback from the swollen shoulder muscles tearing though its "
"skin."
msgstr ""
"Un mort-vivant avec des bras grotesquement allongés qui traînent par terre. "
"Les muscles de ses épaules sont tellement hypertrophiés que ce mort-vivant a "
"l'air bossu."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie snapper"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's elongated head is nearly entirely given over to a crocodilian "
"maw full of daggerlike teeth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie brute"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez observer des muscles en train de gonfler et se réarranger sous "
"la peau distendue et couverte de plaies suppurantes de ce zombie."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie miner"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's face, hands, work clothes, and miner's helmet are fully "
"covered with stains of coal dust."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie portant une tenue de mineur est couvert d'une fine couche de "
"poudre de charbon."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie master"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's features have tightened, its lips pulled back into an "
"unnatural grin, revealing rows of blackened teeth beneath large, piercing "
"eyes.  It stands tall and its movements are fluid and tightly controlled.  A "
"feeling of danger permeates the surrounding air, and the light that falls on "
"it seems somehow harsher and more glaring."
msgstr ""
"Les traits de ce zombie se sont resserrés, ses lèvres retroussées en un "
"sourire contre nature, révélant des rangées de dents noircies sous de grands "
"yeux perçants. Il se dresse haut et ses mouvements sont fluides et "
"étroitement contrôlés. Un sentiment de danger imprègne l’air ambiant et la "
"lumière qui l’éclaire semble en quelque sorte plus dure et plus éclatante."

#. ~ Description of monster "listener zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's head was once obviously destroyed, but it looks like it's "
"undergone some misbegotten regeneration since then.  Putrid flesh has pushed "
"out of its neck-stump, forming a pseudo-head that looks like a melted "
"candle.  Oversized ears hang from the sides, twitching at the slightest "
"sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hollow"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's hollow black eyes survey its surroundings as it stretches and "
"bends in ways that whoever the original body belonged to never could.  The "
"only things that seem solid on this flexible, black-veined body are the rows "
"of sharp, black teeth.  You get the feeling that the only human thing "
"remaining is the skin, worn as one might wear clothes."
msgstr ""
"Les yeux noire comme du charbon de cette abomination surveillent les "
"environs tandis que son corps se tord et plie de façon dérangeante "
"évidemment impossible pour un corps humain. La seule partie de ce corps "
"souple et parsemé de veines noires qui semble toujours solide sont les "
"rangées de dents opaques carnassières. Vous avez la forte impression que la "
"seule chose humaine restante de ce cadavre est sa peau, portée comme une "
"combinaison."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie predator"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"With its joints in odd places and angles, this humanoid creature prowls "
"across the landscape with surprising speed.  Its teeth and arms are "
"sharpened into fine points, and greasy putrescence constantly seeps from its "
"shredded skin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hunter"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"You're barely able to believe this thing was ever human; it scrambles about "
"on all fours, its nails and teeth sharpened into dangerous-looking spikes."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez du mal à vous convaincre que cette chose est jamais été humaine "
"lorsque vous l'observez se déplacer rapidement à quatre pattes, ses ongles "
"et ses dents s'étant allongés et transformés en aiguilles vicieuses."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "ashen brawler"
msgid_plural "ashen brawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "colossal zombullfrog"
msgid_plural "colossal zombullfrogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "frog mother"
msgid_plural "frog mothers"
msgstr[0] "crapaud nourrice"
msgstr[1] "crapauds nourrices"
msgstr[2] "crapauds nourrices"

#. ~ Monster name
