msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  "
"I holed up in the forest for the night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I "
"heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty careful "
"though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on "
"some kind of thing, some monster worse than any zombie.  Some huge bug "
"thing, saying random phrases like some kind of broken tape recorder.  It was "
"dragging a few human bodies behind it, I couldn't tell if they were dead or "
"unconscious.  Honestly I didn't wait to find out, I ducked into the bushes "
"and tried not to breath until I couldn't hear it anymore."
msgstr ""

