msgid ""
"Yeah, it was like a… like a soft shelled crab, with tentacle mouths, and it "
"kept talking in different voices.  I saw it before it saw me, and I capped "
"it with my Remington.  That just pissed it off, but I got another couple "
"shots off while it charged me.  Third or fourth shot took it down.  I "
"figured out shit had hit the fan, somehow.  Headed to my cabin and camped "
"out there for a while, but I had to skip out when a bunch of <zombies> "
"showed up and trashed the place.  I ran into you not much later."
msgstr ""

