msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a "
"biochemist.  I did my postdoc work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  "
"I hadn't talked to Pat in ages… word has it, the government got wind of our "
"thesis, found out Pat did most of the heavy lifting, and that was the last "
"we talked for years.  So, I was a bit surprised to see an e-mail from Pat."
"Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru… even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a D&D game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""

