msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You mean what caused the riots and all that?  Well, they told us it was a "
"Chinese bioweapon but I have troubles believing anyone could engineer a "
"bioweapon that could do all this.  The only answer I can come up with, silly "
"though it sounds, is aliens."
msgstr ""

