msgid ""
"Yeah, you're telling me.  The rioters… they weren't even like humans, let "
"alone protesters.  Nothing like any protest I'd ever been in before.  That "
"didn't stop me.  I joined them, and I was as bad as a bunch of them.  "
"Smashed windows, beat up bystanders, burnt cars.  I remember ripping riot "
"gear off a cop and… nevermind.  I don't want to remember that."
msgstr ""

