#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for "
"the local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, "
"ordinary boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio "
"engineering, a bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got "
"serious, my neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my "
"things that I managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that "
"seemed abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, "
"until I met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr ""

