msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, "
"choking scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were "
"busting out of every part of her.  I… I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her "
"out of her misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"Si seulement j'avais fait ça. Cela aurait un acte de compassion. Rien "
"d'autre qu'un cri gargouillant sortait de ça bouche, son corps se déchirant "
"en lambeaux, des champignons et spores émergeant de chaque plaie. Je… Je me "
"suis enfui(e). J'aimerais avoir eu la force de l'achever, mais retourner là-"
"bas maintenant serait du suicide."

