msgid ""
"It's an invasion.  Or, at least, I think that's what they were trying to do "
"at first.  Sudden bouts of violence, sending agitators to riots, doing false "
"flags with covert and overt agents alike…  When they couldn't get what they "
"wanted, they went full 'scorched earth'.  They decided to destroy everything "
"instead."
msgstr ""

