msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest with you, I was paying more attention to wedding planning "
"than current events leading up to things.  I knew there were riots going on, "
"but they were out of town.  Even when they got closer to home, I tried to "
"ignore them so we could have our big day.  After the zombies started coming, "
"though, well that's when stuff got really weird.  When I was running from "
"the wedding I swear I saw the sky rip open and monsters fly out of the hole, "
"like something out of Independence Day.  I don't know what it all was, it "
"looked like black magic or something."
