msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in "
"the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Lucky enough, "
"I even found some good equipment out here, though unfortunately missing some "
"of the more sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things "
"here in the cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""

