#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"Enigma code cracked by Turing -> modern encryption technology -> internet "
"sentience arises and gives birth to AI in Chinese lab using new forms of "
"computation, aka: BIO-TECHNOLOGY, human AND robotic components TOGETHER.  "
"State media announces as 'fusion technology'.  Bio-weapon escapes lab, OF "
"COURSE.  Self-replicating bio-technology = imminent replacement of "
"humanity.  US gov now ACTIVELY manufacturing cover-ups for escaped bio-"
"weapon to maintain peace.  Follows same pattern as Roswell, Trinity (what "
"they told the public), oil pollution coverup (in my opinion).  Recent New "
"York 'mass psychosis events' instigated by them as cover.  PAID ACTORS on "
"speed dial but the THREAT IS REAL.  They are buying time, but what is the "
"play?"
msgstr ""

