#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Snippet in category "magic_8ball_good"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Oui."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You got it.  I'll let you know if I find any gold."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"You got it.\"  Cranberry grins.  \"I ask them if their drone got home in one "
"piece, and it did.  They said that my work wasn't bad at all and did a "
"little impromptu interview asking where I learned my skills and how I got to "
"the building.  I got the canned intro of 'we underestimated your "
"usefulness', and like you say, the rest is history.  Now we're here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You sound frustrated about it."
msgstr "Vous semblez frustré par ça."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You think we fixed the problem?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[200 gold] Here's a batch for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Leave.]"
msgstr "[Partir.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[Listen.]"
msgstr "[Écouter.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[Spend a while in silence.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Wait.]"
msgstr "[Attendre.]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"…Alright.  Well.  For starters, I lived alone in an apartment, and I didn't "
"have any family or relatives I really cared about, so things were a lot "
"easier for me than they could have been."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "…Did you just say \"placeholder text\" out loud?"
