msgstr "Prends une arme à feu si tu peux, fais ça vite..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Flag"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find a large federal building or school, they must have one."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez un grand bâtiment fédéral ou une école, ils doivent en avoir un."

#. ~ Description of mission "Find Relic"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Find a relic of a forgotten saint.  Places like <color_yellow>cathedrals</"
"color> or <color_yellow>museums</color> might have one."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez une relique d'un saint oublié. Des endroits comme les "
"<color_yellow>cathédrales</color> ou les <color_yellow>musées</color> "
"peuvent en avoir un."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find any antibiotics yet?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé les antibiotiques?"

#. ~ Description of mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Find something that may reveal what the church's stance is on these events.  "
"Something like <color_yellow>a priest's diary</color> would suffice."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez quelque chose qui pourrait révéler la position de l'Église sur ces "
"événements. Quelque chose comme <color_yellow>le journal d'un prêtre</color> "
"suffirait."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
msgstr "Suivez l'équipe Sarcophage"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Found a gunslinger?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé un mercenaire?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"From what I understand, the creatures you encountered surrounding this relic "
"were unlike anything I've heard of.  It is laughable that I now consider the "
"living dead to be part of our ordinary reality.  Never-the-less, the church "
"must have some explanation for these events.  I have located the residence "
"of a local clergy man, could you go to this address and recover any items "
"that may reveal what the church's stance is on these events?"
msgstr ""
"De ce que j'ai pu comprendre, les créatures qui protégeaient cette relique "
"ne ressemblaient a rien que je ne connaisse. C'est amusant de devoir "
"considérer que les mort-vivants font désormais partie de notre réalité. "
"Cependant l'église doit avoir des réponses sur ces événements. J'ai localisé "
"la maison d'un prêtre local, vous pourriez aller à cette addresse et ramener "
"tout indice que l'église aurait sur ces événements?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Fuck ya, America!"
msgstr "J't'emmerde, l'Amérique !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Fuck yeah, America!"
msgstr "L'Amérique est balèze !"

#. ~ Description of mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Gather <color_light_blue>20 cattail stalks</color> from the swamp and bring "
"them back to <color_light_red>learn how to craft cattail jelly</color>.  "
"Raise your <color_light_blue>ecology skill to at least 1</color> by "
"harvesting cattail stalks or foraging in underbrush."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgstr ""
"Rassemblez les tiges de quenouilles pour créer de la gelée de quenouilles"

#. ~ Description of mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Go to the cabin in the woods where the Tracker is camping and "
"<color_yellow>recruit them</color>."
msgstr ""
"Allez à la cabane dans les bois où campe le Traqueur et "
"<color_yellow>recrutez-les</color>."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got the photo?  Should've been in my gun safe."
msgstr "Vous avez la photo? Elle devait être quelque part dans le coffre fort."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got this knocked out?"
msgstr "Vous l'avez assomé?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got those cattail stalks yet?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Great work, Deputy.  We're in business."
msgstr "Beau boulot, shériff adjoint."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great!  Be careful out there, and don't be afraid to forage around in any "
"underbrush you pass, too.  You never know what you'll find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Great!  Hand them over and I'll show you how this works."
msgstr ""
"Super! Remettez-les-moi et je vais vous montrer comment cela fonctionne."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Great!  I'm with you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, anything I can't use to prosecute the bastards is yours, as promised."
msgstr ""
"Super, tout ce que je ne peux utiliser contre ces bâtards est à vous , comme "
"promis."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, just let me know when you are ready to wade knee-deep in an ocean of "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"Super, faites-moi savoir quand vous serez prêt à patauger jusqu'aux genoux "
"dans un océan de sang."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, let's see… uh… hmmm….  Fine, I didn't even do my own taxes but I'm "
"sure this will prove their guilt if we get an expert to examine it."
msgstr ""
"Super, voyons... heu... hummm... Bon, je ne me suis jamais occupé de mes "
"impôts mais je suis sûr que cela prouve leur culpabilité si on trouve un "
"expert pour l'examiner."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Have you found my dog yet?"
msgstr "Avez-vous déjà trouvé mon chien?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Have you… got… an inhaler?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Having any trouble following the map?  Remember to search underground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Flag"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Hell ya!  Find me one of those big ol' American flags."
msgstr "Hell Yeah! Trouve-moi un de ces bon vieux drapeaux américains."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Hell ya, we may get ourselves killed but we'll be among the first legends of "
"the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Putain ouai, on va peut être y rester mais on fera partie des légendes de "
"l'apocalypse."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either."
msgstr "Hé, Je ne me serais pas porté volontaire non plus."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either… but then I remember that "
"most of us survivors won't make it unless someone decides to take the "
"initiative."
msgstr ""
"Hé, je ne me serais pas porté volontaire non plus... mais la plupart des "
"autres survivants ne pourront y arriver si personne ne prend l'initiative."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Holy hell, the crash you recovered the black box from wasn't as old as I "
"thought.  Check this out, it was on its approach to pick up a team sent to "
"secure and destroy something called a 'Hazardous Waste Sarcophagus' in the "
"middle of nowhere.  If the bird never picked up the team then we may still "
"have a chance to meet up with them.  It includes an access code for the "
"elevator and an encoded message for the team leader, I guess.  If we want to "
"join up with what remains of the government then now may be our only chance."
msgstr ""
"Bon sang, le crash dans lequel vous avez trouvé la boite noire n'est pas si "
"vieux que ce que j'aurais cru. Regardez ça, il était en approche pour "
"prendre une équipe envoyée pour sécuriser et détruire un 'sarcophage à "
"déchets dangereux' au milieu de nulle part. Si le zinc n'a pas pris l'équipe "
"on alors pourrais avoir une chance des les rencontrer. Il y a des codes "
"d’accès pour l’ascenseur et un message codé pour le chef de l'équipe je "
"pense. Si on veux pouvoir rejoindre ce qu'il reste de gouvernement, c'est "
"maintenant ou jamais."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How 'bout that black box?"
msgstr "Et au sujet de cette boite noire?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Spurge Tea"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Cattail Jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How am I not dead already?!"
msgstr "Comment je fais pour ne pas être déjà mort ?!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I bet some of them are still out there…"
msgstr "Je suis sûr que certains d'entre eux sont encore là..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I bet you'll run into a lot of those things in the hospital, please be "
"careful."
msgstr ""
"Je parie que vous allez tomber sur beaucoup de ces trucs dans l'hôpital, "
"soyez prudent."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for bringing me the patient records but I do have "
"another request.  You seem to know your way around… could you take me to one "
"of the FEMA camps?  I know some were overrun but I don't want to believe all "
"of them could have fallen."
msgstr ""
"Je ne peux pas vous remercier assez pour m'avoir apporté les dossiers des "
"patients mais j'ai une autre requête. Vous sembler connaître les environs... "
"Pouvez vous m'emmener à un des camps FEMA? Je sais que certains ont été "
"envahis mais je ne peux pas croire qu'ils soient tous tombés. "

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think so…"
msgstr "Je ne crois pas non..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think that was quite a hundred dead zeds."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas si ça fait une centaine de zombies."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think we got it yet."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas qu'on l'ai eu encore."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I don't think you're going to find many other survivors who haven't taken up "
"a faction yet."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pense pas que vous trouverez beaucoup d'autres survivants qui n'ont "
"pas encore rejoint une faction."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I doubt the site is still occupied but I'd carry a firearm at least… I'm not "
"sure what you might be looking for but I'm positive you'll find something "
"out of the ordinary if you look long enough."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pense pas que l'endroit soit encore occupé mais vous devriez prendre "
"une arme à feu au cas où... Je pense que vous finirez par trouver quelque "
"chose qui sort de l'ordinaire si vous cherchez bien."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I got the brief so I know what I'm getting into.  Let me be upfront, treat "
"me like shit and I'm going to cover my own hide.  However, you treat me well "
"and give me something to believe in, even if it's just a shiny bit of metal, "
"and I'll do you right.  Without a strong band a man doesn't stand a chance "
"in this world.  You ready to take charge boss?  This world could use a "
"Sheriff just about now."
msgstr ""
"J'ai reçu le briefing donc je sais dans quoi je m'embarque. Laissez-moi être "
"franc, traitez-moi comme une merde et je vais couvrir ma propre peau. "
"Cependant, vous me traitez bien et me donnez quelque chose en quoi croire, "
"même si ce n'est qu'un morceau de métal brillant, et je vous ferai du bien. "
"Sans un groupe solide, un homme n’a aucune chance dans ce monde. Êtes-vous "
"prêt à prendre les commandes, patron ? Ce monde aurait besoin d’un shérif à "
"l’heure actuelle."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess it was just a pipe dream."
msgstr "Je suppose que ce n'était qu'une illusion."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess the stress may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "J'imagine que je commence à ressentir le stress..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess this wasn't as bright an idea as I thought."
msgstr "J'imagine que c'était pas une idée aussi lumineuse que je pensais."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I have an infected wound.  I need you to get some antibiotics for me…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I have another task if you are feeling up to it.  There is a prisoner that "
"the priest made special mention of.  I was wondering if you could see what "
"may have happened to him or if he left anything in his cell.  The priest "
"admits the individual is rather unstable, to put it lightly, but the priest "
"personally believed the man was some kind of repentant visionary.  I'm not "
"in a position to cast out the account just yet… it seems the man has "
"prophesied events accurately before concerning the Church of Starry Wisdom."
msgstr ""
"J'ai une autre tâche si vous voulez. Il y a un prisonnier dont parle le "
"prêtre. Je me demandais si vous pouviez voir ce qui lui est arrivé ou s'il a "
"laissé quelque chose dans sa cellule. Le prêtre précise que l'individu est "
"plutôt imprévisible, et le voyais comme un visionnaire repentant. Je "
"n'arrive toujours pas à faire sens de tout cela... Il semblerait que cet "
"individu ait prophétisé les événements nous concernant au sujet de l'Église "
"de la Sagesse Étoilée."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I have asthma.  I need you to get an inhaler for me…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I hope I don't see many names I know…"
msgstr "J'espère ne pas voir beaucoup de noms que je connais..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I hope the bastard is packing heat… else we'll need to grab him a gun before "
"we hit our next target."
msgstr ""
"J'espère que ce salaud a chaud… sinon nous devrons lui donner une arme avant "
"d'atteindre notre prochaine cible."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I hope you will find use from what you got out of the deposit box but I also "
"have another job for you that might lead you to an opportunity to deal out "
"justice for those who cannot.  First things first, we can't just look like "
"ruffians.  Find us a deputy badge, easy enough?"
msgstr ""
"J'espère que vous trouverez votre bonheur dans le coffre, j'ai une autre "
"mission pour vous qui pourrait votre permettre de rendre justice à ceux qui "
"ne le peuvent pas. D'abord, on ne peut pas avoir l'air de voyous. Trouvez "
"moi un badge de shériff adjoint, facile non?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I just need a place to start over…"
msgstr "Il me faut juste un endroit pour tout recommencer..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the big corporations didn't get a chance to "
"destroy the evidence yet."
msgstr ""
"Je sais que ça ne presse pas mais les grandes corporations n'ont pas encore "
"pu détruire les preuves."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the world is going to be just as corrupt when "
"we start rebuilding unless we take measure to stop those who seek to rule "
"over us."
msgstr ""
"Ça ne presse pas mais le monde sera toujours corrompu quand on voudra "
"reconstruire, sauf si on prend les mesures pour stopper ceux qui cherchent à "
"nous contrôler."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I know time is relative and all that."
msgstr "Je sais que le temps est relatif et tout."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I left my poor dog in a house, not far from here.  Can you retrieve it?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai laissé mon pauvre chien à la maison, pas loin d'ici. Est-ce que vous "
"pouvez aller le chercher?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I left the only photo I have from my family in the armory.  I don't have the "
"code, can you get in?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai laissé la seule photo de ma famille que j'ai dans le coffre fort de "
"l'armurerie. Je ne connais pas le code qui l'ouvre, est-ce que vous pouvez "
"la récupérer pour moi?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I need someone to get a sample of zombie blood, take it to a hospital, and "
"perform a centrifuge analysis of it."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin de quelqu'un pour prélever un échantillon de sang de zombie, "
"l'emmener dans un hôpital et l'analyser par centrifugation."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I need you to get my family photo from the armory safe."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin que vous récupériez ma photo de famille que j'ai laissé dans le "
"coffre fort de l'armurerie."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I suppose a large church or cathedral may have something."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose qu'une grande église ou une cathédrale peuvent avoir quelque "
"chose."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path."
msgstr "Je vous souhaite bonne chance, que votre dieu guide vos pas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path… I "
"can only imagine that the prison will be a little slice of hell.  I'm not "
"sure what they would have decided to do with the inmates when they knew "
"death was almost certain."
msgstr ""
"Bonne chance, et que votre dieu guide vos pas... Je me doute que la prison "
"risque d'être un véritable enfer. Je me demande ce qu'ils ont fait des "
"détenus alors qu'ils savaient leur mort certaine."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path… "
"You may need it this time more than the past excursions you have gone on.  "
"There is a note about potential human sacrifice in the days immediately "
"before and after the outbreak.  The name of the cult is believed to be the "
"Church of Starry Wisdom but it is noted that accounts differ."
msgstr ""
"Je vous souhaite bonne chance, et que votre dieu vous guide... Vous en aurez "
"plus besoin qu'auparavant. Il y a une note parlant de sacrifices humains "
"juste avant et après le Cataclysme. Apparemment le nom du culte serait "
"l'Église de la Sagesse Étoilée' mais il est noté que les témoignages "
"diffèrent là dessus."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I wonder if a retreat might exist…"
msgstr "Je me demande si une retraite est possible..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd carry a shotgun at least, it sounded pretty big."
msgstr ""
"Je prendrais au moins un fusil à pompe, au bruit elle doit être énorme."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd check the police station."
msgstr "J'irais voir au commissariat."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd secure an ammo cache and try to sweep a town in multiple passes."
msgstr ""
"Je sécuriserais une cache de munitions et j'esserais de nettoyer une ville "
"avec plusieurs passages."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I wasn't really expecting to see you again.  A promise is a "
"promise, I'll follow you now!"
msgstr ""
"Pour être honnête, je ne m'attendais pas vraiment à te revoir. Une promesse "
"est une promesse, je te suis maintenant !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll lend you a hand but I'd try and recruit another gunslinger if you can."
msgstr ""
"Je vous donnerais un coup de main mais j'essayerais de recruter un autre "
"flingueur."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll see you then… or I won't, and then I'll know I made the right decision."
msgstr ""
"Je te verrai alors… ou je ne le ferai pas, et alors je saurai que j'ai pris "
"la bonne décision."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm a pretty good shot with a rifle or pistol."
msgstr "Je tire assez bien avec un pistolet ou un fusil."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'm glad you came back alive… I wasn't sure if I had sent you to your death."
msgstr ""
"Content que vous soyez revenu en un seul morceau... je me demandais si je ne "
"vous avais pas envoyé vers votre mort."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm not quite sure how you failed to survive AND are talking to me."
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas vraiment sûr(e) comment est-ce que vous êtes à la fois en "
"train de me parler ET avez échoué à survivre."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm not sure, maybe a news station would have what we are looking for?"
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas sûr, peut-être qu'une station de chaîne d'information aurait "
"ce que nous recherchons ?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm positive there is something there… there has to be, any luck?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis confiant sur le fait qu'il y a quelque chose là bas... toujours rien "
"trouvé?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Spurge Tea"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm… short… of breath…"
msgstr "Je suis… à court… de souffle…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I've accepted that everyone I used to know is dead… one way or another.  I "
"really wish I could have done something to save my brother but he was one of "
"the first to go.  I'd like to start over, just rebuild at one of the farms "
"in the countryside.  Can you help me secure one?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai accepté que tout ceux que j'ai connu sont morts... d'une manière ou "
"d'une autre. J'espérais vraiment pouvoir sauver mon frère. J'aimerais tout "
"recommencer, reconstruire ma vie dans une ferme loin des villes. Vous "
"m'aideriez?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I've heard some bad rumors so I hope you are up for another challenge…"
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu de drôles de rumeurs alors j'espère que vous êtes prêt pour un "
"autre challenge..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I've lost so many friends… please find me a patient list from the regional "
"hospital or doctor's office.  I just want to know who might still be out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"J'ai perdu tellement d'amis... S'il vous plait, trouvez moi une liste de "
"patients de l'hôpital régional ou d'un cabinet de médecin. J'aimerais savoir "
"ceux qui sont encore en vie."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "If only we could find a great valley or something."
msgstr ""
"Si seulement on pouvait trouver une grande vallée ou quelque chose du genre."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If the information is confidential the priest must have it hidden within his "
"own home."
msgstr ""
"Si l'information est confidentielle le prêtre a dû la cacher dans sa maison."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If there is a military team down there then we better go in prepared if we "
"want to impress them.  Carry as much ammo as you can and prepare to ditch "
"this place if they have a second bird coming to pick them up."
msgstr ""
"S'il y a une unité militaire la dessous, on ferais mieux d'y aller préparés "
"si on veux les impressionner. Prenez autant de munitions que vous pouvez et "
"préparez vous a quitter cet endroit s'ils ont un autre zinc qui passe les "
"prendre."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Investigate Cult"
msgstr "Enquêter sur le culte"

#. ~ Description of mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Investigate the strange cabin in the woods and find an item that may clue "
"you in about <color_yellow>a potential human sacrifice</color> the cult has "
"performed, such as <color_yellow>human bones or other remains</color>."
msgstr ""
"Enquêtez dans l'étrange cabane dans les bois et trouvez un objet qui "
"pourrait vous renseigner sur <color_yellow>un potentiel sacrifice humain</"
"color> que le culte a effectué, comme <color_yellow>des ossements humains ou "
"d'autres restes</color>."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "It could be very informative to perform an analysis of zombie blood…"
msgstr ""
"Il pourrait être très instructif de faire une analyse du sang des zombies ..."

