#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "It's crazy out there, nobody's going to make it on their own."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"It's hard surviving out here on our own, and we'd probably have a better "
"chance working together.  Problem is, I don't really know you and what "
"you're capable of.  You might have what it takes, or you might not.  Either "
"way, I'm going to need some proof.  Come back in a few days and I'll gladly "
"follow you.  It's basically a win-win for me: either you come back and I'll "
"know you've got what it takes, or you don't and I'll know that I was right "
"not to follow you."
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de survivre seuls ici, et nous aurions probablement plus de "
"chances de travailler ensemble. Le problème est que je ne vous connais pas "
"vraiment ni de quoi vous êtes capable. Vous pourriez avoir ce qu’il faut, ou "
"pas. Quoi qu'il en soit, j'aurai besoin de preuves. Revenez dans quelques "
"jours et je vous suivrai avec plaisir. C'est fondamentalement gagnant-"
"gagnant pour moi : soit tu reviens et je saurai que tu as ce qu'il faut, "
"soit tu ne le fais pas et je saurai que j'ai eu raison de ne pas te suivre."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "It's hard to tell who actually has the skills to survive these days…"
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de dire qui possède réellement les compétences nécessaires "
"pour survivre de nos jours…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgstr "Tuer 100 zombies"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Horde Master"
msgstr "Tuer le maître zombie"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Jabberwock"
msgstr "Tuer le jabberwock"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgstr "Tuer la maman zombifiée"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Let Somebody Join"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Make sure it still has… some charges left…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Man… you're a goddamn machine.  It was a pleasure working with you.  You "
"know, you may just change our little neck of the world if you keep this up."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une putain de machine... c'était un plaisir de travailler avec "
"vous. Vous savez, vous pourriez changer notre monde en ruine si vous "
"continuez comme ça."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "May that bastard never get up again."
msgstr "Que ce bâtard ne se relève jamais."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "May whatever god or spirits that now reign the world protect you."
msgstr ""
"Que le dieu ou les esprits qui règnent désormais sur le monde vous protègent."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Maybe check a pharmacy, behind the counter, or there might be some in "
"somebody's bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Maybe these things are what remains of the team we were searching for…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Maybe they escaped to one of the camps…"
msgstr "Peut-être se sont-ils réfugiés dans un des camps..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Medical services are a little sparse following <the_cataclysm>, but people "
"have been surviving using their wits and the bounty of Mother Nature for a "
"long time.  Care to learn a little?"
msgstr ""
"Les services médicaux sont un peu rares suite au Cataclysme, mais les gens "
"survivent depuis longtemps grâce à leur intelligence et aux bienfaits de "
"Mère Nature. Envie d'en apprendre un peu ?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"My mom… she's… she was killed, but then she just got back up… she's one of "
"those things now.  Can you put her out of her misery for me?"
msgstr ""
"Ma maman... Elle est... Elle a été tuée, mais elle s'est relevée. C'est une "
"de ces choses maintenant... Pouvez-vous mettre une fin à sa souffrance pour "
"moi?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Nicely done.  I've copied the data over, talk to me again when I've had some "
"time to look at it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Now I don't mean to upset you but I'm not sure what I can do with the "
"accounting ledger at the moment.  We do have a new lead though, the ledger "
"has a safe deposit box under the regional manager's name.  Guess what, dumb "
"sucker wrote down his combination.  Come with me to retrieve the box and you "
"can keep any of the goodies in it that I can't use to press charges against "
"these bastards."
msgstr ""
"Ne le prenez pas mal mais je ne vois pas ce que je pourrais faire avec le "
"grand livre des comptes pour l'instant. On a une autre piste par contre, le "
"comptable a un coffre fort à son nom. Devinez quoi, ce con a écrit la "
"combinaison. Venez avec moi pour récupérer le contenu et vous pourrez garder "
"tout ce dont je n'aurais besoin contre eux."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Null mission"
msgstr "Mission nulle"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "One hundred cigarettes."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Go into deep woods to retrieve family seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "OK, then hand it over."
msgstr "Ok, passe le moi."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "OK, then hand them over."
msgstr "Ok, passez les moi."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh dear, I thought Timmy would have made it…"
msgstr "Oh non, je pensais que Timmy s'en sortirait..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh god, I can't believe it happened…"
msgstr "Oh non, je ne peux pas croire que ce soit arrivé..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh man, I can't believe I forgot to download it…"
msgstr "Oh non, je ne peux pas croire que j'ai oublié de le télécharger..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh no!  My poor puppy…"
msgstr "Oh non! Mon pauvre petit chien!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh, my poor puppy…"
msgstr "Oh, mon pauvre chiot…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you, thank you so much!  I probably don't have long, so hurry…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Our world fell apart because our leaders were as crooked as the con-men that "
"paid for their elections.  Just find me one of those corporate accounting "
"books and I'll show you and the rest of the world just who is at fault."
msgstr ""
"Notre monde est tombé en ruine car nos dirigeants étaient aussi tordus que "
"les escrocs payés pour leur élection. Trouvez moi l'un des livres de comptes "
"de ces corporations et je vous montrerai ainsi qu'au reste du monde de qui "
"c'est la faute."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please reconsider, I know she's suffering…"
msgstr "Pensez-y... Je sais qu'elle souffre."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I don't know what else to do."
msgstr "S'il vous plait, je ne sais pas quoi faire d'autre."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I just don't know what to do otherwise."
msgstr "S'il vous plait, Je ne sais vraiment pas quoi faire sinon."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I just want to know what happened to everyone."
msgstr ""
"S'il vous plait, je veux juste savoir ce qui est arrivé à tout le monde."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, think of my poor little puppy!"
msgstr "S'il vou plaît! Pensez au pauvre chien!"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prison Visionary"
msgstr "Visiter la prison"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgstr "Prouvez que vous êtes un survivant"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Prove you're a survivor by surviving for 10 days after the Cataclysm, and "
"then returning to the person who gave you this mission."
msgstr ""
"Prouvez que vous êtes un survivant en survivant pendant 10 jours après le "
"Cataclysme, puis en retournant auprès de la personne qui vous a confié cette "
"mission."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
