#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Roger, if he's a no-show then any other gunslinger will do… but I doubt "
"he'll quit before we even begin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Flag"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a Flag"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Seriously?  God damned commie…"
msgstr "Sérieusement?  Satané communiste…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Seriously?  It's an easy job…"
msgstr "Sérieusement? C'est une mission facile..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Shall we keep looking for a farm house?"
msgstr "Devons nous continuer à chercher une ferme?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "One hundred cigarettes."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Go into deep woods to retrieve family seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Shit happens."
msgstr "C'est la Vie."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "So, do you have my software yet?"
msgstr "Alors, avez-vous mon logiciel ?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Something in the shadows still seems to stare at me when I look at the woods."
msgstr "Quelque chose semble encore m'observer quand je regarde les bois."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "St. Michael the archangel defend me in battle…"
msgstr ""
"Saint Michael l'archange donnez-moi la victoire dans les batailles à venir…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Survivors were talkin' 'bout seeing 'em falling out of the sky but I don't "
"know where.  If I were a pilot I'd avoid crash landing in a city or forest "
"though.  Black boxes are housed in the tail to survive the crash so check "
"there when you do find one.  Now get to it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Take my dog whistle; if the dog starts running off, blow it and he'll return "
"to your side."
msgstr ""
"Prenez ce sifflet à ultrasons. Si le chien s'éloigne, sifflez et il "
"reviendra vers vous."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Take this USB drive.  Use the console, and download the software."
msgstr "Prenez cette clé USB. Utilisez la console et téléchargez le logiciel."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank the heavens."
msgstr "Que Dieu soit loué !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you so much for finding him!"
msgstr "Merci mille fois de l'avoir ramené"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you!  Please hurry back!"
msgstr "Merci! Revenez vite!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you!  This attack is really bad… I'm not sure how long I can live… "
"like this… "
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, I need some time alone now…"
msgstr "Merci, j'ai besoin d'un petit moment de réclusion maintenant…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, I suppose it won't change what has already happened but it will "
"bring me closure."
msgstr ""
"Merci, ça ne changera pas le cour des choses mais je sais à quoi m'en tenir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, I'm not sure what to make of this but I'll ponder your account."
msgstr "Merci, je ne sais pas bien quoi en faire mais je vais le considérer."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, a diary is exactly what I was looking for."
msgstr "Merci, un journal est exactement ce que je cherchais."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, just bring me to the camp… I just want to see."
msgstr "Merci, amène-moi juste au camp… Je veux juste voir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, let's find a remote one so we don't have to worry about many "
"zombies."
msgstr ""
"Merci, trouvons en une loin pour ne pas avoir a se préocuper des zombies."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, your account of these… demonic creations proves the fears the "
"churches had were well founded.  Our priority should be routing out any "
"survivors of this cult… I don't known if they are responsible for the "
"outbreak but they certainly know more about it than I do."
msgstr ""
"Merci de me raconter tout cela… Ces créations diaboliques prouvent que les "
"craintes des églises étaient bien fondées. Notre priorité maintenant est de "
"débusquer n'importe quel membre survivant de ce culte… Je ne sais s'ils sont "
"les responsables de tout cela mais ils seront probablement plus informés que "
"nous."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you.  I couldn't rest until I knew that was finished."
msgstr "Merci. Je ne pouvais pas me reposer avant de savoir que c'était fini."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you… she would've wanted it this way."
msgstr "Merci. Elle l'aurait voulu ainsi."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks so much, you may save both of us yet."
msgstr "Merci beaucoup, vous nous sauvez la mise."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to your searching we've got the black box but now we need to have a "
"look inside her.  Now, most buildings don't have power anymore but there are "
"a few that might be of use.  Have you ever seen one of those science labs "
"that have popped up in the middle of nowhere?  Them suckers have a glowing "
"terminal out front so I know they have power somewhere inside 'em.  If you "
"can get inside and find a computer lab that still works you ought to be able "
"to find out what's in the black box."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à tes recherches, nous avons la boîte noire, mais maintenant nous "
"devons jeter un œil à l'intérieur. Puisque, la plupart des bâtiments n'ont "
"plus d'jus, il doit bien y en avoir quelques-uns qui pourraient être utiles. "
"T'as déjà vu un de ces labo qui ont surgi d'milieu de nulle part ? Ces "
"saloperies ont un terminal lumineux à l'avant donc j'pense qu'il y a de "
"l'énergie quelque part à l'intérieur. Si tu peux trouver un labo "
"d'informatique qui fonctionne encore, tu pourra peut-être trouver ce qu'il y "
"a dans la boîte noire."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'll be sure to put in a good word for you around town."
msgstr "Merci! Je ne manquerai pas dire un bon mot de vous en ville."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks!  Just pull the data onto this USB drive and bring it to me."
msgstr ""
"Merci! Il suffit de mettre les données sur cette clé USB et de me les "
"apporter."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks, it's great to see someone willing to help a out."
msgstr ""
"Merci, ça fait plaisir de voire qu'il y a toujours des gens prêts à aider "
"leur prochain de nos jours."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever the beast is."
msgstr "Merci, préparez vous bien pour affronter cette bête."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "The cattails grow in the fresh water in swamps.  You can't miss them."
msgstr ""
"Les quenouilles poussent dans les marais, il devrait y en avoir assez dans "
"n'importe lequel."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The centrifuge is a bit technical; you might want to study up on the usage "
"of computers before completing that part."
msgstr ""
"La centrifugeuse est un peu technique ; vous pourriez vouloir étudier "
"l'utilisation des ordinateurs avant de compléter cette partie."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The day of reckoning will come for the corporations if it hasn't already."
msgstr ""
"Le jour des règlements de compte va arriver pour les corporations si ce "
"n'est pas déjà le cas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "The day of reckoning will come for the criminals if it hasn't already."
msgstr "Il est temps de régler leur compte aux criminels."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The eater of the dead… something was ripping zombies to shreds and only "
"leaving a few scattered limbs…"
msgstr ""
"Le mangeur de morts... quelque chose a mis les zombies en morceaux, ne "
"laissant que des membres éparpillés..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The sky has torn apart and creatures beyond our wildest imaginations lurk in "
"the dark now.  I beg you, find me a holy symbol.  Maybe some faith can help "
"me sleep better at night."
msgstr ""
"Le ciel s'est déchiré et des créatures au-delà de notre imagination la plus "
"folle se cachent désormais dans l'obscurité. Je t'en supplie, trouve-moi un "
"symbole sacré. Peut-être qu'un peu de foi peut m'aider à mieux dormir la "
"nuit."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The worst case scenario will probably be that the prisoners have escaped "
"their cells and turned the building into their own little fortress.  Best "
"case, the building went into lock-down and secured the prisoners in their "
"cells.  Either way, navigating the building will pose its own difficulties."
msgstr ""
"Le pire scénario serait que les prisonniers se sont échappés de leur cellule "
"et ont fait de la prison leur forteresse. Dans le meilleur des cas, les "
"prisonniers sont enfermés dans leur cellule. Dans tout les cas, le bâtiment "
"présentera des difficultés."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "There's some important software on my computer that I need on USB."
msgstr ""
"Il y a des logiciels importants sur mon ordinateur dont j'ai besoin sur une "
"clé USB."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "These look more complicated than I thought, just give me some time."
msgstr ""
"C'est plus compliqué que ce que je pensais, donnez moi un peu de temps."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "They shouldn't be that hard to find… should they?"
msgstr "Ils ne devraient pas être difficiles à trouver... non?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Cattail Jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This infection is bad, <very> bad…"
msgstr "Cette infection est mauvaise, sacrément mauvaise…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This isn't what we need."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas ce qu'il nous faut."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This shouldn't be hard unless we run into a horde."
msgstr "Ça ne devrait pas être trop dur, sauf si on rencontre une horde."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Secrets in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Those twisted snakes…"
msgstr "Ces serpents tordus…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Traveling the backroads would be a good way to search for one."
msgstr "Suivre les routes isolées est un bon moyen d'en trouver."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Try a big corporate building of some sort, they're bound to have an "
"accounting department."
msgstr ""
"Essayez l'un des grands bâtiments de ces sociétés, ils doivent bien avoir un "
"secteur comptabilité."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Ugh, forget it then, I'll figure something out on my own."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wait, were you being sarcastic?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Wait, you couldn't possibly have the data!  Liar!"
msgstr "Attends une seconde, vous ne pouvez pas avoir les données! Menteur!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wait… are you really making me a deputy?"
msgstr "Attends… tu fais vraiment de moi un adjoint du shérif ?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We can keep each other safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We have the flag but now we need to locate US troops to see what we can do "
"to help.  I haven't seen any but I'm figurin' one of those choppers that "
"were flyin' round during th' outbreak would have a good idea.  If you can "
"get me a black box from one of the wrecks I'll look into where we might open "
"'er at."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons le drapeau, mais nous devons maintenant localiser les troupes "
"américaines pour voir ce que nous pouvons faire pour les aider. Je n'en ai "
"pas vu, mais je pense qu'un de ces hélicoptères qui volaient partout pendant "
"l'épidémie aurait une bonne idée. Si vous pouvez me procurer une boîte noire "
"provenant d'une des épaves, je chercherai comment nous pourrions l'ouvrir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We should go at night, if it is overrun then we can quickly make our escape."
msgstr ""
"On devrait y aller de nuit, s'il a été envahi on pourra s'échapper plus vite."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We should travel together."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We're also official… just hang in there and I'll show you what we can really "
"do."
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes officiels aussi... attendez là et je vais vous montrer ce qu'on "
"sait faire."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We've got another problem to deal with but I don't think we can handle it on "
"our own.  So, I sent word out and found us a volunteer… of sorts.  He's vain "
"as hell but has a little skill with firearms.  He was supposed to collect "
"whatever he had of value and is going to meet us at a cabin in the woods.  "
"Wasn't sure how long we were going to be so I told him to just camp there "
"until we picked him up."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons un autre problème à résoudre, mais je ne pense pas que nous "
"puissions le résoudre seuls. Alors, j'ai envoyé un message et nous avons "
"trouvé un bénévole… en quelque sorte. Il est vaniteux comme l'enfer mais a "
"un peu d'habileté avec les armes à feu. Il était censé récupérer tout ce "
"qu'il avait de valeur et va nous rejoindre dans une cabane dans les bois. Je "
"ne savais pas combien de temps nous allions rester, alors je lui ai dit de "
"camper là jusqu'à ce que nous le récupérions."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We've got the flag, now we need to locate US forces."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons le drapeau, il nous faut maintenant localiser les forces "
"américaines."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well damn, you must be the guys here to pick me up…"
msgstr "Bon sang, vous devez être les gars qui viennent me chercher..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'll find someone else to do it for me, real shame with all those guns "
"locked up too…"
msgstr ""
"Je trouverais bien quelqu'un de plus intéressé, dommage pour vous, il y a "
"comme même beaucoup d'armes à feu dans ce coffre fort en plus de la photo..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Well, do you have the data yet?"
msgstr "Vous avez les données?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Well, my adventuring days are over.  I can't thank you enough.  Trying to "
"make this place self sustaining will take some work but the future is "
"looking brighter.  At least it ought to be safe for now.  You'll always be "
"welcome here."
msgstr ""
"Et bien, mon aventure s'arrête ici. Je ne vous remercierais jamais assez. "
"Rendre cet endroit suffisant à lui même va demander pas mal de travail, mais "
"l'avenir est déjà plus prometteur. Au moins il est relativement tranquille "
"pour l'instant. Vous serez toujours le bienvenu ici."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well, that's a shame."
msgstr "Eh bien, c'est dommage."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well, you're not dead… yet."
msgstr "Eh bien, tu n'es pas mort... pour l'instant."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well…?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well…?  Did you… finish things for my mom?"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien? Est-ce que vous avez… pris les choses en main au sujet de ma mère?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "What a shame, that data could have proved invaluable…"
msgstr "Quel dommage, ces données auraient pu s'avérer précieuses..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of the Quran"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "What good does this do me?"
msgstr "A quoi ça me sert ?"

