#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What's the use of walking away, they'll track you down eventually."
msgstr "Quel intérêt de les éviter, ils vous pisteront probablement."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  I oughta whip your ass."
msgstr "QUOI?! J'vais t'botter l'cul!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  I out'ta whip your ass."
msgstr "Quoi?! Je veux te botter le cul."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Spurge Tea"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Cattail Jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  Please, <ill_die> without your help!"
msgstr "Quoi ?! Pitié, je vais mourir sans votre aide !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  Please, <ill_die> without… your help!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Flag"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a Flag"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  You liar!"
msgstr "Quoi?! Espèce de menteur !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Spurge Tea"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Cattail Jelly"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Ugh, forget it!"
msgstr "Quoi?! Vous mentez, je peux le voir ! Pouah, oublie ça !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"When I was playin' with the terminal for the one I ran into it kept asking "
"for an ID card.  Finding one would be the first order of business."
msgstr ""
"Quand je bidouillais l'terminal, il demandait une carte d’identification. "
"Faut en trouver une !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "With the black box in hand, we need to find a lab."
msgstr "Avec la boite noir en notre possession, nous d'vons trouver un labo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
