msgid "Yeah, it was a long shot I admit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Antibiotics"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Yes!  I'll be right as rain in no time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Flag"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"You give up?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good man "
"to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr ""
"Tu abandonnes? Ce pays s’est effondré parce que personne ne pouvait trouver "
"un homme bon sur qui compter… autant abandonner, je suppose."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You have no idea how interesting this diary is.  I have two very promising "
"leads… first things first, the Catholic Church has been performing its own "
"investigations into global cult phenomenon and it appears to have become "
"very interested in a local cult as of recently.  Could you investigate a "
"location for me?  I'm not sure what was going on here but the priest seemed "
"fairly worried about it."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas idée comme ce journal est intéressant. J'ai deux pistes "
"prometteuses… Tout d'abord, l'église catholique a fait sa propre enquête sur "
"le phénomènes des cultes et il est apparent qu'elle s'est intéressée à un "
"culte local récemment. Est-ce que vous pourriez enquêter quelque part pour "
"moi? Je ne suis pas sûr de ce qui se passait là bas mais cela semblait "
"préoccuper le prêtre."

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You learn how to craft cattail jelly."
msgstr "Vous apprenez comment fabriquer de la gelée de quenouille."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You look a little shaken up, I can't tell you how glad I am that you killed "
"it though."
msgstr ""
"Vous tremblez un peu, vous n'imaginez pas a quel point ça me fait plaisir "
"que vous l'ayez tué."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You look like a resourceful sort, maybe you can hack it or something."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l'air d'être débrouillard, peut être que vous pourriez hacker le "
"verrou ou quelque chose comme ça?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You may make a tidy profit from this."
msgstr "Vous pourriez vous faire un bon profit avec ça."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You seem to know this new world better than most…"
msgstr "Vous semblez connaitre ce monde mieux que quiconque..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You wouldn't believe what I found…"
msgstr "Vous ne croiriez pas ce que j'ai trouvé…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You'll see, I know I'm right."
msgstr "Vous verrez, je sais que j'ai raison."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You're kitted out better than most… would you be interested in making this "
"world a little better for the rest of us?  The towns have enough supplies "
"for us survivors to start securing a foothold but we don't have anyone with "
"the skills and equipment to thin the masses of undead.  I'll lend you a hand "
"to the best of my ability but you really showed promise taking out that "
"other beast.  You, I, and a 100 zombies laid to rest, what do you say?"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes mieux vêtu que la plupart... ça vous intéresserez de rendre le "
"monde un peu meilleur pour nous autres? Les villes ont suffisamment de "
"fournitures pour nous, mais nous n'avons pas les compétences pour venir à "
"bout des masses de zombies. Je vous aiderais du mieux que je peux mais vous "
"avez vraiment fait vos preuves avec cette autre bête. Vous, moi, et 100 "
"zombies à abattre, qu'en dites vous?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You're lying… I can tell!  Ugh, forget it!"
msgstr ""

