msgid "We need help…"
msgstr "Nous avons besoin d'aide…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"We were in the process of refurbishing the retreat when <the_cataclysm> "
"interrupted us.  Some of the plumbing around here was troublesome, and we "
"need to fix that.  200 pipes should be all we need to finish it."
msgstr ""
"Nous étions en train de réaménager la retraite avant que <the_cataclysm> "
"nous interrompe, la tuyauterie ayant encore des problèmes ayant besoin "
"d'être réglés. Pouvez-vous trouver 200 sections de tuyau pour nous?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "We'll have to try again, I suppose."
msgstr "Je suppose qu'on aura besoin d'essayer de nouveau."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "We've got to see how many people are out there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well Construction"
msgstr "Construction du Puits"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, do you have them?"
msgstr "Vous avez ce que je vous ai demandé?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Well, partner, this might just be the end of the road.  I hope you enjoyed "
"it as much as I have.  In the meantime… here's your reward, a handful of "
"icons, that's all I have left.  Spend them all, I think you've deserved it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, that's great.  Good luck."
msgstr "Parfait. Bonne chance."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
