"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<swear> nuisance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
