#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I need more time.  Come back later."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de plus de temps. Revenez plus tard."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the meteorologist's crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I'm glad that you are alive and that you haven't forgot about me.  The drone "
"turned out to be great, it managed to take off and even was able to fly "
"several hundred meters!  Unfortunately, after that, I lost control of it… I "
"don't know what happened to it, though.  Maybe you can check?  I'm a little "
"afraid to go out there…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Je suis heureux que vous soyez toujours en vie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Je suis heureux que vous soyez toujours en vie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Je suis heureux que vous soyez toujours en vie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a "
"weather station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote "
"reports, drew up schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I "
"was studying electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, some "
"for work, some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered all my "
"things that I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then I've "
"been sitting here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste un météorologiste lambda. Depuis quelques années j'ai "
"travaillé dans cette station météorologique et passer ma vie a faire des "
"choses barbantes comme mesurer la pression atmosphérique, les "
"precipitations, écrire des rapports météo... Bref, rien de vraiment "
"intéressant. Dans mon temps libre par contre j'étudiais les appareils "
"électroniques et les systèmes radio, et construisais des appareils varies,  "
"certains étaient utiles pour mon boulot, certain étaient juste un projet "
"amusant. Quant les premieres emeutes ont commence a être montrées sur la "
"television, j'ai decide de faire mes valises et d'emménager de façon "
"permanente dans la station météo. Depuis ca, je n'ai fait qu'attendre ici et "
"j'ai occupe les journées avec mon loisir habituel."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
