"I'm sure you could find the design for the stills in home brewing books."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"If it isn't obvious, I oversee the bar here.  The scavengers bring in old "
"world alcohol that we sell for special occasions.  For most that come "
"through here though, the drinks we brew ourselves are the only thing they "
"can afford."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Just a glass of water, please."
msgstr "Juste un verre d'eau, merci."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Make 2 Stills"
msgstr "Trouvez ou Fabriquez 2 Alambics"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, that?  There were too many people stealing our glasses, so I started "
"stamping a logo on some bottle caps as a token and raised the drink prices a "
"bit to encourage their return.  I'll give you a merch back when you bring me "
"the token with your glass."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ça? Il y avait trop de personnes qui volaient nos verres, donc j'ai "
"commencé à appliquer un logo sur nos bouchons et capsules pour que ceux-ci "
"servent de jetons et j'ai ensuite augmenté le prix de nos boissons pour "
"encourager les clients à les rendre avec leurs verres. Je vous redonnerai "
"une merch si vous revenez avec un jeton et votre verre."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
