msgid ""
"Night is the ideal time for my team to go on raids, but they are going to "
"need better light sources to speed up their missions.  Could you craft a set "
"of five headlamps for them?  Keeping both hands free greatly helps during "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "Non merci."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Nope, current run hasn't returned yet.  Come back in <interval>.  You might "
"find something you like."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Mission source, shopkeep
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Scavenger Boss"
msgstr "Chef des récupérateurs"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Tell me more about the scavenging runs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"They're pretty easy to make.  You can knock down young trees for long "
"sticks, then you just need a knife and a fire to dry the tip."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"We don't have any of the parts needed right now, but we could send out a "
"scavenging party to a hospital if you have anyone willing to go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Welcome to the junk shop."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "What kind of tasks do you have for me?"
msgstr "Quelles genres de tâches avez-vous à me proposer ?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"When outnumbered or forced to pull back, my scavengers have been taught to "
"throw Molotov cocktails to keep monsters from chasing them.  We go through "
"one or two on every mission, so we can always use a few more.  Would you be "
"willing to make us a dozen?  I'm willing to pay you what I can for your "
"assistance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "You should be able to make them with the most basic of skills."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "An angle grinder and a hacksaw?  I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Don't mind me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Tools for Scrap"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
