"but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly "
"what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and "
"are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a "
"hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you get "
"back."
msgstr ""

