#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, but I'm feeling a bit under the weather."
msgstr "Ok, mais je sens un peu patraque."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, you got something to get off your chest?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Always ready for a good chat!  But why, you OK?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this summer to be over."
msgstr "J'ai hâte que cet été passe."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this winter to be over."
msgstr "J'ai hâte que cet hiver passe."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think it's weird how we'll, like, open a locked building and find a "
"lone zombie inside?  How'd it even get there?"
msgstr ""
"Vous pensez pas que c'est un peu bizarre comme quoi de temps en temps on "
"ouvre un bâtiment completement fermé et on trouve un seul zombie à "
"l'intérieur? Comment est-ce qu'il c'est retrouvé là?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Enjoying the summer."
msgstr "Je profite de l'été."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Every time I close my eyes, I can still see the riots.  Do you get that, or "
"is it just me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Gotta say, I'm not minding the snow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Hey <name_g>, I bet a chat would be all the sweeter with a nice, cold beer "
"in hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"How do these zombies even keep going?  What are they eating?  Do you think "
"they'll ever rot away?"
msgstr ""
"Comment est-ce que les zombies continuent à bouger? Qu'est-ce qu'ils "
"mangent? Vous pensez qu'ils vont pourrir ou dépérir un jour?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin' about rearranging my gear.  It's a real mess.  Don't wanna "
"go for my weapon and accidentally pull out a granola bar, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin', one of these days, we're gonna run out of toilet paper.  "
"What then?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop wondering who fucked up to make all this happen.  Obviously we "
"can't trust the news, they claimed the zombies were \"rioters\" for weeks.  "
"Why?  Where did this come from?"
msgstr ""
"Je me demande qui a merdé assez pour causer ce bordel. Évidemment, on ne "
"peux pas faire confiance aux médias, vu qu'ils ont prétendu que les zombies "
"étaient simplement des \"émeutiers\" pendant plusieurs semaines. Pourquoi "
"est-ce t'il arrivé? Et d'où?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I feel great today.  Not sure what it is, just one of those days."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I guess I can spare a few minutes, how's things?"
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que je peux vous donner quelques minutes. Comment vont les choses?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I hear you, <name_g>…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I just can't believe it's over.  I keep running my head back to the days it "
"all fell apart.  The riots.  The lies.  The psychos.  It never really felt "
"like it was going to go like this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep having dreams that zombies still remember who they were as people, "
"and are just trapped inside the bodies watching everything happen.  Haven't "
"been sleeping well."
msgstr ""
"Je continue de faire des cauchemars que les zombies se souviennent de tout , "
"mais sont des passagers impuissants de leur corps et sont forcés de tout "
"regarder. Ça me rend insomniaque."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I need a break anyway, how are you?"
msgstr "J'ai besoin d'une pause de toute façon, comment allez-vous?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wish I could go bust a cap in one of those zombies right now, without all "
"the fuss about being scared for my life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if I should be getting more religious now, or less.  You know what "
"I'm sayin', <name_g>?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I wonder if the government's still out there, holed up in some bunker."
msgstr ""
"Je me demande si le gouvernement a survécu et se planque dans un bunker."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm OK with that, what's up?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm game.  How you holding up?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm not feeling too well, but I can still talk for a bit."
msgstr "Je ne me sens pas très bien, mais l'on peut toujours parler un peu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"If what they told us about the Chinese was even partly true, do you think "
"it's like this in China?  Or maybe the US is some kind of quarantine zone, "
"and at least some of the world is still out there."
msgstr ""
"Même si ce qu'ils nous ont racontés au sujet de la Chine est partiellement "
"vrai, vous pensez que c'est la même chose là-bas? Où peut-être que les États-"
"Unis sont une zone de quarantaine et qu'au moins il y a une partie du monde "
"qui est bien sorti de tout ça"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Kinda wishing it would cool off a bit, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's forget the world for a while.  How you doin'?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's shoot the shit!  You OK, <name_g>?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Looking back, it seems kind of obvious that something was wrong for a long "
"time.  The wars, the environment, all of it.  Like the world was rotting "
"before it died."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Most of the zombies don't eat, and I've never seen one breathe.  How are "
"they getting energy to move their muscles?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "My dogs've been barkin' lately, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Nice of you to make time.  How's it been for you lately?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the summers from before, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the winters from before, huh?"
msgstr "Pas vraiment comme les hivers d'avant que tout ceci se produise hein?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK <name_g>, how are you coping?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Oh definitely, how about one of those beers you got?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Pass me one and let's talk, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember some of the crazy news from the end of the world?  The stuff that "
"got drowned out by the riot coverage I mean.  Like, didn't the governor of "
"Rhode Island secede from the Union or something?"
msgstr ""
"Vous vous souvenez de quelques-uns des évènements les plus délirant au début "
"du Cataclysme? Je veux dire les trucs qui on été noyés par les reportages "
"sur les émeutes. Il y a pas eu un truc concernant le gouverneur de Rhode "
"Island faisant sécession?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Right, right.  Say, you ever thought about…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"So many parts of this still don't fit together.  Who created the zombies?  "
"What powers them?  Maybe the rumors of mind control drugs were true all "
"along, and someone found a way to bioengineer living dead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how about that weather, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how's it going?"
msgstr "Donc… Comment ça va?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're all psychos, not just the ones that went crazy "
"and rioted.  I never would have thought I could do the things I've done "
"since the world ended."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sometimes it almost seems peaceful this time of year."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure thing <name_g>, you good?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That reminds me of something…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "The weather's definitely getting worse, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Those mind-control drugs they put in the water to make people riot… you "
"think they're still in there?"
msgstr ""
"Les drogues qu'ils ont mis dans l'eau potable pour provoquer les émeutes, "
"vous pensez qu'elles sont toujours actives?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "We can talk, even though I'm not feeling too well."
msgstr "On peut discuter, même si je ne me sens pas trop bien."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"We just have to remember that we're smarter than they are.  Whatever "
"happens, that's something we can count on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Well, I'm feeling pretty sick… but sure."
msgstr "Je me sens un peu malade… mais ok."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What the heck.  How's life been treating you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"When do you think you realized the world was ending?  For me, it was that "
"damned YouTube video with the lady killing the baby.  Holy shit, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"While we chat, what say you we open a beer and just… pretend the world isn't "
"ending."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Yeah sure, want to crack open one of those beers?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Yeah you share those beers I see you hoarding and then we chat all you "
"like!  Only joking, heh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, this summer heat is hitting me hard, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole time before <the_cataclysm> was just a dream "
"you're waking up from?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think there's any truth to the crap they were spouting before the "
"world ended?  Mind control drugs in the water, bio-terrorism?  Some of it "
"would make sense, but it seems so far-fetched.  Then again, we're dealing "
"with actual zombies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why we even bother?  We're all just gonna be zombies "
"eventually anyway.  I mean, not that I'm gonna stop fighting, but what's the "
"damn point?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know what I miss?  Movie theaters.  You think Hollywood survived this?  "
"Maybe there's a bunch of zombie actors out there, filmin' shit out of "
"reflex.  Hah, I'd watch that shit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You read any good books lately?  I'm glad we still got books."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez-lu quelques bons livres récemment? Je suis content qu'au moins il "
"nous reste des trucs à lire. "

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid " *pshhhttt* Hey stinkyface.  It's your favorite mushroom girl.  Over."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"*gives a single rough laugh.  \"Fair call, sass like mine is what will get "
"us through these trying times.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "How do you know I didn't recruit you for your sass, though?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"I can read the newspapers as well as anyone, I know how people who look like "
"me get smeared.  My grandparents were from China.  That means I'm obviously "
"personally responsible for all this.  I don't know any other reason they let "
"hundreds of other educated people in and left me sitting out there to rot."
msgstr ""
"Je peux lire les journaux aussi bien que n’importe qui, je sais à quel point "
"les gens qui me ressemblent se font insulter. Mes grands-parents étaient "
"originaires de Chine. Cela signifie que je suis évidemment personnellement "
"responsable de tout cela. Je ne connais pas d'autre raison pour laquelle ils "
"ont laissé entrer des centaines d'autres personnes instruites et m'ont "
"laissé pourrir là-bas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I don't remember, did you tell me how you wound up in that place?"
msgstr ""
"Je ne me souvient plus, vous m'avez déjà dit comment est-ce que vous vous "
"êtes retrouvé dans ce centre?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I just wanted to chat, you know.  To relax."
msgstr "Je voulais juste discuter, tu sais. Pour se détendre."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I love just standing around, it's what I was made for."
msgstr "J'aime juste rester là, c'est pour ça que je suis fait."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Let's talk about the camp."
msgstr "Parlons du camp."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"My 'abilities'?  I can shapeshift, and teleport, but I can't do it on "
"command.  Also, I have unique powers of thyroid failure."
msgstr ""
"Mes ''capacités'' ? Je peux me métamorphoser et me téléporter, mais je ne "
"peux pas le faire sur commande. De plus, j’ai des pouvoirs uniques en "
"matière d’insuffisance thyroïdienne."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"Pretty sure I did, but I do love hearing the sound of my own voice.  I got "
"evacuated on to the local concentration center, then picked up on a "
"repurposed school bus and dragged out to that shithole.  We heard the place "
"was getting more people than they could fit, and the few who'd got there "
"first had set up some sort of self-appointed processing lineup.  The chick "
"processing me to get in saw my Chinese name and conveniently 'lost' my "
"paperwork.  I was sent out to the lobby to wait for 'further processing', "
"while I watched busloads of people get processed and taken in.  By the time "
"they 'found' my paperwork, wouldn't you know it, the place was too full for "
"me.  They oh-so-kindly let me camp out in the front since I'd been on one of "
"the first buses."
msgstr ""
"Je suis presque sûr que je l'ai fait, mais j'aime entendre le son de ma "
"propre voix. J'ai été évacué vers le centre de concentration local, puis "
"j'ai été embarqué dans un bus scolaire reconverti et traîné jusqu'à ce trou "
"à merde. Nous avions entendu dire que l'endroit accueillait plus de monde "
"qu'il ne pouvait en accueillir, et les quelques-uns qui étaient arrivés les "
"premiers avaient mis en place une sorte de file d'attente autoproclamée. La "
"fille qui m'a demandé d'entrer a vu mon nom chinois et a commodément « perdu "
"» mes papiers. J'ai été envoyé dans le hall pour attendre la « suite du "
"traitement », pendant que je regardais des bus remplis de personnes être "
"traités et emmenés. Au moment où ils ont « trouvé » mes documents, ne le "
"savez-vous pas, l'endroit était trop plein pour moi. Ils m'ont si gentiment "
"laissé camper devant puisque j'étais dans l'un des premiers bus."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "Avez-vous vu de bons films récemment ?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "Avez-vous vu de bons films récemment ?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "Avez-vous vu de bons films récemment ?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"Seriously?  You figure you're the boss of me now?  Fine, whatever, what do "
"you want me to do."
msgstr ""
"Sérieusement ? Tu penses que tu es mon patron maintenant ? Très bien, peu "
"importe, que veux-tu que je fasse ?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "So, here we are.  What's up?"
msgstr "Nous y sommes donc. Quoi de neuf ?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Sure.  Here we are, talking."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Nous voilà en train de parler."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"Well, before <the_cataclysm> I was working at a university bookstore, "
"remember?  But that was just an in-between after finishing my PhD, while I "
"looked for a post-doc placement I was interested in.  Which, I suppose, I've "
"got now?  You didn't recruit my for my fragile body, intractable obesity, or "
"sunny disposition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "What's your story, anyway?"
msgstr "Au fait, quelle est ton histoire ?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"You kind of already know, don't you?  I used to be a post-doc researcher in "
"mycology, then I wound up stuck in the lobby at that stupid refugee center, "
"then you came and yeeted us all out of there.  What more is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vous le savez déjà, n'est-ce pas ? J'étais chercheur postdoctoral en "
"mycologie, puis je me suis retrouvé coincé dans le hall de ce stupide centre "
"de réfugiés, puis vous êtes venu et vous nous avez tous fait sortir de là. "
"Qu'y a-t-il de plus ?"

