#. ~ Description of profession "Police Interceptor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"An on-duty officer, you received the call and were ready to respond to the "
"robbery.  It all went to shit, your backup got eaten, and you were lucky to "
"escape with your life and patrol car."
msgstr ""
"Officière de service, vous avez reçu l'appel et étiez prêt à réagir au vol. "
"Tout est parti en vrille, vos renforts ont été mangés et vous avez eu de la "
"chance de vous échapper avec votre vie et votre voiture de patrouille."

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Interceptor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
