#. ~ Description of profession "Firefighter" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a first responder, you were a direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors "
"of the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit "
"while on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more "
"than your trusty iron and your bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""
"En tant que première répondante, vous avez été une témoin directe des "
"horreurs déchirantes de l’apocalypse. Séparée de la plupart de votre "
"équipement et de votre unité pendant votre service de garde, vous avez été "
"obligée de vous frayer un chemin vers la sécurité avec à peine plus que "
"votre fidèle tisonnier et votre équipement de protection."

#. ~ Description of profession "Firefighter" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a first responder, you were a direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors "
"of the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit "
"while on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more "
"than your trusty iron and your bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""
