#. ~ Description of profession "Heist Driver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal "
"driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now there are no cops "
"and no law, but even after the Cataclysm, you drive."
msgstr ""
"D'aussi loin que vous vous en souveniez, vous avez vécue une double vie : "
"une conductrice normale le jour et une conductrice de braquage la nuit. "
"Maintenant, il n'y a plus de flics ni de loi, mais même après le Cataclysme, "
"vous conduisez."

