"tort."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rancher" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways "
"things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Prendre soin des vaches, des chevaux et des autres animaux est votre "
"passion, mais au train où vont les choses, ce ne sera pas une simple journée "
"au ranch."

