"votre vie !"

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all "
"communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"Le gouvernement appela votre unité de la Garde Nationale pour lutter contre "
"les émeutes et l'épidémie hors de contrôle. Malgré tout vos efforts, vous "
"n'avez pas réussi à reformer vos rangs avant que toute communication cesse, "
"vous laissant isolée parmi les morts-vivants."

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all "
"communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
