#. ~ Description of profession "Surgeon" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether you worked in aesthetics, oncology, or orthopedics, you're going to "
"have to get used to the fact that pretty much everyone with your skillset is "
