"de gibier trop gros pour que vous puissiez l'abattre."

#. ~ Description of profession "Militia" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You and a group of like-minded individuals built a hideout in the woods from "
"which to launch looting raids in a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went "
"bad, and now all your comrades are dead.  Every breath you take now is an "
"act of rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that "
"flame of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"Vous et un groupe d'individus partageant les mêmes idées avez construit une "
"cachette dans les bois à partir de laquelle lancer des raids de pillage dans "
"une camionnette truquée par un jury. La dernière descente s'est mal passée, "
"et maintenant tous vos camarades sont morts. Chaque respiration que vous "
"prenez maintenant est un acte de rébellion contre la cruauté de ce monde "
"condamné. Ne laissez pas cette flamme d’espoir périr en vous."

#. ~ Description of profession "Militia" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You and a group of like-minded individuals built a hideout in the woods from "
"which to launch looting raids in a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went "
"bad, and now all your comrades are dead.  Every breath you take now is an "
