#. ~ Description of profession "Wǔshùjiā" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You know kung fu.  Pretty much everyone else is dead, so maybe that makes "
"you The One."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Wǔshùjiā" for male
