#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez conduire et avez décidée de commencer à gagner de l’argent en le "
"faisant. Alors que vous alliez chercher un client, une émeute a éclaté "
"autour de vous. Vous avez fait un long détour pour vous mettre en sécurité, "
"mais vous vous êtes retrouvée dans un endroit inconnu."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez conduire et avez décidé de commencer à gagner de l’argent en le "
"faisant. Alors que vous alliez chercher un client, une émeute a éclaté "
"autour de vous. Vous avez fait un long détour pour vous mettre en sécurité, "
"mais vous vous êtes retrouvé dans un endroit inconnu."

#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Girl" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the cops aren't telling "
"you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Boy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the cops aren't telling "
"you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Girl" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a skateboard than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the cops aren't telling "
"you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Boy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
