msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some "
"reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été forcée d'annuler votre jour de congé pour nourrir les animaux "
"du zoo, pour une raison qui vous échappe, aucun de vos collègues n'est "
"présent aujourd'hui."

#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some "
"reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été forcé d'annuler votre jour de congé pour nourrir les animaux "
"du zoo, pour une raison qui vous échappe, aucun de vos collègues n'est "
"présent aujourd'hui."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rabbi" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were davening Shacharit in shul when the Cataclysm struck.  You had "
"always taught that God will restore life to the dead after Moshiach has "
"come, but not like this!"
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en train de prier Shacharit à la synagogue lorsque le Cataclysme "
"a frappé. Vous avez toujours enseigné que Dieu redonnera la vie aux morts "
"après la venue du Machia'h, mais pas comme ça !"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rabbi" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were davening Shacharit in shul when the Cataclysm struck.  You had "
"always taught that God will restore life to the dead after Moshiach has "
"come, but not like this!"
msgstr ""
