msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Detective" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on the brink of a major breakthrough in your latest homicide case "
"when the Cataclysm struck.  Now your prime suspect is dead.  Everyone's "
"dead.  You could really use a smoke."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez sur le point de réaliser une avancée majeure dans votre dernière "
"affaire d’homicide lorsque le Cataclysme a frappé. Maintenant, votre "
"principal suspect est mort. Tout le monde est mort. Tu aurais vraiment "
"besoin d'une cigarette."

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Detective" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the brink of a major breakthrough in your latest homicide case "
"when the Cataclysm struck.  Now your prime suspect is dead.  Everyone's "
"dead.  You could really use a smoke."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez sur le point de réaliser une avancée majeure dans votre dernière "
"affaire d’homicide lorsque le Cataclysme a frappé. Maintenant, votre "
"principal suspect est mort. Tout le monde est mort. Tu aurais vraiment "
"besoin d'une cigarette."

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Medic" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on the front lines when everything happened, patching up the "
"wounded and providing support.  But they wouldn't stop coming.  Now you're "
"on your own."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en première ligne lorsque tout s’est produit, pansant les blessés "
"et apportant votre soutien. Mais ils n'arrêteraient pas de venir. Maintenant "
"vous êtes seule."

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Medic" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
