#. ~ Description of profession "Rescuer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez prêt. Vous êtes entré déterminée à retrouver et à sauver vos "
"amis. Maintenant, l'atmosphère dans ces couloirs sinueux devient lourde et "
"on ne se sent plus aussi en confiance. C’est peut-être vous qui aurez "
"bientôt besoin d’un secours."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rescuer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
