#. ~ Description of profession "Military Automatic Rifleman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trusted with a big-ass, belt-fed machine gun and plenty of ammo to "
"lay down suppressing fire for your team.  Now that it's going to be much "
"harder to resupply, you should probably be more selective with the ol' spray-"
"and-pray."
msgstr ""
"Votre escouade vous a confiée une mitrailleuse lourde énorme alimentée par "
"bande pour leur donner du tir de couverture. Maintenant que votre arme va "
"être beaucoup plus difficile à réapprovisionner, vous devriez peut être "
"économiser vos tirs."

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Automatic Rifleman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were trusted with a big-ass, belt-fed machine gun and plenty of ammo to "
"lay down suppressing fire for your team.  Now that it's going to be much "
"harder to resupply, you should probably be more selective with the ol' spray-"
"and-pray."
msgstr ""
"Votre escouade vous a confié une mitrailleuse lourde énorme alimentée par "
"bande pour leur donner du tir de couverture. Maintenant que votre arme va "
