"économiser vos tirs."

#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk "
"duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez gravi les échelons, passant de soldat anonyme à grand général de "
"division, respecté et décoré. En revanche, des années de travail au bureau "
"ont laissé vos compétences de tir rouillées, et toutes les médailles du "
"monde ne vous protégeront plus maintenant."

#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk "
"duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez gravi les échelons, passant de soldat anonyme à grand général de "
"division, respecté et décoré. En revanche, des années de travail au bureau "
