msgid ""
"You are skilled at spotting things out of the ordinary, like traps or "
"ambushes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Locksmith"
#: data/json/proficiencies/traps.json
msgid ""
"You can pick a lock in the dark, blindfolded.  Although that doesn't make it "
"all that much harder.  You're good at locks, OK?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Lockpicking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/traps.json
msgid "You know how to pick a lock, at least in theory."
msgstr "Vous savez comment crocheter un serrure, au moins en théorie."

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Trap Disarming"
#: data/json/proficiencies/traps.json
msgid "You know how to take down a trap safely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Trapping"
#: data/json/proficiencies/traps.json
msgid "You know the basics of setting and taking down traps safely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Trap Setting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/traps.json
msgid "You're specifically quite skilled at setting effective traps."
msgstr ""

