#. ~ Description of scenario "Lone Survivor" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to "
"get out of here!"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes la seule à s'en être sorti. Tous les autres sont morts à "
"proximité. Vous devez sortir d'ici !"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Lone Survivor" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
