"have some time before it returns to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne savez pas ce que c'était mais vous avez réussi à le perdre pour le "
"moment. Vous êtes désormais blessé, encerclé et le bâtiment est en feu. Vous "
"espérez avoir un peu de temps avant qu'il ne revienne pour terminer le "
"travail."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Fungal Infection" for female
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Fungal Infection" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez des spores ramper sous votre peau. Ce n’est qu’une question "
"de temps."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Fungal Infection" for male
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Fungal Infection" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez des spores ramper sous votre peau. Ce n’est qu’une question "
"de temps."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter this "
"far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes retrouvée isolée au milieu d'une forêt. Les cris et les "
"gémissements sont atténués si loin de la civilisation, mais vous avez "
"intérêt à savoir vous débrouiller au milieu de la cambrousse."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter this "
"far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes retrouvé isolé au milieu d'une forêt. Les cris et les "
"gémissements sont atténués si loin de la civilisation, mais vous avez "
"intérêt à savoir vous débrouiller au milieu de la cambrousse."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Experiment" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have been heavily experimented upon for the advancement of science, "
"willingly or not.  Once the Cataclysm struck, you escaped the lab and "
"wandered aimlessly, ending up in a forest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Experiment" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have been heavily experimented upon for the advancement of science, "
"willingly or not.  Once the Cataclysm struck, you escaped the lab and "
"wandered aimlessly, ending up in a forest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Abducted" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have found yourself in the most alien place you've ever seen.  The hot, "
"humid air and the organic appearance of the structure make you feel like "
"you're trapped inside a giant creature.  Whatever it is, you need to get out "
"of here before They find you."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes retrouvée dans l'endroit le plus étrange que vous ayez jamais "
"vu, l'air chaud et humide et l'apparence organique de cette structure vous "
"donnent l'impression d'être piégée à l'intérieur d'une créature vivante. Peu "
"importe la nature de cette endroit, vous devez vous échapper avant qu'Ils "
"vous trouvent."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Abducted" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have found yourself in the most alien place you've ever seen.  The hot, "
"humid air and the organic appearance of the structure make you feel like "
"you're trapped inside a giant creature.  Whatever it is, you need to get out "
"of here before They find you."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes retrouvé dans l'endroit le plus étrange que vous ayez jamais "
"vu, l'air chaud et humide et l'apparence organique de cette structure vous "
"donnent l'impression d'être piégé à l'intérieur d'une créature vivante. Peu "
"importe la nature de cette endroit, vous devez vous échapper avant qu'Ils "
"vous trouvent."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Squatter" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in an abandoned building.  Unfortunately, while you're the only one "
"here now, you are definitely not the first person to be here, and in its "
"current state this building no longer seems nearly as secure as one might "
"have hoped."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous êtes "
"\"relativement\" en sécurité dans un bâtiment abandonné. Malheureusement, "
"même si vous êtes la seule ici actuellement, vous n'êtes certainement pas la "
"première personne à être ici, et dans son état actuel, ce bâtiment ne semble "
"plus aussi sûr qu'on aurait pu l'espérer."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Squatter" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in an abandoned building.  Unfortunately, while you're the only one "
"here now, you are definitely not the first person to be here, and in its "
"current state this building no longer seems nearly as secure as one might "
"have hoped."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous êtes "
"\"relativement\" en sécurité dans un bâtiment abandonné. Malheureusement, "
"même si vous êtes le seul ici actuellement, vous n'êtes certainement pas la "
"première personne à être ici, et dans son état actuel, ce bâtiment ne semble "
"plus aussi sûr qu'on aurait pu l'espérer."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la vague de panique. Vous êtes \"relativement\" en "
"sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du gouvernement."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la vague de panique. Vous êtes \"relativement\" en "
"sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du gouvernement."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Compromised Shelter" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you "
"came with started to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed "
"up in the basement for now, but sooner or later you have to make for the "
"door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous étiez "
"''relativement'' dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du gouvernement. "
"Cependant, les gens avec qui vous êtes venus ont commencé à se retourner et "
"maintenant ils s'en prennent à votre chair ! Vous êtes pour l'instant "
"enfermée au sous-sol, mais tôt ou tard, vous devrez vous diriger vers la "
"porte… et vite !"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Compromised Shelter" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you "
"came with started to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed "
"up in the basement for now, but sooner or later you have to make for the "
"door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous étiez "
"''relativement'' dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du gouvernement. "
"Cependant, les gens avec qui vous êtes venus ont commencé à se retourner et "
"maintenant ils s'en prennent à votre chair ! Vous êtes pour l'instant "
"enfermé au sous-sol, mais tôt ou tard, vous devrez vous diriger vers la "
"porte… et vite !"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Bordered" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  While evacuating, you "
"noticed a mysterious sky-high wall in the distance, seemingly cutting off "
"travel in every direction around you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous êtes "
"''relativement'' en sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du "
"gouvernement. Lors de votre évacuation, vous avez remarqué au loin un "
"mystérieux mur d'une hauteur vertigineuse, interrompant apparemment les "
"déplacements dans toutes les directions autour de vous."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Bordered" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  While evacuating, you "
"noticed a mysterious sky-high wall in the distance, seemingly cutting off "
"travel in every direction around you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous êtes "
"''relativement'' en sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du "
"gouvernement. Lors de votre évacuation, vous avez remarqué au loin un "
"mystérieux mur d'une hauteur vertigineuse, interrompant apparemment les "
"déplacements dans toutes les directions autour de vous."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Low Profile" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities "
"firsthand — a situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to "
"cheap trailer, trying to outrun the madness.  While only you know where "
"you'd planned to go, when you heard the government's last broadcast and "
"realized 'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a dejected toast and "
"sink to the bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What happened in "
"the following days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is "
"that it's time to see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Low Profile" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities "
"firsthand — a situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to "
"cheap trailer, trying to outrun the madness.  While only you know where "
"you'd planned to go, when you heard the government's last broadcast and "
"realized 'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a dejected toast and "
"sink to the bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What happened in "
"the following days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is "
"that it's time to see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Really Bad Day" for female
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Really Bad Day" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, "
"surrounded by fire, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill really "
"fast."
msgstr ""
"Vous commencez ivre au point d'en devenir incapable, déprimée, infectée, "
"entourée de feu et malade de la grippe. Cette journée est partie en vrille "
"très rapidement."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Really Bad Day" for male
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Really Bad Day" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, "
"surrounded by fire, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill really "
"fast."
msgstr ""
"Vous commencez ivre au point d'en devenir incapable, déprimé, infecté, "
"entouré de feu et malade de la grippe. Cette journée est partie en vrille "
"très rapidement."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded in the Dark" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were camping in the wild to let things back home cool off.  One night "
"strange noises closed in on you and you were attacked.  You managed to get "
"away but can feel things moving in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Vous campiez dans la nature pour laisser les choses se calmer à la maison. "
"Une nuit, des bruits étranges se sont rapprochés de vous et vous avez été "
"agressée. Vous avez réussi à vous enfuir mais vous sentez que des choses "
"bougent dans l'obscurité."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded in the Dark" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were camping in the wild to let things back home cool off.  One night "
"strange noises closed in on you and you were attacked.  You managed to get "
"away but can feel things moving in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Vous campiez dans la nature pour laisser les choses se calmer à la maison. "
"Une nuit, des bruits étranges se sont rapprochés de vous et vous avez été "
"agressé. Vous avez réussi à vous enfuir mais vous sentez que des choses "
"bougent dans l'obscurité."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Island Prison" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were convicted or working in a high-security prison before the "
"Cataclysm.  Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how "
"to escape.  It's located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need "
"to escape that also."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une prisonnière ou une employée dans une prison de haute sécurité "
"avant le Cataclysme. Malheureusement, vous êtes encore à l'intérieur après, "
"et vous avez besoin de trouver un moyen de vous échapper. De plus, la prison "
"a été construite sur une île isolée, et vous aurez donc besoin "
"d'éventuellement trouver un moyen de sortir de la aussi."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Island Prison" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were convicted or working in a high-security prison before the "
"Cataclysm.  Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how "
"to escape.  It's located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need "
"to escape that also."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez un prisonnier ou un employé dans une prison de haute sécurité "
"avant le Cataclysme. Malheureusement, vous êtes encore à l'intérieur après, "
"et vous avez besoin de trouver un moyen de vous échapper. De plus, la prison "
"a été construite sur une île isolée, et vous aurez donc besoin "
"d'éventuellement trouver un moyen de sortir de la aussi."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Trans-Coast Logistics Concourse" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"facility's evacuation.  You'd better find your lanyard with your badge "
"before the automated defenses notice that you don't have one."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez considéré comme une employée essentielle et vous deviez rester "
"sur place pendant l'évacuation de l'établissement. Vous feriez mieux de "
"retrouver votre lanière avec votre badge avant que les défenses automatisées "
"ne s'aperçoivent que vous n'en avez pas."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Trans-Coast Logistics Concourse" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"facility's evacuation.  You'd better find your lanyard with your badge "
"before the automated defenses notice that you don't have one."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez considéré comme un employé essentiel et vous deviez rester sur "
"place pendant l'évacuation de l'établissement. Vous feriez mieux de "
"retrouver votre lanière avec votre badge avant que les défenses automatisées "
"ne s'aperçoivent que vous n'en avez pas."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Lab Staff" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"lab's evacuation.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez considérée comme un employée essentielle et vous deviez rester "
"sur place pendant l'évacuation du laboratoire. Trouvez un moyen de vous "
"échapper ou mourez de faim."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Lab Staff" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"lab's evacuation.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez considéré comme un employé essentiel et vous deviez rester sur "
"place pendant l'évacuation du laboratoire. Trouvez un moyen de vous échapper "
"ou mourez de faim."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mansion Escape" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and "
"eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of "
"your mansion that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious, "
"you hear heavy footsteps nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"À la fin du monde, vous meniez une grande vie, entourée de richesses et "
"mangeant bien tous les jours. Maintenant, vous vous réveillez, seule et "
"droguée, dans une pièce de votre manoir que vous ne reconnaissez pas. Alors "
"que vous luttez pour rester consciente, vous entendez des pas lourds à "
"proximité. Il est temps de foutre le camp d'ici."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mansion Escape" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and "
"eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of "
"your mansion that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious, "
"you hear heavy footsteps nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"À la fin du monde, vous meniez une grande vie, entouré de richesses et "
"mangeant bien tous les jours. Maintenant, vous vous réveillez, seul et "
"drogué, dans une pièce de votre manoir que vous ne reconnaissez pas. Alors "
"que vous luttez pour rester conscient, vous entendez des pas lourds à "
"proximité. Il est temps de foutre le camp d'ici."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Bottom of a Mine" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  "
"You're not sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr ""
"Vous faisiez partie du personnel d'une mine quand vous avez trouvé… quelque "
"chose. Vous n'êtes pas sûre de ce que c'est, mais il fait affreusement noir."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Bottom of a Mine" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  "
"You're not sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr ""
"Vous faisiez partie du personnel d'une mine quand vous avez trouvé… quelque "
"chose. Vous n'êtes pas sûr de ce que c'est, mais il fait affreusement noir."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Between a Rock and a Hard Place" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of "
"bandits has dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr ""
"Vous essayiez de récupérer des provisions, et voilà qu'un groupe de bandits "
"a entraîné des monstres avec eux là où vous vous cachiez !"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Between a Rock and a Hard Place" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of "
"bandits has dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr ""
"Vous essayiez de récupérer des provisions, et voilà qu'un groupe de bandits "
"a entraîné des monstres avec eux là où vous vous cachiez !"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Crazy Party" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd been unsurprised when your vacation — a hastily arranged holiday to a "
"remote resort to maintain distance from the riots — had been put out of its "
"misery when state-wide evacuation was ordered after weeks of worsening "
"violence, and the complex had been placed on a shortlist for civilian "
"gathering sites.  After days of waiting for a non-existent rescue and "
"refugees bringing tales of monsters and the dead, the remaining staff had "
"taken steps to keep spirits up, and last evening, they did that in the best "
"way they knew — hosting a party.  Considering that it lured scores of "
"zombies, you could probably classify that decision as a 'road to literal "
"hell paved with good intentions.'"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Crazy Party" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd been unsurprised when your vacation — a hastily arranged holiday to a "
"remote resort to maintain distance from the riots — had been put out of its "
"misery when state-wide evacuation was ordered after weeks of worsening "
"violence, and the complex had been placed on a shortlist for civilian "
"gathering sites.  After days of waiting for a non-existent rescue and "
"refugees bringing tales of monsters and the dead, the remaining staff had "
"taken steps to keep spirits up, and last evening, they did that in the best "
"way they knew — hosting a party.  Considering that it lured scores of "
"zombies, you could probably classify that decision as a 'road to literal "
"hell paved with good intentions.'"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of living dead in some way, now they're all "
"around you and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez attiré l'attention des morts-vivants d'une manière ou d'une autre, "
"ils sont désormais tout autour de vous et vous devrez probablement vous "
"battre à travers eux si vous voulez vous échapper."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of living dead in some way, now they're all "
"around you and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez attiré l'attention des morts-vivants d'une manière ou d'une autre, "
"ils sont désormais tout autour de vous et vous devrez probablement vous "
"battre à travers eux si vous voulez vous échapper."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've found a safe place away from the cities and devoid of the living "
"dead.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez trouvé un endroit sûr, loin des villes et dépourvu de morts-"
"vivants. On dirait que vous êtes seule…"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've found a safe place away from the cities and devoid of the living "
"dead.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez trouvé un endroit sûr, loin des villes et dépourvu de morts-"
"vivants. On dirait que vous êtes seul…"

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_crafting"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Crafting skills"
msgstr "Compétences de fabrication"

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_interaction"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Interaction skills"
msgstr "Compétences d'interaction"

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_melee"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Melee skills"
msgstr "Compétences de mêlée"

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_ranged"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Ranged skills"
msgstr "Compétences de combat à distance"

#. ~ Description of skill "handguns"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Handguns have poor accuracy compared to rifles, but are usually quick to "
"fire and reload faster than other guns.  Though they lack the punch and long-"
"range capabilities of most rifles, a handgun may be fired one-handed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "launchers"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Heavy weapons like flamethrowers, grenade launchers, and mortars have a "
"variety of applications and may carry immense destructive power, but they "
"are cumbersome and difficult to manage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "rifles"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Rifles have terrific range and accuracy compared to other firearms, but can "
"prove difficult to use in in close combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "shotguns"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Shotguns typically fire a burst of pellets which are surprisingly accurate "
"and tremendously damaging to soft targets, but less effective against "
"armor.  They make reliable hunting tools or close-quarters weapons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "submachine guns"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Submachine guns are lightweight and capable of operating with one hand, like "
"pistols.  This makes them ideal for close-quarters engagements, where burst "
"or fully automatic fire tends to make up for small caliber ammunition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "dodging"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to dodge an oncoming threat, be it an enemy's attack, a "
"triggered trap, or a falling rock.  This skill is also used in attempts to "
"fall gracefully, and for other acrobatic feats.  The number to the left is "
"your total dodge score including modifiers, on the right are your raw ranks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "science"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to safely and methodically handle the practical side of "
"laboratory work, as well as your general understanding of the principles of "
"the physical sciences, particularly chemistry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "athletics"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your athletic ability, including swimming, climbing, rowing, balancing, "
"cycling, and how much you can carry.  Athletic skill governs general "
"kinesthetics and also improves your overall cardio fitness and stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "marksmanship"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your overall skill in using ranged weapons of any kind.  With higher levels, "
"this general experience increases accuracy with any bows or firearms, but is "
"secondary to practice with the type of ranged weapon in question."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "melee"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill and finesse in hand-to-hand combat, both with and without a "
"weapon.  Higher levels can significantly increase the accuracy and "
"effectiveness of your physical attacks, as well as improving your defenses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "ecology"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill at dealing with your environment.  This includes working with "
"plants and animals, exploring, making fire, and scouting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "computers"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in accessing and manipulating computers.  Higher levels can allow "
"a user to navigate complex software systems and even bypass their security, "
"or program and operate drones and other robots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "cooking"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in combining food ingredients to make other, tastier food items.  "
"Also includes food preservation and safety, brewing, butchery, and more."
msgstr ""
"Votre habileté à combiner des ingrédients alimentaires pour créer d’autres "
"aliments plus savoureux. Comprend également la conservation et la sécurité "
"des aliments, le brassage, la boucherie et bien plus encore."

#. ~ Description of skill "electronics"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in dealing with electrical systems, used in the craft and repair "
"of objects with electrical components.  This skill is an important part of "
"installing and managing bionic implants."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à fabriquer et réparer des objets électriques. Cette "
"compérence joue un grand rôle pour l'installation et la gestion des implants "
"bioniques."

#. ~ Description of skill "medicine"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in effecting medical treatment.  Higher levels allow better use "
"of medicines and items like bandages and first aid kits, and reduce the "
"failure and complication rates of medical procedures."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence dans l’exécution de traitements médicaux. Des niveaux plus "
"élevés permettent une meilleure utilisation des médicaments et des articles "
"tels que les bandages et les trousses de premiers secours, et réduisent les "
"taux d'échec et de complications des procédures médicales."

#. ~ Description of skill "mechanics"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in engineering, plumbing, and working with simple or complex "
"machines.  It's frequently useful for crafting and often essential for "
"construction and vehicle work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "unarmed combat"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting empty-handed.  This includes basic punches and kicks "
"as well as advanced martial arts techniques, grappling, and attacks made "
"with mutated body parts such as horns, fangs, and claws.  Items like steel-"
"toed boots, leather gloves, and brass knuckles may also be worn to increase "
"unarmed damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "bashing weapons"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with blunt weaponry, from rocks and sticks to "
"baseball bats and the butts of rifles.  Bashing damage tends to be reliable "
"even against many types of armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "cutting weapons"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with weaponry designed to cut, hack and slash an "
"opponent.  Cutting damage tends to be very high, but armor is especially "
"effective against it.  High skill and knowledge of enemy weak points can "
"overcome this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "stabbing weapons"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with weapons designed to puncture.  Stabbing damage "
"has many of the strengths of cut, but is better at overcoming armor.  In "
"exchange, it requires more skill and stabbing weapons tend to be harder to "
"use.  Skill and perception reduce the chance of your weapon lodging in an "
"enemy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "vehicles"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in operating and steering a vehicle in motion, from cars and "
"boats to helicopters and horse-drawn carriages.  A higher level allows "
"greater control over vehicles at higher speeds and reduces the penalty of "
"shooting while driving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "devices"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in setting, detecting, disabling, repairing, and crafting fine "
"devices like security systems, traps, locks, some firearm components, and "
"explosives.."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "socializing"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in speaking to other people.  Covers ability in boasting, "
"flattery, threats, persuasion, lies, bartering, and other facets of "
"interpersonal communication.  Works best in conjunction with a high level of "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Votre habileté à parler aux autres. Couvre la capacité de se vanter, de "
"flatter, de menacer, de persuader, de mentir, de troquer et d'autres "
"facettes de la communication interpersonnelle. Fonctionne mieux en "
"conjonction avec un niveau élevé d’intelligence."

#. ~ Description of skill "tailoring"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in the craft and repair of clothing, bags, blankets and other "
"textiles.  Affects knitting, sewing, stitching, weaving, and nearly anything "
"else involving a needle and thread."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence pour fabriquer et réparer vêtements, sacs, couvertures et "
"autres textiles. Tricot, tissage, couture, tout ce qui implique du fil et "
"une aiguille est à votre portée."

#. ~ Description of skill "throwing"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in throwing objects or creatures over a distance, or in operating "
"weapons like slings which operate on similar principles.  Higher ranks allow "
"farther, harder, and more accurate throws."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "archery"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in using bow weapons, from hand-carved self bows to complex "
"crossbows.  They require strength to load, but practiced archers may learn "
"proficiencies to offset this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "fabrication"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in working with raw materials and shaping them into useful "
"objects.  This skill covers the widest variety of crafting and construction "
"projects."
msgstr ""

