"[Photograph: blurry CCTV snapshot of a woman in a hospital gown.]\n"
"\n"
"NAME: Aubrey D. Williams\n"
"AGE: 33\n"
"RACE: White\n"
"SEX: Female\n"
"HAIR COLOR: Brown\n"
"EYE COLOR: Green\n"
"HEIGHT: 5'11\"\n"
"WEIGHT: 185 pounds\n"
"\n"
