msgstr ""
"\"Est-ce que vous avez vu ces… euhh... villes carrées? Je ne pense pas que "
"c'est une forme normale pour une ville\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone hear about that guy who tried to sail his family to Canada?  What a "
"moron, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vous avez entendu parler de ce type qui a essayé de faire venir sa famille "
"au Canada ? Quel couillon, hein ?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone reading this, stay off the roads.  Me and the boys were ambushed by "
"some goons there.  If you see a fallen tree blocking your path, just turn "
"around and go back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si quelqu'un lit ceci, éviter les routes. Mes amis et moi nous sommes fait "
"pris en embuscade pars des bandits en voyageant sur l'une d'entre elles. Si "
"vous voyez un arbre bloquant la route, faite juste demi-tour promptement.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone wanna listen to some music at full volume and shoot the Zs that "
"approach?  You pick the tunes if I get some ammo.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Quelqu'un veut écouter de la musique à fond et tirer sur les Z qui "
"approchent ? Tu choisis les tubes et je vais chercher des munitions.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Are they still human inside?\""
msgstr "\"Est-ce qu'il y a toujours quelque chose d'humain à l'intérieur?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"BURN BURN BURN BURN BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN\""
msgstr ""
"\"BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ BRÛLEZ TOUS BRÛLEZ TOUS "
"BRÛLEZ TOUS\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Best way to train is by throwing pebbles at birds.  You'll be a legend.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La meilleure façon de s'entraîner est de lancer des cailloux aux oiseaux. "
"Tu deviendras une légende.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Boyfriend stole my pistol while I was asleep.  I locked him in the "
"bathroom and set the house on fire.  At least he attracted their attention.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Broadsword!  Yeah!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"CHINA DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"C'EST LA FAUTE À LA CHINE\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Cha-cha-cha-chia!  Saw a woman today, with fungus coming out her head like "
"hair tendrils.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages "
"out of some of those assholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Check your friends for bites, don't let them hide it and turn on you.  "
"Only way out is to shoot em in the head.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Come to the bar if you see this, let's re-enact a zombie movie, friends.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Venez au bar si vous voyez ça, rejouons un film de zombies, mes amis.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Crawled in through the vents.  Whole office building is infested.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai rampé dans les conduits de ventilation. Toute la tour de bureaux est "
"infestée.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"DANNY IF YOU READ THIS THIS IS CLARA WE'RE ALL OKAY AND WE'RE HEADING TO "
"THE RIVER.  A BOAT SAID THEY WERE DOCKED NEARBY.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DINT ATE THE MUSHROM\""
msgstr "\"PA MANGÉ LE CHAMPIGON\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DOG NOT REAL DOG\""
msgstr "\"LE CHIEN N'EST PAS UN VRAI CHIEN\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME\""
msgstr ""
"\"NE MANGEZ PAS LE SLIME NE MANGEZ PAS LE SLIME NE MANGEZ PAS LE SLIME\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DON't bomB THe PORtals it MAKES iT WORSE\""
msgstr "\"NE BOMBardeZ PAS LEs PORtails. ça EMPIRE LA SITUATION\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Diamond coated sword!  Diamond coated hammer!  Diamond coated clothes!  "
"Diamond coated hands help\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Don't keep your goddamn casings!  They'll just weigh you down.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't let the ember go out please don't go out I need you precious fire.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't mix powders, them books said.  Do Not Mix powders.  Didn't listen "
"did I.  Blew my goddamn pinky off, near lost my right eye.\""
msgstr ""
"Ne mélangez pas les poudres, les livres disait. Ne Mélangez Pas Les Poudres. "
"Est-ce que j'ai écouté? Maintenant j'ai un petit doigt en moins et je suis "
"passé à deux doigts de perdre mon œil droit."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't shoot the people who get bit!  It's OK!  Death is the only thing "
"that makes you turn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ne tuez pas les gens qui se font mordre! C'est OK! La mort est la seule "
"chose qui vous transforme!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't trust them.  The mushrooms aren't your friends.  They're delusional\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"ENGLAND DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"C'EST LA FAUTE À L'ANGLETERRE\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Everyone used their gas to get to another town… but it's the same story "
"everywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tout le monde utilise son essence pour atteindre une autre ville… Mais "
"c'est la même histoire partout.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FIRE BAD.  NOW NAKED.  PLEASE HELP.\""
msgstr "\"LE FEU FAIT MAL. MAINTENANT À POIL. BESOIN D'AIDE.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERIZES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""
msgstr ""
"\"UNE EPÉE ENFLAMMÉE ET UNE ARME HUMAINE. ELLE CAUTÉRISE LES BLESSURES. SES "
"EFFETS SONT CHIRURGICAUX\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FUCK FAUX-MUTANTS, BEING 'EXTREMELY THIRSTY' DOES NOT COUNT\""
msgstr ""
"\"LES FAUX-MUTANTS PEUVENT ALLER SE FAIRE FOUTRE, ÊTRE \"EXTRÈMEMENT "
"ASSOIFFÉ\" NE COMPTE PAS\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"For anyone that's reading this, I just want to confirm (FROM AN UNBIASED "
"SOURCE) that it was NOT the scientists' fault.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"For sale: zombaby shoes, very filthy\""
msgstr "\"À vendre: Chaussure de bébé zombifié, très mauvaise condition\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found some food in a box outside my house.  We ate it and now the "
"fungaloids aren't harming us.  I think we are a mushroom now\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found some pink berries.  Eating them makes bushes into more pink "
"berries.  Infinite berry.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Fungus are helping us.  Help them and they will unite us\""
msgstr ""
"\"Les champignons sont nos alliés. Ils nous uniront tous si vous les aidez\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I have not found any of your notes, which means you're either taking a "
"different path or have already made your way back home.  In the case you're "
"still out here somewhere, if you see the sky suddenly grow dark, hide "
"indoors immediately, I have a feeling this storm is far from over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, je n'ai trouvé aucune de tes notes, ce qui veut dire que soit tu est en "
"train de prendre un chemin différent où que tu est déjà rentré au bercail. "
"Au cas où tu est encore au large, si tu vois le ciel s'assombrir, cache toi "
"à l'intérieur d'un bâtiment immédiatement, j'ai bien peur que cette tempête "
"soit loin d'être terminée.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I hope you're finding my notes and the supply drops.  Use my binocs, if "
"they're still there, and check out the roof.  Avoid the huge tower.  I don't "
"know what's inside, but the noises that come out of it can't signal anything "
"good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, j'espère que tu trouve mes notes et mes caches de provisions. Utilise "
"mes jumelles, si elle sont toujours là, et jette un coup d'œil aux alentours "
"depuis le toit. Évite la tour gigantesque à moitié effondrée. Je ne sais pas "
"ce qu'il y a à l'intérieur, mais les bruits qui s'en dégage ne signalent "
"rien de bon.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I ran into an actual human today!  He was looking for his daughter.  We "
"exchanged some food and traded information on the surrounding area.  He "
"spoke of a family living on a farm out in the fields, surviving and "
"thriving!  Maybe it's time we carved ourselves a peaceful place in this "
"hell.  We'll discuss this once we meet back home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, j'ai rencontré un autre être humain aujourd'hui! Il était à la "
"recherche de sa fille. Nous avons troqué de la nourriture et des "
"informations sur les environs. Il m'a parlé d'une famille vivant assez bien "
"sur une ferme isolée! Peut être qu'il serait temps que nous nous "
"construisons un endroit sûr et agréable au milieu de ce cauchemar. On pourra "
"discuter de tout ça lorsque nous serons tout les deux de retour à la maison."
"\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I've stopped the bleeding, I'll be fine.  Can't stay here any longer, "
"there's too much commotion outside.  Meet me back at our usual spot, we will "
"retrieve our stuff together, don't go alone.  Be careful when exiting out "
"the back, I saw one of them running around with a spear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, j'ai arrêté l’hémorragie, tout va bien se passer. Je ne peut pas rester "
"ici, trop d'activité là dehors. Retrouve-moi à notre lieu de rendez-vous "
"habituel, l'on ira récupérer nos trucs ensemble, n'y va pas tout seul. Fait "
"attention lorsque tu sortira par l'arrière, j'ai vu l'un d'entre eux en "
"train d'arpenter les environs avec une lance dans ses mains."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, be careful around those bulging and pulsating corpses.  I saw one "
"today.  I think there's something eating away at those things.  I didn't "
"stick around to find out.  I burnt the entire building down, just to be "
"sure, so you should have relatively safe passage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, fait attention à ces corps gonflés et pulsants. J'en ai vu un "
"aujourd'hui. Je crois qu'il y a quelque chose les dévorant de l'intérieur. "
"J'ai juste mis feu au bâtiment, pour être sûre, donc si tu passe par là, tu "
"devrais être relativement en sécurité.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, don't head straight through, go around.  There's a glowing one just "
"hanging out in the alley.  I tried stabbing it but it zapped me with some "
"sort of static electricity and I ran back here.  I'll try to whack it with a "
"club next time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ne passe pas directement à travers, contourne. Il y en à un qui brille "
"une lueur aveuglante dans l'allée. J'ai essayé de le poignarder, mais il m'a "
"électrocuté et j'ai décidé de m'enfuir et de me réfugier ici. J'essaierai "
"d'utiliser une massue pour l'écerveler la prochaine fois que je le "
"rencontrerait.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, if you find this, I'm at the farm just out of town.  I'll need to stay "
"there a few days, I've been wounded by one of those overgrown bastards, shot "
"a spike right into my thigh.  I'll wait for you there as long as I can, stay "
"safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, si tu trouve ceci, je me suis réfugiée dans la ferme juste hors de la "
"ville. J'ai besoin de rester là plusieurs jours, je me suis fait blessée, "
"l'une de ces abominations à tirer un dard directement à travers ma cuisse. "
"Je resterais ici jusqu'à ce que je sois guérie, j'espère que tes périples "
"sont moins désastreux.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, move only after dark.  I saw lights in the distance, I think there "
"might be someone living around here.  Wish I had my radio right now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ne bouge qu'après que le soleil se soit couché. J'ai vu des lumières au "
"loin, je pense que quelqu'un vit dans les environs. Comme je voudrais avoir "
"ma radio sur moi là maintenant.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, the city is full of them.  I don't know how, it's as if we never came "
"through here.  They're the same ones we'd put down, I am sure of it.  They "
"got back up and now look more dangerous than ever.  I saw one of them just "
"snatch a bird right off the roof with its long hands.  You have to use the "
"sewers.  I know we agreed not to travel underground, but as horrible as it "
"is down there, I fear our world up here is no longer ours either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ils submergent totalement la ville. Je ne sais pas comment, c'est comme "
"si nous n'étions jamais passé à travers. Ce sont les mêmes que nous avons "
"abattus, j'en suis sûre. Ils se sont relevés et beaucoup d'entre eux ont "
"l'air plus dangereux que jamais. Je viens d'en voir un attraper un oiseau "
"sur un gouttière avec ses bras absurdement longs et le fourrer dans sa "
"bouche. Tu devrais probablement utiliser les égouts. Je sais que nous nous "
"étions dit de ne jamais utiliser les souterrains à nouveau, mais peu importe "
"les dangers du monde en dessous, je ne crois pas que le monde d'au dessus "
"nous appartienne encore.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, there's something not right with the forests here.  The ground there "
"feels soft and is overgrown with some sort of mushrooms.  Be careful not to "
"breathe in the dust they kick up, I accidentally took a whiff and have been "
"coughing and vomiting since.  The map shows there's a cabin just outside "
"town, I'll lay low there until I feel better.  I'm almost home.  I know you "
"will be waiting for me there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, il y a quelque chose de bizarre avec les forêts dans les environs, le "
"sol est bizarrement doux et humide et recouvert d'une sorte de tapis de "
"champignons. Fait attention à ne pas respirer la poussière que ceux-ci "
"relâchent, j'ai en accidentellement ingérer une bouffée et je n'ai pas "
"arrêter de tousser et vomir depuis. La carte que j'ai trouvée indique un "
"chalet dans les environs, je vais essayer de m'abriter là jusqu'à ce que je "
"me sente mieux. Je suis presque de retour à la maison. Je sais que tu sera "
"là à m'attendre.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"GOD CAN'T SAVE US\""
msgstr "\"DIEU NE PEUT PAS NOUS SAUVER\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Gas mask is nice and all, but I can hardly run with it on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Le masque à gaz c'est bien, mais je peux difficilement courir avec.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Go to every fungus patch you find but WEAR A SUIT.  Food there is very "
"very filling.  Look for pink berries, blue flowers\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Gonna settle down one day.  Nice big orchard, couple of friends/future "
"family to spend time with, and a nice system of fortifications to keep us "
"safe.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Good news: My teachers aren't trying to tear my limbs off about my "
"homework.  Bad news: My teachers are trying to tear my limbs off regardless."
"\""
msgstr ""
"Bonne nouvelle: Mes professeurs n'essaient plus de me tailler en pièces au "
"sujet de mes devoirs. Mauvaise nouvelle: Mes professeurs veulent juste me "
"tailler en pièces."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Got my mortar and pestle.  Now if I could just find some avocados…\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai obtenu le mortier et le pilon. Si je pouvais trouver quelques "
"avocats...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"Gotta slow down, man.  I don't think we spend more than 20% of our time "
"fightin',  Put some Marley on and take off that racketus tripcore nonsense, "
"man.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Guns too loud.  Crossbow too long.  Running is best.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Armes à feu trop bruyantes. Arbalètes trop lentes. Mieux vaut courir.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  "
"Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hahahahaa, vieux débile dans son manoir de bourgeois, avec son armure de "
"plaques et sa hache de guerre. Richard n'a jamais frappé quoi que ce soit "
"avec. L'armure de plaques n'est pas pare-balles, couillon\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Have seen a zombie making its kin raise even despite damage that normally "
"would take them down, the surrounding air shimmered like around that hole in "
"the air we've seen creatures coming through back home\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu un zombie capable de réanimer ses congénères malgré le fait qu'il "
"soient trop endommagés pour faire cela de façon normale, l'air autour de "
"cette abomination avait l'air bizarre comme l'air que j'ai vu autour du "
"portail à travers lequel j'ai pu voir des monstres passer au début de ce "
"cauchemar\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard of a place up in Maine where people have their shit together.  "
"Hundreds of people, defense, food and shelter… let's go raid it, guys!\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai entendu qu'il y a un enclave plus au nord, dans le Maine, où "
"plusieurs centaines de personnes on réussi à se rassembler avec de la "
"nourriture, des murs et de bons abris... on devrait aller essayer de faire "
"une razzia là bas les gars!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing "
"where those hordes are going.  Couldn't find the frequency, though.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Ted.  Alexander and Cass and I are heading to Z-Mobile for the last "
"of the meth.  Keep the lizard fetus fed for us, OK?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hé Ted. Alexander, Cass et moi sont partis vers la Z-Mobile pour aller "
"chercher le reste de la meth. Tu peux donner à manger au fétus de lézard "
"pour nous?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Hey, what happened to my dad's airboat?!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Husband 30 yrs died in bombs.  Mushrooms brought him back.  GIVE YOURSELF "
"TO THEm AND THEY WILL HELP YOU\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mari de 30 ans mort dans un bombardement. Champignons me l'on ramené. "
"REJOIGNEZ-LEs ET LEUR BÉNEVOLENCE VOUS SAUVERA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I am one with the plants.\""
msgstr "\"Je suis maintenant en communion avec le monde végétal\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can imagine people sending their 'love and prayers' on social media.  "
"Love doesn't kill zeds, prayer doesn't put food in my belly.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can see a large tower in the distance, And strange stalk-like creatures "
"are around it.  I feel sick just looking at it, and fire hasn't solved it.  "
"Those things seem to stay around it though.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I don't have enough time to double tap.  You don't either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai pas assez de temps pour vérifier s'ils sont bien morts. Vous non plus."
"\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a chocolate bar on my pillow when I got home last night.  I left "
"and don't wanna go back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai trouvée une barre de chocolat sur mon oreiller quand je suis rentrée "
"chez moi hier soir. Je suis immédiatement partie et je n'ai aucune intention "
"de revenir là bas.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a corpse with strange berries shoved down their gullet, seems to "
"have choked to death on the stuff.  greedy bastard\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found some kind of stone pyramid with spikes.  I feel… I feel like I'm "
"being watched.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I get air conditioners, but… this whole place is frozen to ice!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I got my tinfoil hat on.  Good thing too, cause this monster was starrin "
"at me kinda funny, trying to freeze my mind in place.\""
msgstr ""
"J'ai mis mon chapeau d'aluminium. Heureusement, car ce monstre me regardait "
"bizarrement, en essayant de geler mon âme sur place.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I had a phobia of bees BEFORE they grew to enormous sizes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'avais une phobie des abeilles AVANT qu'elles ne deviennent énormes.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I just realized how damn demented those fliers are.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I kept shooting with my handgun, but I never got any better!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I made mushroom babies.  My arms hurt.  I hurt.  I had mushroom babies.  "
"They are growing now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai fait des bébés champignons.  Mes bras me font mal.  J'ai mal.  J'ai "
"eu des bébés champignons.  Ils ne sont plus bébés maintenant.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I propose a new currency: 9mm.\""
msgstr "\"Je propose une nouvelle monnaie: le 9mm.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I put my toilet water into a gastank.  Then I poured it into a glass cup.  "
"Then I drank it without vomiting my insides back into the toilet.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw a zombie covered in shrooms emitting some strange dust.  When "
"another zombie got close, the two tore each other apart.  I'd rather not "
"stay here anymore.  Im packing up my stuff soon.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I shot the sheriff; but I couldn't find the deputy\""
msgstr "\"J'ai flingué le sheriff, pas réussi à trouver son adjoint\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I swear to God I've seen these plant things before!  In a book, or "
"something!  I swear…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I thought my damn terminal cancer was bad enough… now the dead are rising?!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je pensais que mon putain de cancer en phase terminale était bien assez "
"dur à supporter... maintenant les morts se relèvent?!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I took all the supplies.  Don't follow me.  I'm sorry, man.  I have to "
"look out for myself now.\""
msgstr ""
"J'ai pris tout. Ne me suis pas. Je suis tellement désolé, mais je dois me "
"mettre en priorité maintenant.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I tried playing memorial music for my dead brother, on a radio.  They must "
"have been attracted to it.  I can't see his grave through the crowd anymore."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai joué de la musique sur la radio en mémoire de mon frère mort. Ça a dû "
"les attirer. Je ne peux même plus voir sa tombe sous la foule.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I tried to be a bard, but the rats didn't like my piping.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai essayé la vie du troubadour, mais les rats n'étaient pas fans de ma "
"performance avec la flûte.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I used to be human.  But… my arms… they are like tentacles.  I slither "
"along akin to a snail and I shed my feathers every day.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I used to take everything at face value.  If you couldn't measure it, "
"couldn't explain it, couldn't put a number to it, it wasn't real.  Then this "
"shit happened.  Real funny.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I woke up with a dozen bears in a tribe outside the vault.  One was "
"covered in red markings, glowing-- speaking.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what's in this sarcophagus?  Maybe it's a real sarcophagus.  "
"Maybe there's a big guy named God under here.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm coming back for this note in twelve hours.  If I don't, take all my "
"shit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je serais de retour pour cette note dans douze heures. Si je ne reviens "
"pas d'ici là, prenez tout ce que vous pouvez!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm gonna be honest here, I'm really gonna die soon so I dont want to gt "
"forgnottedn ples dont forntget me y nrmmy name is h@@hbhbh\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je vais être honnête, je vais bientôt mourir, alors je ne veux pas être "
"oublié, s'il vous plaît, ne m'oubliez p-s, mo nm est h@@hbhbh\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm starting to feel bad about disabling all these turrets and stealing "
"their ammunition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je commence à me sentir un peu mal d'avoir démanteler autant de tourelles "
"et avoir volé toutes leurs balles.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I've heard it's safer across the Mississippi.  Going to start driving "
"today.  If you're reading this, pray for me\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I've never been very confident, is that why my shots keep missing?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"IM OFF TO THUNDERDOME, BYE SUCKERS.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"IT'S BURIED!  THE TEMPLE IS BURIED!\""
msgstr "\"IL EST INHUMÉ! LE TEMPLE EST INHUMÉ!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"ITS OKEY GUYS!  I BARRYED A TIME CAPSUL IN MY BACKYARD!  I PUT IN SOME "
"HOEHOES.\""
msgstr ""
"\"C'EST BON LES GARS ! J'AI ENFUI UNE CAPSULE TEMPOREL DANS LE JARDIN ! J'Y "
"AI MIS DES BN.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If I had a dollar for every cash card I've found, I'd have more money than "
"is on these stupid things!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si j'avais un dollar pour chaque carte de crédit que j'ai trouvée, "
"j'aurais plus d'argent que dans ces stupides trucs !\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you get a parasite, take some sand and some vodka.  Rub the sand into "
"the afflicted area, real good too; like you're washing your hair.  Then "
"rinse with vodka.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you see a trail of dirt getting displaced in your direction… run.  Run "
"for your life.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Imagine if this spread to, like, Australia.  Zombie kangaroos.  Haha…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Imaginez que ça arrive jusqu'en Australie. Kangourous zombies. Hehe...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Is robbing a bank easier or harder now that all the guards are undead?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voler une banque est plus facile ou plus dur maintenant que les guardes "
"sont des mort-vivants?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Is that one pharmaceutical company gonna come out with a, like, cure for "
"this anytime soon?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"It all boils down to the Apex Predator.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"It doesn't matter how you die.  You're gonna turn into one of them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Peut importe comment vous crevez, vous vous relèverez pour les rejoindre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"KASHWAK: NO-FO\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Killed a giant worm thing, but now I'm only three feet tall.  Should've "
"just left the damn worm alone, now none of my clothes fit!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Last one standing.  It's good feeling.  I win.  I win I win I win I win I "
"win\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Libraries are useless after the apocalypse.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lisa always was a fan of sports.  Thank God these Global Athletics Games "
"in Harran started some time before the outbreak, so she was able to leave "
"New England before it was quarantined.  I can only hope there are no "
"zombies, as we do have here, in the city she flew to.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Local auto shop is full of the things.  And to think I worked with them on "
"repairing cars… now they're just… fucking corpses.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting animata, managing "
"the fields, running with my wings buzzing, and more.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"MY GLITTERING SNAKE COMPELS YOU!  OBEY!\""
msgstr "\"MON SERPENT ÉTINCELANT VOUS OBLIGE À M'OBÉIRRR!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Makayla Sanchez burned down my fucking house\""
msgstr "\"Makayla Sanchez a mis feu à ma putain de maison\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Make sure you strip the house for all available resources-- tubes, pipes, "
"ceramics, sheets, strings, and more\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Make sure your car is REALLY stopped before you get out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Assurez vous que votre voiture est VRAIMENT arrêtée avant d'en sortir.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mike, we have your dog and that ginger fuck you run around with.  You know "
"where to find us.  Come alone, it's time to pay up.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Most things can be taken out with a shotgun.  More things can be taken out "
"with a grenade.  Imagine what a mini-nuke does.\""
msgstr ""
"\"On peut venir à bout de la plupart des choses avec un fusil. Plus de "
"choses avec une grenade. Imaginez ce que peut faire un mini-nuke.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My cousin says that murder nowadays is just a war crime.  War for what, I "
"don't know, since the undead seem to be rebels without a cause.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"My next-door neighbor had a katana in his basement!\""
msgstr "\"Mon voisin avez un katana dans son sous-sol!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My skin is crawling and I teleport every few minutes… what is going o\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ma peau me démange et je suis téléporté toutes les deux ou trois "
"minutes... Qu'est ce qui m'arri-\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"No wonder all the camps got overrun, they kept a goddamn zombie test "
"subject!  Each and every one of 'em!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Not sure if my companion WANTED to turn into a bird, but I was the one "
"giving her the serum, and I saved her life!  That's fair, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"PINK TALL ONES RUN RUN RUN RUN RUN\""
msgstr "\"LES  GÉANTS  ROSES COUREZ COUREZ COUREZ COUREZ COUREZ\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"RUSSIA DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"C'EST LA FAUTE À LA RUSSIE\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Reading is good!  Never stop reading.  Read EVERYTHING.\""
msgstr "\"Lire est une bonne chose ! N'arrêtez jamais de lire. Lisez TOUT.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Renting out my rat tunnels for 50 9mm rounds a night.  I dug them with my "
"own claws, so you know they're the best.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je loue mes tunnels à rats pour 50 balles de 9mm par nuit. Je les ai "
"creusés avec mes propres griffes, donc vous savez que ce sont les meilleurs."
"\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"River water around these parts is extremely safe.  Probably more safe than "
"the damn tap water at this point.\""
msgstr ""
"\"L'eau de rivière dans les environs et très saine. Probablement plus saine "
"que l'eau de robinet ces jours-ci.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"SHOOT YOURSELF, LET IT END QUICKLY\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM CONCORD\""
msgstr "\"N'ALLEZ PAS À CONCORD\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM THE BIG ONES IN THE FOREST\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME I CAN HEAR YOU IN THE DARK\""
msgstr "\"ARRÊTEZ DE ME SUIVRE JE PEUX VOUS ENTENDRE DANS LA NUIT\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"SWAMPS RUN SWAMPS NO SWAMPS RUN\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a boy couldnt be older than 16.  Walked straight through the mushroom "
"tower.  THROUGH IT\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu un garçon qui ne devait pas avoir plus de 16 ans. Il a marché "
"droit à travers la tour mycellaire. À TRAVERS\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw some chick in the forest.  Her body is all green and shit, and she was "
"covered in leaves and vines.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu une gonzesse dans la forêt. Son corps était totalement vert et "
"elle était couverte de feuilles, mousses et lianes.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"School bus with solar panels = TRUST.  Gave us berries and seeds, we were "
"out of food\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"See if you want to be, extra annoying you can, nod off to the, dump and "
"go, help, Erin to dig up the, last, peice\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Slingshot right through the windshield k?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some bridges, they're right next to each other, right?  If you see "
"something up ahead one of those, just careen through to the other side.  My "
"van was long enough to bridge right across!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some guy is walking through the horde without a scratch.  Please tell me "
"they're docile now.  Please fucking tell me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"un gars est en train de marcher à travers une horde sans une égratignure, "
"dites-moi qu'ils sont devenus dociles, je vous en supplie.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some of 'em are big.  Real big.  Don't stick around, I saw my mate get "
"fucking torn in half!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il y en a des gros. Très gros. Décampez dès que vous pouvez, un de mes "
"potes s'est fait déchirer en deux par une de ces abominations!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some plant vines started chasin after me, so I took a gas mask and some "
"teargas and I ran through them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Des plantes grimpantes ont commencé à me courir après, alors j'ai pris un "
"masque à gaz et du gaz lacrymogène et j'ai couru entre elles.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes what you need when you're infected, bleeding, sick and hungover "
"is a J and some chips.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"So… what happens if the military rescues us?  We're all freaks by now, "
"right?  How the fuck are we gonna go back to real life?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Donc... Qu'est-ce qui va se passer si l'armée nous sauve? On est tous plus "
"ou moins cinglés maintenant non? Comment est-ce qu'on va reprendre une vie "
"normale après tout ça?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Squeeze some ammonia into zombie flesh and hold it tight.  You smell like "
"one of them!  I think.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Écrasez de l'ammoniac dans de la chair de zombie et tenez les bien. Vous "
"sentez comme l'un deux! je pense.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Started my own brewery recently.  I just need some glass bottles, now!  "
"Several thousand!  I'm planning way ahead.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Starting today, the hallucinations are my only friends.\""
msgstr "\"À partir d'aujourd'hui, les hallucinations sont mes seules amies.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Stuck here.  Zombies outside.  Friends were outside too, now they're part "
"of zombies.  Need to be quiet\""
msgstr ""
"\"Coincée ici. Horde de zombies dehors. Mes potes étaient dehors aussi, "
"maintenant ils font partie de la horde. Dois rester silencieuse\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THE GOO IS IN THE WATER DON'T DRINK WATER\""
msgstr "\"LE LIMON GLUANT EST DANS L'EAU NE BUVEZ PAS L'EAU\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THE MARLEY WAS RIGHT\""
msgstr "\"LE MARLEY AVAIT RAISON\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THEY DON'T feel ANYTHING\""
msgstr "\"ILS NE ressentent RIEN\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Thank You RivTech.  Thank You For Good Coffee.  Will Always Stay Awake For "
"You Rivtech.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"That little fakkin rat din say anythin till we whacked him with a steel "
"chain!  Then 'e just wanted to know if he could buy the chain!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The bricks of this bathroom look like a face.  Haha… it's all I can focus "
"on.  At least let me shit before you break down the door.  Please…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The damn Autodoc overrides wouldn't work and I didn't have my hospital "
"ID.  I couldn't save them alone.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The evac shelters are a death trap.  They took everyone else away but "
"something in the driver's eyes told me not to go.  Now it's just me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The fewer people in New England, the stronger we'll become.\""
msgstr "\"Moins il y a de gens dans New England, plus on deviendra forts.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The whispering fog is taking me in like a blanket.  I'm warm now.  I'm "
"finally\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There are five basic rules to survival.  One, stay prepared and watchful.  "
"Two, keep your iron sights lined up or succumb.  Three, stay FAR WAY from "
"all\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"There's gotta be a better use of all this rebar…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing wrong with eating people if you HAVE to.  I mean, I only "
"did it because I didn't want to waste my potato chips!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il n'y a rien de mal à manger des gens si tu dois le faire. Je veux dire, "
"je l'ai fait seulement parce que je ne voulais pas gaspiller mes chips !\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"There's still an evacuation point at Concord, spread the word.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il y a toujours un centre d'évacuation à Concord, faites passer le mot.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"These berries are delicious!  Maybe taking these were worth it.  And the "
"more I eat, the more of it appears!  it's like an infinite food cycle!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"These turrets keep dodging my FUCKING BULLETS!\""
msgstr "\"Ces tourelles n'arrêtent pas d'esquiver mes PUTAINS DE BALLES!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"They are NOT slow!  They are NEVER slow!\""
msgstr "\"Ils ne sont PAS lents! Ils ne sont JAMAIS lents!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They said a walking cane was a useless weapon… but then I hit one of them "
"with it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ils me disaient que le baton de marche est une arme inutile... jusqu'à ce "
"que je frappe l'un d'eux avec!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They set up the roadblock guns to run automatically.  TV said those fuckin "
"things needed a human to keep em safe, they ain't safe now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ils ont laissés les tourelles allumées sur leurs barrages routiers. Ils "
"disaient sur la télé que ces foutus engins avaient besoin de supervision "
"humaine pour rester non létales. Plus personne pour donner cette supervision "
"maintenant…\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They're all hiding on an oil rig, I heard it myself over the AM airwaves.  "
"They think they're the nobles of the 21st century, the prigs.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the "
"people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't "
"zombies, it's just camouflage!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This is all just a dream, right??!  I'M GOING TO WAKE UP, SHE'S GOING TO "
"BE OK\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This isn't real this is a test to turn you into a Manchurian Candidate!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This thing isn't a car any more.  It's just a fucking mountain of metal on "
"wheels, which I live in.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ce truc n'est plus une voiture. C'est juste un amas de ferraille sur roues "
"dans lequel je vis\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Those Fiktok clan people picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have "
"realized I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the "
"grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all "
"the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all "
"changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm "
"leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Took a picture of a dead dog leaping right onto a soldier.  Sweet fucking "
"shot!\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai pris la photo d'un chien qui a sauté sur un soldat. Une putain de "
"photo!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Tried wearing dead zombie clothes, but they still knew I was alive!  It's "
"like they're a hivemind, man!\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai essayé de porter des vêtements de zombie mort, mais ils savaient "
"toujours que j'étais vivant ! C'est comme s'ils étaient un esprit de ruche, "
"mec !\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nobody left on the radio.  "
