#. ~ Description of "huge rifle ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and "
"big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other "
"materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  'Ball' is an old term for full "
"metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and "
"slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
