#. ~ Description of mutation "Left Cosmetic Prosthetic Arm"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a prosthetic on your left arm."
msgstr "Vous avez une prothèse installée sur le moignon de votre bras gauche."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Left Prosthetic Leg"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Left Peg Leg"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
