"high.  Clear them out for a minimal reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining horde!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"A horde of low level zombies are congregating at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Clear them out for a small reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining evolved horde!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"A huge horde of evolved zombies are congregating at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Clear them out for a large reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 3 nether creatures this expedition"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
