"a ranged weapon.  They will be alone.  Their sins are not your concern.  All "
"you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the guarded interlopers!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
