#. ~ Description of MOD "Dark Days of the Dead"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Turns the game into a classic Romero zombie game.  You must destroy the "
"brain.  Getting bitten is fatal.  However, zombies don't evolve, and when "
"they're down, they're down.  Removes the sci-fi and interdimensional aspects "
"of CDDA."
msgstr ""

