#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off tribal donations.  You came home to find your home abandoned, and "
"the only thing between you and death is the open fields and your pack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for male
