#~ msgid ""
#~ ".338 Lapua ammunition, loaded with a 248-grain armor-piercing bullet.  "
#~ "Developed as a joint venture between Accuracy International, SAKO, and "
#~ "Lapua, the .338 round is a long-range sniping cartridge that boasts "
#~ "impressive accuracy and devastating terminal ballistics.  This "
