#~ msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Despite firearms making traditional melee weapons largely obsolete, you "
#~ "have extensive experience fighting in hand-to-hand combat with tools of "
#~ "war.  Maybe it was full-contact HEMA or SCA sparring, or maybe you're "
#~ "just a badass commando with a machete.  You start with your choice of "
#~ "Barbaran Montante, Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval "
#~ "Swordsmanship, Niten Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Malgré le fait que les armes à feu rendent les armes de mêlée "
#~ "traditionnelles plus ou moins obsolètes, vous avez une vaste expérience "
#~ "de combat en corps à corps en utilisant des instruments de guerre variés. "
