#~ msgid ""
#~ "The great tusked moose is a mutant variety of megafauna that evolved "
#~ "after the Cataclysm.  Easily recognized by the underslung tusks off the "
#~ "side of each mouth, in addition to an impressive rack of horns.  These "
#~ "moose are more aggressive than their predecessors."
