#~ msgid ""
#~ "You could almost smell it before you saw it.  This toad reeks.  You're "
#~ "not quite sure what like, but it's hot and musky and it sticks in your "
#~ "nose until you're tasting it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Vous pouviez presque sentir cette chose avant de pouvoir le voir, ce "
