#~ "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single "
#~ "spell.  In your case, Cure Light Wounds.  Certainly no one ever asked "
#~ "your reasons for studying biomancy, especially after you saw that guy get "
#~ "hit by a truck running a red light and managed to stop him from bleeding "
#~ "out before the paramedics arrived.  As long as you're light on your feet, "
#~ "you won't have to worry about dying of your injuries now."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Vous étiez l'une des centaines de millions de personnes qui ne "
#~ "connaissaient qu'un seul sort, dans votre cas, Soins Mineurs. Personne ne "
#~ "vous a jamais vraiment demandé vos raisons d'étudier la biomancie, "
#~ "surtout après que vous ayez vu un gars ce faire heurter par un camion "
